DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Swing up the backyard Lindy Edition 2015. This is ou
 r warm up party for the whole weekend full of great classes and awesome mus
 ic. \nIf you registered the Workshop or Party Pass for this weekend\, pleas
 e check in at the counter tonight. \nWe are going to have our teachers Intr
 oduction on this party (staring at Ksenia & Eran\, Soina & Sinclair\, Jenny
  & Christian)\nEntrance: 8€/ 5€ for students\nBands: Dizzybop'ers (2 of Diz
 zy Birds and 2 of Swingbopers)\nDJ Impulse\n\nMore information: \nwww.swing
 upthebackyard.com\n\nParty Venue: Tempelhofer Weg 70 / Sachsendamm 93\nErdg
 eschoss in den AMBEG-Höfen\n10829 Berlin - Schöneberg
LAST-MODIFIED:20150525T201454Z
LOCATION:Tanzschule weRK36\, Tempelhofer Weg 70\, 10829 Berlin\, Germany
