  ballrooms. The Time Rag Department is fueling the time machine with Ragtim
 e and Swing music and the crowd is moving their happy feet to heat up the e
 ngine. Be ready to challenge your luck at the door – and your skills in the
  Triple du Solo – Jazz Challenge.\n\n- Join the ball dressed to impress!\n-
  Take the Surprise Taster to get started\n- Dance to great live music and a
 wesome DJs\n- Join the Triple du Solo – Jazz Challenge\n- Capture a memory 
