DESCRIPTION:Swing & Jive dance tea +\nvintage flea market in the backyard (
 if it's bad weather it's inside)\n\nSo if you have stuff from the 20's to e
 arly 60's to sell (garment\, accessoires\, vinyl\, whatever) or Retro stuff
 \, bring it over - no fee for selling\, but everybody pays the usual 4\,- €
  at the door. There are tables enough.\n\nThe cosy familiar tea dance @ Hau
 s der Sinne\, \nYstader Straße 10 - backyard \n10437 Berlin-Prenzlauer Berg
  \nwww.hausdersinneberlin.de \n\nwith DJ Capt'n K. - music for all kinds of
  dances - Lindy\, Balboa\, Shag\, Jive\, Boogie\, Stroll a. m. m. \nThey of
 fer coffee & cake and of course the usual drinks for fair prices. \n4\,- € 
 at the door. \n\npublic transfer: S-/U-Bahnst. Schönhauser Allee\, then wal
 k up the Kopenhagener Straße\, when Yster crosses\, go right in the dead en
 d street and at the end left in the backyard \n\nSwing by \ncheers \nC.K.\n
 \n\nPS:  last dance tea until the end of October\, so don't miss it....
LAST-MODIFIED:20150423T092332Z
LOCATION:Haus der Sinne\, Ystader Straße 10\, 10437 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance tea + Vintage flea market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
