 he morning sun above the river!\n\nBring your smile\, your friends and shoe
 s and coffee and breakfast rolls and join in!\n\nTime: Friday\, 18th of Sep
 tember\, 07:00am\n\nLocation: Public Spree-River Bridge between Paul-Löbe-H
 aus and Marie Elisabeth-Lüders-Haus\, Government District\n\nPublic Transpo
