DESCRIPTION:20's Swing dance party at the Bräustübl in Berlin-Friedrichshag
 en\n\nin an authentic 20's ballroom with an amazing new band from Berlin:\n
 Harald Hertel's Jazz Tigers\nplayin' original 20's Chicago- & Harlem-Hot Ja
 zz\nJoin in for Shag\, Charleston\, Blues\, Balboa\, Shimmy\, Black Bottom 
 & Lindy Jump.\n\nThe band plays 3 long sets and starts right on time at 8 p
 .m. Don't miss this great event.\nSwing music in the breaks. \nYou can have
  a formidable dinner there as well.\nSee you there: www.braeustuebl-mueggel
 see.de \n\nGet chic dressed and take the S3 from Ostkreuz direction Erkner.
