DESCRIPTION:Gitty and the Hopcats Live in der DancingSuite\n\nAm Samstag st
 ürzen uns in den Swing\, mit der atemberaubenden Livemusik von Gitty and th
 e Hopcats\nBand ab 22:00 Uhr.\nEinlass ab 21:00 Uhr.\nDer Eintritt kostet 5
 \,- Euro\,\n\nDie Musik endet\, wenn das letzte Tanzpaar das Parkett verlas
 sen hat.\nCare less – Swing more\n\n\nOn Saturday we have one of Berlins fi
 nest Newcomer Swing Bands as Guest.\nGitty and the Hopcats\n\nEntrance is 5
 \,- Euro\nEvening starts at 21:00\nBand plays at 22:00\nBefore\, between an
 d after\, the DJ will please your Ears.\nEvening ends when the last couple 
 leaves the Dancefloor.\n\nDancingSuite is very easy to find. Its located a 
 100 Meter from S-Bahnhof Landsberger Allee (Ringbahn) Use the Rear-Exit and
  go left. You will see a white 5 Floor Building. You take the Entrance „A“\
 , use lift or stairs to 3.Floor and your there.\n\nSee You. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150629T094544Z
LOCATION:DancingSuite Berlin\, Storkower Straße 140 A\, 10407 Berlin
