DESCRIPTION:Love to swing? Love to sing? How about singing swing? \n\nThe f
 amous Monster Ronsons Ichiban Karaoke is opening up their stage and their l
 ovely\, um\, cement dance floor for our swinging/stomping pleasure on Frida
 y 8th June!\n\nWe're putting together a special list of swing and 'swingabl
 e' songs for the occasion (we can throw in a few bluesy songs too for you h
 usky/melancholy singers). So start warming up your vocal chords!\n\n21:00 -
  22:30: DJ Dukeyduke will open the dancefloor\n22:20 - 01:00: Swing karaoke
  and dancing\n01:00 - 05:00: Open karaoke (all genres)\n\nNeed some liquid 
 encouragement? Ronson's has an extensive cocktail selection for you to choo
 se from\, and is giving us a special deal on the 'Hemmingway' (only €5) for
  the night.\n\nDress: To impress! Come as your favourite star of the era or
  simply in your best vintage gear. (Free drink for the best dressed)\n\nCos
 t: €5\n\nSign up for the facebook event for more details and updates!\nhttp
 s://www.facebook.com/events/137903536333912/\n\nWeb: https://www.facebook.c
 om/events/137903536333912/
LAST-MODIFIED:20120602T114322Z
