DESCRIPTION:Finally we will release the new CD "I'm gonna pick you up in re
 d dress\, baby!"\nThis has to be properly celebrated and we'll do our best 
 to host a real party. \nBe prepared for murders\, free shots\, hot music an
 d general sexieness. Everyone (!) coming in a red dress (not suit!) will ge
 t a free shot at the door.\n\n!!!!! LIVE MUSIC WILL START STRICTLY AT 22:00
  !!!!!\nso better come early.\n\nDJ's: Prof. Shorthair \nPaul Voit \n\nWe e
 xpect a lot of guests. If you want to make sure to get in you can reserve t
 ickets by posting it on the event page or write an email to dizzybirds@sync
 opation.de and we put your name on a list. The reserved tickets can be pick
 ed up until 20:30 after that\, we give them away.\n\nCover: 8-10 €\, for 15
  € you'll get the new CD and a free shot on top\nIf you wear a red dress\, 
 you'll get a free shot at the door.\n\nWe're really looking forward to see 
 have a party with all of you!\n\nHere's two songs of the new album plus a r
 ecording with amazing Meschiya Lake and Russell Welch:\nsoundcloud.com/user
 -519237538/sets/dizzy-birds
