 s a Band of up to 16 Men\, crazy about Swingmusik. There excellent – don´t 
 miss it.\n\n\nParty starts at 21:00\n\nBand plays at 22:00\n\nBefore\, Betw
 een and after the DJ will please your Ears and Legs.\n\n\nEntrance is 8\,- 
 Euro\, or you dress up a little Swing like and pay 5\,- Euro.\n\nParty ends
  when last Couple leaves the Dance Floor.\n\n\nDancingSuite is very easy to
  find. Only 100 Meters from S-Bahnhof Landsberger Allee (Ringbahn). You lea
 ve trough the Rearexit. Go left and you see a white Building with 5 Floors.
  You take entrance A\, then elevator or stairs to 3. Floor. And youre there
 .\n\n\n\n
