 e entry (but maybe buy a drink at the bar\, so we can keep the event free)\
 n \nWhat is Blues Dancing you ask? It's a social dance focused on partner c
 onnection\, improvisation and natural body movement. Whether you're a begin
 ner or an experienced dancer\, whether you are a guy and want to try follow
 ing or a girl leader - all who like to dance are welcome!\n \nFor more info
  & details about the pre-party Blues intro class\, visit http://www.bluesbe
