 NGS\, plus swing dance crash course with SWING PATROL BERLIN and a LOTTERY 
 and several vendors. Pre-sales tickets are now on sale.\n\nwww.capital-swin
 g.de\n\n**********************************************************\nAdam Ha
 ll and the Velvet Playboys are somewhat of an institution in Australia. For
 med in 2005\, the band is renowned for its captivating live performances\, 
 which are marked by slick presentation and raw energy.\n\nAdam has played w
 ith Big Jay McNeely\, Syl Johnson\, Betty Harris\, Richard Jackson\, Ray Co
 llins Hot Club\, James Morrison\, Rolf Harris\, Frank Foster (Count Basie O
 rchestra)\, Don Burrows\, Shirley Horn’s band\, Vanessa Amorossi and Grace 
 Knight to name just a few. Enjoy some rockin'\, jumpin'\, jazz\, blues\, sw
 ing and more. BACK AGAIN TO EUROPE FOR 2015!\n\n***************************
 *******************************\nLong John & his Ballroom Kings invite to t
 heir record release party of their jive version of "Blue Suede Shoes"\, whi
 ch is a duet feat. Huelyn Duvall from Texas. Links (and vid) via capital-sw
 ing.de\n\nMD
