 ng of the 30's/40's/50's\; Jive + Boogie Woogie of the 40's/50's\; \nThis t
 ime with a lot of German Swing\, Jive & Boogie (not all the time) from the 
 30's to the early 60's:\n"man swingt deutsch"\nwww.hausdersinneberlin.de \n
 Huge dance floor and cosy atmosphere\, fair prices for the drinks\, \nEntry
 : 4\,- € in 20's-50's style\; casual 5\,- €\; and attention ladies:\n2\,- €
  in Dirndl\n\nYou will love it and of course - you can ask the DJ for a dan
 ce.... \nSend your music requests to: mail@hepmarket.de \n\nPublic transfer
 : U2/circle line Schönhauser Allee - then walk up the Kopenhagener Str.\, w
 hen Ystaderstr. crosses go right\, at the end of the dead end street go lef
 t in the back yard\, there diagonal left is the entrance. \n\nLooking forwa
 rd to meet you there. \nkeep swingin' \nC.K.
