 e 40's/50's\; \nwww.hausdersinneberlin.de \nHuge dance floor and cosy atmos
 phere\, fair prices for the drinks\, \n\nYou will love it and of course - y
 ou can ask the DJ for a dance.... \nSend your music requests to: mail@hepma
