DESCRIPTION:Adlon Swinging Sunday- A new era at the Hotel Adlon Kempinski B
 erlin\n\nPrice:  79€ per person - Special fares available upon request\n\nD
 escription: A new era at the Hotel Adlon Kempinski Berlin\nThe twenties coi
 ned the Adlon myth: world stars\, such as Marlene Dietrich\, Josephine Bake
 r and Anna Pawlowa were regulars at the hotel. In reminiscene of these Gold
 en Years the luxury hotel will revive an old tradition from February 2014 o
 nwards: the legendary tea dance. \nBecome a part of this new tradition!Join
  us on a Sunday afternoon and shake a leg to the music of the Metropolitan 
 Orchestra on our dance stage. We serve classic afternoon tea\, coffee&tea a
 s well as one glass of champagne.\n\nReservations: swingingsunday.adlon@kem
 pinski.com or +49 30 2261 1154\nhttp://www.kempinski.com/en/berlin/hotel-ad
 lon/dining/adlon-swinging-sunday/adlon-swinging-sunday\n\nWe are looking fo
 rward to welcoming you!\nYour Hotel Adlon Kempinski Team\n\nJH
LAST-MODIFIED:20140311T155958Z
LOCATION:Hotel Adlon Kempinski\, Unter den Linden\, Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Adlon Swinging Sunday mit dem Metropolitan Orchestra
TRANSP:OPAQUE
