DESCRIPTION:Hot Jazz Festival with 4 bands and dancefloor - \ndance Charles
 ton\, Shag\, Balboa\, Black Bottom and Blues to great live music of the roa
 ring twenties:\n\nThe Seven End Stompers      - Dixieland  -               
    7 piece band     \nInfo: http://www.gritzka.de/jazz/stompersinfo.htm\nHa
 rald Hertel's Jass Tigers    - Harlem Combo Jazz  -   5 piece band   \nVide
 o: http://youtu.be/hS2ZOAw5i8c\nDorothe's Jazz Serenaders   - New Orleans J
 azz -        5 piece band  \nVideo: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3va3INhd
 wIk\nJazzotic Five                       - Chicago-Jazz -               5 p
 iece band  \nVideo: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRwRdY9IG_8\n\nAll bands
  play an authentic style.\n\nGet in the cellar: 13:30h / 1:30 p.m.\nStart o
 f 1st live band: 2 p.m.\n\nEvery band plays an hour\, then 20 min. break wi
 th Hot Jazz from CD.\nEventually Jam Session after the last band.\n\nThe Kn
 ofel Restaurant opens 12:30h - so you could have lunch before.\nwww.knoblau
 chrestaurant.de\n\nPublic transfer: \nS- und Tram-Bahnstation Prenzlauer Al
 lee\nmap: http://www.knoblauchrestaurant.de/restaurant.html#5\n\nfee at the
  door: 12\,- €\n\nSee you there\nC.K.
LAST-MODIFIED:20141016T180059Z
