 b 21:00 Uhr.\nDer Eintritt kostet 5\,- Euro\,\n\nDie Musik endet\, wenn das
  letzte Tanzpaar das Parkett verlassen hat.\nCare less – Swing more\n\n\nOn
  Friday the 06.03. we have one of Berlins finest Swing Bands as Guest.\nCar
 eless Cats will make your feet dance like crazy.\n\nEntrance is 5\,- Euro\n
 Evening starts at 21:00\nBand plays at 22:00\nBefore\, between and after\, 
 the DJ will please your Ears.\nEvening ends when the last couple leaves the
  Dancefloor.\n\nDancingSuite is very easy to find. Its located a 100 Meter 
 from S-Bahnhof Landsberger Allee (Ringbahn) Use the Rear-Exit and go left. 
