DESCRIPTION:The "Sally Bowles" in Schöneberg is a nice cosy Café ca. 5 minu
 tes to walk from the U-Bahnstation Nollendorfplatz. It has a 20's atmospher
 e and great drinks like Absinth\, nonalcoholic cocktails a.s.o. (you can ea
 t there as well)\nHarald's Jam Swingers play authentic Swing + New Orleans 
 Jazz in the first set (this time with Axel Obert on doublebass\, Wolfgang G
 aller on Solo guitar and Harald Hertel on rhythm guitar/vocal). In the seco
 nd set the Jam guests can join in. The live music starts right on time at 8
 :30 p.m. and ends at 10:30 p.m.\nwww.sally-bowles.de\nThis event takes plac
 e every two weeks.\nCheck it out.\n\nCheers\nC.K.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150430T015716Z
