DESCRIPTION:Ein ganz besonderer Gipsy-Jazz Quartet entführt Euch in die Dja
 ngo Reinhardt Zeit und versetzt Euere Hüften in den heißen Swing.\nBringt E
 ure 20's - Stimmung mit!\n\nDoors: 20:00 Uhr Start @ 21:00 Uhr \, after the
  show a DJ with swingy sets\n\nDANCERS ARE WELCOME!\n\nThe Stachelites is a
  completely new sounding Berlin-based Gypsy-jazz quartet made up of top sol
 o guitarist Janko Stachlengro Lauenberger (Sinti-Swing Berlin / Martin Weis
 s Family Band) and violinist Daniel Weltlinger (Lulo Reinhardt Latin-Swing 
 Project / Karsten Troyke) with a driving rhythm section provided by Giovann
 i Steinbach on rhythm guitar and Max Hartmann on double bass. Three origina
 l Berliners (two German-Sinti\, one Japanese-German)\, and one new Berliner
  (Australian born of French/Hungarian/Israeli family background) playing st
 raight from the tradition firmly placed in the 21st Century Gypsy-jazz with
  a new sound in a new age from a renewed city…
