DESCRIPTION:Allnight Swing- and Jive-dancin' with DJ Capt'n K.\nhttp://www.
 youtube.com/watch?v=SFYDs_IrzSk\n\nRussen Swingo mit DJ Capt’n K.\n\nSWING 
 & JIVE NIGHT goes Russian Style…  -  also heute mit viel Swing\, Jive und ä
 hnlichem aus Russland und allerlei exotischen Tanzkrachern -- natürlich nic
 ht den ganzen Abend… \nEintritt: im Russen-Look 4\,- € (Euch wird schon was
  einfallen)\; sonst 5\,- €.\n\nVintage-feeling and great music  --  Swing o
 f the 30's/40's/50's\; Jive + Boogie Woogie of the 40's/50's\; \nwww.hausde
 rsinneberlin.de \nHuge dance floor and cosy atmosphere\, fair prices for th
 e drinks\, \nEntry: 4\,- € in Russian style\; casual 5\,- € \n\nYou will lo
 ve it and of course - you can ask the DJ for a dance.... \nSend your music 
 requests to: mail@hepmarket.de \n\nPublic transfer: U2/circle line Schönhau
 ser Allee - then walk up the Kopenhagener Str.\, when Ystaderstr. crosses g
 o right\, at the end of the dead end street go left in the back yard\, ther
 e diagonal left is the entrance. \n\nLooking forward to meet you there. \nk
 eep swingin' \nC.K.
