DESCRIPTION:31.12.\nSWINGING SILVESTERBALL\n\nRing in the new year with us 
 in style\, for an elegant 1920’s inspired ball! Two live hot jazz bands\, s
 wing dancing\, festive food\, performances\, burlesque\, surprises\, and mo
 re!\n\n//19:30 DOOR OPENS\n\n//20:00 - 22:00 HOT JAZZ & HOT FOOD\nSilvester
  Swing Orchestra - A special open hot jazz session as members of the popula
 r bands DIZZYBIRDS and DJANGO LASSI come together - just for us on this spe
 cial night!!\n\nPlus a festive feast will be served: gourmet handmade soup 
 (Vodka Tomato Basil/Italian Wedding Meatball)\, bread\, cheese\, and festiv
 e finger food. Come early to get your plate!\n\n//23:00 SWING TASTER \nLear
 n the basics so you can swing in style\, with a taster lesson from SWING PA
 TROL BERLIN!\n\n//00:00 MIDNIGHT EXTRAVAGANZA!\nWe have a very special surp
 rise planned for you at midnight to ring in the new year with a bang!\n\n//
 01:00 RED HOT BURLESQUE\nA spicy Silvester number from BANA BANANA to put y
 ou in the mood.\n\n//02:00 SWING INTO 2014 WITH THE GOODNIGHT CIRCUS\nThe G
 oodnight Circus of gipsy jazz and swing to get you starting 2014 on the rig
 ht foot!\n\n//PLUS\, ALL NIGHT LONG:\n*DJ Seraphim will keep you moving to 
 jazz\, swing and gipsy!\n*Surprises and performances!\n*Feuerzangebowle!\n*
 Bleigießen!\n*Tarot Readings!\n*Absinth!\n\n\nTickets: 35€ (including food 
 and the whole program!)\nPresales: www.tickets.per-aspera.net\nEvent: https
 ://www.facebook.com/events/1434191173459625/\nDresscode: 1920’s / Elegant\n
 JH
