DESCRIPTION:Please join us again at the cozy Kaffeehaus Atopia for a night 
 of Blues dancing!\n\n-22:00 Blues Dance Party. See the Facebook event for d
 etails on the Blues intro class right before the party.\n\nWe're looking fo
 rward to seeing you all on the dance floor!\n\nWhat is Blues Dancing you as
 k? It's a social dance focused on partner connection\, improvisation and na
 tural body movement. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced dancer\, w
