DESCRIPTION:It returns! Love to swing? Love to sing? Ever wanted to be a st
 ar? No? Well\, now's your chance to be dragged on stage by drunken lindy ho
 ppers! \n\nThe famous Monster Ronsons Ichiban Karaoke is opening up their s
 tage and their lovely\, um\, cement dance floor for our singing/stomping pl
 easure on Friday February 22nd!\n\nWe're putting together a special list of
  swing and 'swingable' songs for the occasion (we can throw in a few bluesy
  songs too for you husky/melancholic singers). So start warming up your voc
 al chords!\n\nWe'll kick off the night with some tunes to warm up our feet 
 and dance off our nerves\, ready for the first brave souls to jump on stage
  at 10:30. Then we can sing and swing the night away!\n\nNeed some liquid e
 ncouragement? Ronson's has an extensive cocktail selection for you to choos
 e from.\n\nThe music will be strictly swing/blues only until 1am\, at which
  point the regular karaoke goers will join us and you can put on your rock 
 n' roll/pop/romantic ballad/thrash metal... shoes and party 'til dawn!\n\nD
 ress: To impress! Come as your favourite star of the day or simply in your 
 best vintage gear. (Free drink for the best dressed)\n\nCost: €5\n\nHeeeeer
 e's the song list:\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/ccc?key=0AiGhf9bM8t
 u3dG4tekxvNmgxNVJLaUowbHd4WmVkbHc#gid=0\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/events/3
 16297648471028/
