DESCRIPTION:It’s Easter! We thought that this is reason enough for a celebr
 ation. So we put all our energy together to organize a thrilling Swingin‘ F
 riday special.\n\nTo really celebrate this occasion\, we invited one of Ber
 lin's finest Swing Dance Bands\, the Andreas Hofschneider Quintett\, which 
 most of you propably already know from events like Jump for Joy\, Jazz Up y
 our Lindy! and the Berlin Balboa Weekend:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?
 v=pRrd6gZT6Lk\n\nBut not alone with that\, this evening is also happening a
 s the inofficial pre-party of Swingularity (www.swingularity.de)\, propably
  Berlin's geekiest and most intense Lindy Hop Camp. This means that not onl
 y will there be the perfect band\, but also many outstanding dancers from a
 ll over europe\, including Kevin & Jo\, which are not even from Europe.\n\n
 Can it be even better than that? Yes\, with your participation\, that's why
  we held the price really affordable - so come and enjoy this evening with 
 us.\n\nEntrance only 7 €!\n\nAlso visit our official website:\nhttp://swing
 step.com/berlin/dance-to-live-music/\n\nAnd join the FB event:\nhttps://www
 .facebook.com/events/223233888024489/\n\n\n*Swingin' Friday is happening ev
 ery other Friday\n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20160303T144124Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Jeder ist tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8\, 10245 Be
 rlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swingin' Friday LIVE: Andreas Hofschneider Quintett @ SwingStep - J
 eder ist tanzbar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
