 e and great drinks like Absinth\, nonalcoholic cocktails a.s.o. (you can ea
 t there as well)\nHarald's Jam Swingers play authentic Swing + New Orleans 
 Jazz in the first set. In the second set the Jam guests can join in. The li
 ve music starts right on time at 8:30 p.m. and ends at 10:30 p.m.\nwww.sall
 y-bowles.de\nThis event takes place every two weeks.\nCheck it out.\n\nChee
 rs\nC.K.
