DESCRIPTION:\n\nDescription:\nJoin us at the cozy Kaffeehaus Atopia for a s
 pecial night of Blues dancing! Catherine Palmier is in town for her "Blues 
 and Jazz Roots" workshop - and the post-workshop party is happening at Atop
 ia.\nThe party starts at 10pm. No cover (but consider buying a drink at the
  bar so we can keep this event free).\n\n\n\nWhat is Blues Dancing you ask?
  It's a social dance focused on partner connection\, improvisation and natu
 ral body movement. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced dancer\, whe
 ther you are a guy and want to try following or a girl leader - all who lik
 e to dance are welcome!\nJH
LAST-MODIFIED:20140428T095946Z
LOCATION:Atopia Kaffeehaus Berlin\, Prenzlauer Allee 187\, Berlin\, Deutsch
 land
