 s play Swing for dancers -- Lindy\, Balboa\, Shag\, Jive.\nhttp://youtu.be/
 qJqMHmj2as4\n\nThe band plays 3 long sets. Swing music in the breaks. \nSee
  you there: \nwww.braeustuebl-mueggelsee.de \n\nGet out your evening dress 
 and take the S3 from Ostkreuz direction Erkner. From S-Bahnst. Friedrichsha
 gen you can take the Tram (60 + 61) up the Bölschestraße - just 3 stations 
 (Müggelseedamm/Bölschestr.) to the Bräustübl. \n\nCheers C.K.
