  based on Swing. They switch\, they withstand competition\, they do there b
 est to keep you dancing all night long. Be there!\n\nParty starts at 21:00h
 \nEntrance: 2\,- Euro\n\nIt's very easy to find. Use the rear exit at S- La
 ndsberger Allee. That's the Ringbahn. Go left. You see a white building onl
 y 100 meter away. Use the entrance A to 3rd floor (elevator or stairs). You
  can't miss it.\n\nAlso\, there are a lot of free parking spaces.\n\n
