DESCRIPTION:Where: Nikolaikirchplatz\, directly in front of the church entr
 ance\n\n18:00 - 19:00 Social Dance with DJ Mad Oli\n19:00 - 19:30 Charlesto
 n beginner taster\n19:30 - 20:00 Social Dance with DJ Mad Oli\n20:00 - 22:0
 0 MIXED MUSIC Social Dance with DJ*\n\nWe recommend you to come at 18:00\, 
 because then there will be a full hour of social dancing to swing music. Af
 ter the taster it will be music of different styles\, so people can also da
 nce foxtrott\, waltz and tango. But the DJ is very attentive and if we are 
 many swing dancers\, then there will be swing regulary.\n\nAlso there will 
 be a jazz and swing band playing on a stage close by the spreeufer (at the 
 Georg-Statue) from 19:00. The band is called Rudi-Leipold-Band. So maybe if
  you don't join the taster\, go there and check out the band - and then com
