CREATED:20161216T182615Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy dancing to live music? We hope you do\, because th
 is is how Lindy Hop was born - in the big ballrooms of Harlem in the 30s. W
 e want to help bringing this spirit back to life\, which is why we are now 
 organizing a Swingin' Friday with live music once a month with our local he
 ro bands from Berlin - and occasionally with a popular Swing orhestra from 
 abroad.\n\nIn January we invited for you Chat Noir\, an international acous
 tig swing quartet composed of soprano saxophone\, acoustic guitar\, double 
 bass and vibraphone. This original instrumentation creates a distinctive so
 und!\n\nThese four musicians from Germany\, Canada and Corsica play swing c
 lassics of the 1920s and 1930s\, gipsy-bossas\, Corsican folksongs and Russ
 ian gypsies in the style of the legendary guitarist Django Reinhardt. With 
 original arrangements\, fiery improvisations and virtuosity\, Chat Noir ins
 pire the audience wherever they play!\n\nTickets at the door: 7€\n\nJoin an
 d share the FB event: https://www.facebook.com/events/1816318415309579/\n\n
 -of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20170605T171140Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Jeder ist tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8\, 10245 Be
 rlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance to live music with Chat Noir @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
