DESCRIPTION:<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LRdij2xyO-0" targe
 t="_blank">Harald Hertel's Jass Tigers</a> playing on a boat on the river D
 ahme. The boat starts from Zeuthen. Organizer is the Jazztreff Karlshorst. 
 <a href="https://www.jazztreff.com/kopie-von-18-band-3" target="_blank">Inf
 o</a>.<br>Ticket order here:<br>Phone: 030 567 68 92 &nbsp\; Mo - Fr &nbsp\
 ;3 to 7 p.m.<br>E-Mail: &nbsp\;<a href="mailto:post@jazztreff.de" target="_
 blank">post@jazztreff.de</a><br>Embarkment 5:30 p.m. &nbsp\;Take off: 6 p.m
 . &nbsp\;Docking: 9:30 p.m.<br>A summer boat trip with roaring twenties liv
 e music - have fun with <a href="https://www.harald-hertel-swing.de/swing_h
