DESCRIPTION:What a better way to celebrate Frankie's birthday than by danci
 ng to a live band like he used to?\n\nMoon Glow is an international band ba
 sed in Berlin. The six musicians are passionate for Swing and give a new in
 terpretation to 1930’s music\, with their young and fresh approach.\n\nThe 
 three ladies on the woodwinds blast out with the power of a big band\, whil
 e the energized rhythm section throws you off your chair with driving dynam
 ics. All band members are graduates of the Jazz Institute Berlin and the Co
 nservatorium van Amsterdam. The name “Moon Glow” derives from Benny Goodman
 ’s signature tune. The versatile repertoire was arranged by established RIA
 S Big Band musician Gregoire Peters.\n\nTickets at the door: 7€\n\n-of-
