DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy dancing to live music? We hope you do\, because th
 is is how Lindy Hop was born - in the big ballrooms of Harlem in the 30s. W
 e want to help bringing this spirit back to life\, which is why we are orga
 nizing a Swingin' Friday with live music once a month with our local hero b
 ands from Berlin - and occasionally with a popular Swing orchestra from abr
 oad.\n\nThis month we have invited the Lionrockets\, based in Neukölln (you
  might know them from their regular sessions at Alter Löwe Rhein)\, playing
  a very danceable mix of Swing and swinging Bebop tunes.\n\nCheck them out 
 here:\nhttps://soundcloud.com/lionrockets\n\n\nEntrance: 12€\n\n-of-
