DESCRIPTION:Gypsy-Swing\n\n Shine your dancing-shoes and come over to dance
  our wonderful wooden dancefloor.\n\n „The Stachelites“ will deliver the so
 und that make your hearts swing and wants your feet move!\n\n (The Stacheli
 tes is a completely fresh sounding Berlin-based Gypsy-jazz quartet to quint
 et made up of top solo guitarist Janko Lauenberger (Sinti-Swing Berlin / Ma
 rtin Weiss Family Band) and violinist Daniel Weltlinger (Lulo Reinhardt Lat
 in-Swing Project / Karsten Troyke) with a driving rhythm section provided b
 y Giovanni Steinbach and Santino Bamberger on rhythm guitar. Three original
  Berliners (three German-Sinti)\, and one new Berliner (Australian born of 
 French/Austro-Hungarian/Israeli family background) playing straight from th
 e tradition firmly placed in the 21st Century Gypsy-jazz with a new sound i
 n a new age from a renewed city.)\n\n\nFree entrance\, but please donate to
  he hat that goes around!\n\nDon´t bring your own drinks…..we have enough a
 t the bar!!\n\n \n\n \n\n\n 
