DESCRIPTION:Start your weekend with a good drink\, a healthy chat and a nig
 ht full of awesome social dancing. <br><br>Swingin' Friday happens twice a 
 month with rotating DJs / Bands  &lt\;3<br><br><b>Time to Shine</b><br><br>
 On March 24th 2017 we started Time to Shine with the 1:1 Showcase. Almost t
 wo years have passed and Time to Shine has become a tradition that we enjoy
  keeping and sharing. That’s why we are happy to announce that the 3rd edit
 ion of 1:1 Showcase will take place on March 15th!<br><br>𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝗱𝗼𝗲𝘀 
 𝘁𝗵𝗲 “𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝘀𝗼𝗻𝗴 - 𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗺𝗶𝗻𝘂𝘁𝗲” 𝘄𝗼𝗿𝗸?<br>Everyone choreo
 graphs one minute to the same song. This way we get to see how each dancer 
 manifests their own interpretation to the same music.<br><br>𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝘁𝗼 𝗽
 𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗶𝗽𝗮𝘁𝗲?<br>Fill up the registration form*<br>Solo\, duo or gr
 oup - the number of participants per act is up to you.<br>The 1:1 Showcase 
 is limited to a maximum of 10 acts.<br><br>* register here:<br><a href="htt
 ps://bit.ly/2TshDsH" id="ow3841" __is_owner="true">https://bit.ly/2TshDsH</
 a><br><br><br>Entrance: 2€<br><br>-ac-
