DESCRIPTION:So! We will try dancing again at the Jockel Biergarten- we will
  unfortunately not be able to dance in the old spot as the neighbors have c
 omplained- so we'll try out another spot in the Biergarten. It's very promi
 sing\, though we need to prepare it first if we're going to turn it into a 
 lovely dancefloor. This is where you can help- come on by for a tryout\, an
 d we'll be able to see if this can work!\n\nWe'll set up a small test floor
  in the area we'd like to use. Space will be tight on the test floor- there
  won't be tons of space for swingouts always and close dancing will probabl
 y be a better option most of the time\, honestly- but there will be dancing
  indoors (with the big doors open to the garden) as well. Come on by\, we'r
 e all looking forward to a lovely dancing season with you!\n\nhttps://www.f
 acebook.com/events/602232926920889/
