DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY EDITION\nNou has another party on Saturday this week so 
 we'll try a Sunday dance. There will be cake. (Free entry if you bring a ho
 me-made cake!)\n\nLive music\, Count Basie\, hot feet\, cool parquet- conti
 nuing the tradition of lofty Saturday dances\, we'll dance way up high at N
 ou Tango. Two rooms\, hot swing on the main floor and more swinging variety
  in the backroom. If you need a break from moving it on the floor\, kick ba
 ck in salon seats and enjoy the show- or the night lights of the city!\n\nP
 laying hot swinging jazz with Nou's beautiful old piano and other fine jazz
  implements at 17h- the Swingboppers!\n\nIn the backroom: Bla Bla Balboa or
  Mood Indigo\, depends on how we're feeling that day.\n\nParty entry 7-10€\
 n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/1798251377082599/
