DESCRIPTION:After a summer break we start again\, now once a month at satur
 day\nCandy Swing @ weRK36 in Schöneberg\nA very sophisticated venue with 2 
 lovely dance floors on the 2nd floor. We play the same music in all 2 rooms
 . We go from all kind of swing music and it will be a great mix of Lindy Ho
 p and Balboa. Sometimes slow music. We would like to bring very different s
 tyle of dancers through the variety of the music. \n\nCome by and Claire wi
 ll bring her best collection of her all Swing Dance Life!\nEintrance: 5€ \n
 \nIf you are a beginner join Claire’s taster class from 19.00 - 20.00 h\nFe
 e: € 8 incl. Party\n\nweRK36: S-Schönberg/S-Südkreuz - Tempelhofer Weg 70 /
  Sachsendamm 93\, 10829 Berlin\n(*Please check you find the right Tempelhof
 er Weg! There are two of them in Berlin \;)
