DESCRIPTION:Cats and Dinosaurs return to Berlin! The six members of Cats an
 d Dinosaurs aren't just dancers- they're musicians too. They write and play
  swinging music with lyrics that don't shy away from politics- and they put
  on a pretty good show!\n\nThis time we'll dance once again on the fine flo
 or at Nou Tango. The home of one of the best dancefloors in Berlin\, Nou is
  extremely cozy\, with easy ambiance and a relaxed atmosphere.\n\n20:00 Dan
 cefloor opens with DJ\n21:30-23:30 Live music with Cats and Dinosaurs\n23:3
 0-close DJ\n\nParty entry 8-12€\, sliding scale.\n\ncatsanddinosaurs.com\nk
 eep swingin'! berlinhop.com\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/292898064770
 839/
