DESCRIPTION:Live music\, Count Basie\, hot feet\, cool parquet- continuing 
 the tradition of lofty Saturday dances\, we'll dance way up high at Nou Tan
 go. Two rooms\, hot swing on the main floor and more swinging variety in th
 e backroom. If you need a break from moving it on the floor\, kick back in 
 salon seats and enjoy the show- or the night lights of the city!\n\nPlaying
  hot swinging jazz from 22h with Nou's beautiful old piano and other fine j
 azz implements- The Swingboppers!\n\nThe Swingboppers are:\nHannes Krause- 
 trumpet\, guit\, bass\nDaniel Duspiwa- sax\, guit\, bass\nSofiane Atta- sax
  \, guit\, bass\nMatthieu Baud- double bass\nFabian Trommel- drums\nFlorian
  Zeller- piano\n\nIn the backroom tonight: Mood Indigo. (Or\, as we sometim
 es like to call it\, the blues.)\n\nEntry 7-10€\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com
 /events/1598055300494416/
LAST-MODIFIED:20161012T172506Z
LOCATION:Nou Tango Berlin\, Chausseestr 102
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
