DESCRIPTION:Come fly with us: we'll shake and sway against the imposing bac
 kdrop of the gloriously huge Hangar 1 at the former Tempelhof airport\, all
  accompanied by the hot swing music of its heyday. Hangar 1 is the Tentaja 
 cultural center- because some people always ask\, here it is once again: th
 e dance takes place indoors!<br><br>Feel free to bring your own drinks- but
  take the bottles back with you. That said\, please don't bring glass bottl
 es. Coffee has a 98% probability of being available. Cake is possible as we
 ll. (though you could always bake one and bring it to share!)<br><br>Eintri
 tt: frei\, Spenden herzlich erbeten.<br><br>keep swingin'! <a href="http://
 berlinhop.com">berlinhop.com</a><br><br>https://www.facebook.com/events/415
 632202539777/
