DESCRIPTION:---- Event for dancers & for lovers of the good things in life 
 ----\nThe summer is there and you want to dance outside ? Then join us for 
 our Swingin Glaspalast on Saturday 11th of August!\n\nDance in this beautif
 ul and central location in Berlin! Join for our drop-in beginner class befo
 re and learn your first swing steps. Then keep dancing to the nice tunes of
  DJ Crémant & Guests!\n\nSchedule:\n☀ 8 - 12.30 p.m..: Social Party with DJ
  Crémant & Guests (5€ / 4€ red. )\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/799451
 123593734/\n\n\nAddress: Glaspalast\, Schönhauser Allee 176\, 10119 Berlin\
