BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20170421T220000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20170422T020000
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:nd3oajj78qugdhno8v70kagi7k_R20170120T210000@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20170421T220000
CREATED:20161216T182615Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy dancing to live music? We hope you do\, because th
 is is how Lindy Hop was born - in the big ballrooms of Harlem in the 30s. W
 e want to help bringing this spirit back to life\, which is why we are now 
 organizing a Swingin' Friday with live music once a month with our local he
 ro bands from Berlin - and occasionally with a popular Swing orchestra from
  abroad.\n\nAndreas Hofschneider and his gang are one of the most popular S
 wing combos in and around Berlin. Why? Because they play sharp like a Suzie
  Q and are on the spot like a Freeze Turn. The Quintett specializes in the 
 1930s Benny Goodman's style. The repertoire contains titles that resemble o
 ld sound recordings from the USA of the Swing Era. The sound color of the q
 uintett is their hallmark: the instruments of the members date back to the 
 1930s.\n\nIf you are around for Workshops you propably have heard them alre
 ady. They play regulary in Berlins biggest swing dance events like Jump for
  Joy\, Cirque du Solo\, Jazz up Your Lindy and Berlin Balboa Weekend – and 
 now are starting to conquer Europe with their sound being invited to events
  like Lindy Shock in Budapest and Minor Swing in Gothenburg.\n\nTickets at 
 the door: 10€\n\nJoin & Share the FB event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/event
 s/197699397393841/\n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20170605T171140Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Jeder ist tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8\, 10245 Be
 rlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance to live music with Andreas Hofschneider Quintet @ SwingStep B
 erlin
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20180122T211500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20180123T001500
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:jb4l1dp8ibs3b2ba0fdbrln524_R20180115T201500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20180122T211500
CREATED:20140317T162243Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you like dancing to live music? GREAT! Then you should check
  out our new live swing jam session:\n\nThe phrase "jam session" came about
  in the 1920s when white and black musicians would congregate after their r
 egular paying gigs\, to play the jazz they could not play in the bands they
  played in. When Bing Crosby would attend these sessions\, the musicians wo
 uld say he was "jammin' the beat"\, since he would clap on the one and the 
 three. Thus these sessions became known as "jam sessions".\n\nHow cool woul
 d it be to dance to this improvised music! Let's get swing musicians and da
 ncers together once a month in our Monday Marmalade and swing it all the ni
 ght through!\n\n2€ at the door. If you appreciate the live music\, please t
 ip the band some extra ♥  \n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20180309T115835Z
LOCATION:Marie-Antoinette\, Holzmarktstraße 15-18 \, Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Marmalade: Live Swing Jam @ Marie-Antoinette (SwingStep)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
