DESCRIPTION:It's official. This will be the last opportunity to dance at ou
 r beloved Tanzbar.\n\nOf course we have invited some very special guests fo
 r that occasion:\n\nAndreas Hofschneider and his gang are one of the most p
 opular Swing combos in and around Berlin. Why? Because they play sharp like
  a Suzie Q and are on the spot like a Freeze Turn. The band specializes in 
 the 1930s Benny Goodman’s style. The repertoire contains titles that resemb
 le old sound recordings from the USA of the Swing Era. The sound color of t
 he band is their hallmark: the instruments of the members date back to the 
 1930s.\n\nIf you are around for Workshops you propably have heard them alre
 ady. They play regulary in Berlins' biggest swing dance events like Jump fo
 r Joy\, Jazz up Your Lindy\, Berlin Balboa Weekend and Cirque du Solo – and
  now are starting to conquer Europe with their sound being invited to event
 s like Lindy Shock in Budapest and Minor Swing in Gothenburg.\n\nEntrance: 
 7€\n\n-of-
