DESCRIPTION:JAZZ BATTLE: The California Feetwarmers vs. The Dizzy Birds  \n
 \nMasters of ragtime\, Dixieland blues and early swing\, the Grammy nominat
 ed California Feetwarmers (Los Angeles) are renowned for an earthy depth of
  character that sets them apart from others who have followed that throwbac
 k path to New Orleans\, circa 1920.\nTheir Grammy nomination ('Best America
 n Roots Performance') resulted from a collaboration with Keb' Mo' on his la
 test album 'BluesAmericana'. He sought them out as he wanted it to be “a jo
 yous thing – a party\,” he told The Wall Street Journal in a recent intervi
 ew.\n…Now couldn’t we all do with a bit of that in our lives right now!?\n\
 nSure we can: Just imagine those 7 Californian Feetwarmers on one stage wit
 h Berlin's hottest Jazz band\, The Dizzy Birds...\n\nYes\, it's going to ha
 ppen one happy Saturday night at Roadrunner's Paradise. \n\nDJ: Prof. Short
 hair\n\nPre sale: 13€\nAt the door: 15€\n\nPRESALE STARTED NOW!! \nBuy tick
 ets online: http://syncopation.de/tickets\n\nhttp://www.californiafeetwarme
 rs.com/\nhttp://syncopation.de/bands/dizzy-birds/\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160707T093305Z
LOCATION:Roadrunners Rock & Motor Club\, Saarbrücker Str. 24\, 10405 Berlin
 \, Germany
