 kdrop of the gloriously huge Hangar 1 at the former Tempelhof airport\, all
  accompanied by the hot swing music of its heyday. Hangar 1 is the Tentaja 
 cultural center- because some people always ask\, here it is once again: th
 e dance takes place indoors!\n\nFeel free to bring your own drinks- but tak
 e the bottles back with you. That said\, please don't bring glass bottles. 
 Coffee has a 98% probability of being available. Cake is possible as well. 
 (though you could always bake one and bring it to share!)\n\nEintritt: frei
 \, Spenden herzlich erbeten.\n\nkeep swingin'! berlinhop.com\n\nfacebook.co
