CREATED:20181121T110452Z
DESCRIPTION:Come fly with us: this Sunday we'll shake and sway against the 
 imposing backdrop of the gloriously huge Hangar 1 at the former Tempelhof a
 irport\, all accompanied by the hot swing music of its heyday.<br><br>Note:
  this is the test flight. We are planning improvements to the space to make
  it nicer for dancing\, but would like to give it an informal try first to 
 see if there's anything we're missing. The floor is smooth\, danceable ston
 e- PLEASE take care of yourself and wear shoes with soles that will be nice
  to your feet\, ankles\, and knees.<br><br>Please bring your own drinks- an
 d take the bottles back with you. (There's no bar set up or similar.) We'll
  see about offering coffee or something like that- who knows- maybe we'll e
 ven get someone to bake a cake!<br><br>Eintritt: frei\, Spenden herzlich er
 beten.<br>The event takes place in Hangar 1 at the "Tentaja" cultural cente
 r. There's a small map and directions here: <a href="http://berlinhop.com/t
 hfmap/">berlinhop.com/thfmap/</a><br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/
 events/506371839860566/" target="_blank">https://www.facebook.com/events/50
 6371839860566/</a><br><br>keep swingin'! <a href="http://berlinhop.com" tar
 get="_blank">berlinhop.com</a>
