 arties.\nFair prices for drinks. \nNo fee but put someting in the hat for t
 he great musicians.\nThe house band are:\nBernd Kuchenbecker - double bass\
 nStefanie Unger - fiddle\nWolfgang Galler - solo guitar\nHarald Hertel - rh
