DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy dancing to live music? We hope you do\, because th
 is is how Lindy Hop was born - in the big ballrooms of Harlem in the 30s. W
 e want to help bringing this spirit back to life\, which is why we are now 
 organizing a Swingin' Friday with live music once a month with our local he
 ro bands from Berlin - and occasionally with a popular Swing orchestra from
  abroad.\n\nTHE SWEET SIMONES are a Swing\, Jazz and Jump Blues band from M
 unich\, Germany. Combining the sizzling energy of the great ballrooms with 
 some cool Las Vegas elegance and the classy styles of the Big Bands\, these
  nine musicians set the Swing era aglow again! Their repertoire features fr
 esh arrangements of classic 30's and 40's swing tunes\, hot original compos
 itions plus the best Neo-Swing songs of today. The vibrant energy from sing
 er\, horn section and stirring solos draws not only Swing fans to the dance
  floor...\nKEEP SWINGING!\n\nTickets at the door: 7€\n\nJoin & Share the FB
  event: \nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/658820780986080/\n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20170605T171140Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Jeder ist tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8\, 10245 Be
 rlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance to live music with The Sweet Simones @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
