DESCRIPTION:The Main Party of Swing up the backyard Blues Edition 2017 is t
 onight! We will have the JNJ Pro-Am as a high light and the great band Duki
 sch Vagabond playing for us! \n\nBand: Dukisch Vagabond\n​Zouk Taster: 20:3
 0-21:30\nPrice: 20€/ Without Taster 16€\nParty Pass for 28€ available: www.
 swingupthebackyard.com\n\nTaster:\nZouk is a fast jump-up carnival beat ori
 ginating from the Caribbean islands of Guadeloupe and Martinique\, populari
 zed by the French Antillean band Kassav' in the 1980s. Very rapid in tempo\
 , the style lost ground in the 1980s due to the strong presence of kadans o
 r compas\, the main music of the French Antilles. Today\, zouk is the Frenc
 h Antilles compas\,[1] also called zouk-love.\n\n***** There are two Temlep
 hofer webs in Berlin\, please make sure you are going to the one in Schöneb
 erg!!!!*****\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170510T150129Z
LOCATION:Tanzschule weRK36\, Tempelhofer Weg 70\, 10829 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swing up the backyard Blues Edition Main party!
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
