DESCRIPTION:**It’s Time to Shine again\, and this time it’s a jam circle!**
 \n\nTime to Shine - Choreo Jam + Surprise Performance* (propably around 23:
 00)\n\nMusic by DJ Crémant\n\nFree Entrance :)\n\n\n* The rules are similar
  to the last round:\n\n1. Register solo or in couple.\n2. You get the part 
 of the song you will dance to.\n3. Choreograph it.\n4. Perform it!\n\nThe m
 ain differences to the previous edition are:\n\na) Your “stage” is the jam 
 circle and everyone will be clapping around you.\nb) You will dance a part 
 of a complete song (the exact length will depend on the number of sign ups\
 , but it will be between 16 and 32 x 8 counts) . Other dancers may dance be
 fore and/or after you with their own routines.\nc) You can choose between t
 wo levels of challenge: *Allegro* (medium tempo - 165 to 185 bpm) or *Prest
 o* (fast tempo - 190 to 230 bpm)\n\nOn June 30th we are going to enjoy two 
 complete “patchwork” routines. That’s why we have to limit the registration
  period until June 9th\, so we can divide the songs between all the dancers
  and each of you will have 3 weeks to prepare.\n\nWould you like to take pa
 rt? Sign up now:\nhttps://goo.gl/forms/Dkmirpk1jFSGSve92\n\n-of-
