DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy dancing to live music? We hope you do\, because th
 is is how Lindy Hop was born - in the big ballrooms of Harlem in the 30s. W
 e want to help bringing this spirit back to life\, which is why we are now 
 organizing a Swingin' Friday with live music once a month with our local he
 ro bands from Berlin - and occasionally with a popular Swing orchestra from
  abroad.\n\nAs a large family of musicians with different backgrounds\, SWI
 NGBOP'ers has been appearing on stages in Europe and then world since Janua
 ry 2012. They now share their passion for music and their dedication to jaz
 z. They play Swing\, Jazz\, Bossa\, Gypsy and many other traditional music.
  From trio to nonett\, the formation invites to dance and to travel\, possi
 bly more... Every day\, new music lovers are charmed in the whole world fro
 m them!\n\nTickets at the door: 7€\n\nTriple Deal: 3 concerts in 4 weeks fo
 r 20€!\n31.3. Swingbop'ers\n7.4. The Sweet Simones\n21.4. Andreas Hofschnei
 der Quintett\n\n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20170605T171140Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Jeder ist tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8\, 10245 Be
 rlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance to live music with Swingbop'ers @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
