DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY EDITION\nNou has another party on Saturday this week so 
 we'll try a Sunday dance. This time\, there will be cake. Bring a home-bake
 d cake and earn the undying gratitude of your fellows- and free entry to ne
 xt Saturday's dance (with live music)!\n\nLive music\, Count Basie\, hot fe
 et\, cool parquet- continuing the tradition of lofty Saturday dances\, we'l
 l dance way up high at Nou Tango. Two rooms\, hot swing on the main floor a
 nd more swinging variety in the backroom. If you need a break from moving i
 t on the floor\, kick back in salon seats and enjoy the show- or the night 
 lights of the city!\n\nIn the backroom: Bla Bla Balboa or Mood Indigo\, dep
 ends on how we're feeling that day.\n\nParty entry free! (DJ donations very
  welcome\, 5€ suggested)\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/195447847529773
 /
