DESCRIPTION: Do you like dancing to live music? GREAT! Then you should chec
 k out our monthly live swing jam session.\n\nSpecial this month: David Herm
 lin Quintett as house band!\n\nThe phrase "jam session" came about in the 1
 920s when white and black musicians would congregate after their regular pa
 ying gigs\, to play the jazz they could not play in the bands they played i
 n. When Bing Crosby would attend these sessions\, the musicians would say h
 e was "jammin' the beat"\, since he would clap on the one and the three. Th
 us these sessions became known as "jam sessions".\n\nHow cool would it be t
 o dance to this improvised music! Let's get swing musicians and dancers tog
 ether once a month in our Monday Marmalade and swing it all the night throu
 gh!\n\n2€ at the door. If you appreciate the live music\, please tip the ba
 nd ♥\n\n-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20181112T215158Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Wedding\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deut
 schland
SEQUENCE:5
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:*NEW VENUE* Monday Marmalade - Live Swing Jam @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
