CREATED:20171217T160406Z
DESCRIPTION:\nIt’s Time to Shine again\, and this time it’s a jam circle! \
 n\nThe rules are similar to the last round:\n\nRegister solo or in couple.\
 nYou get the part of the song you will dance to.\nChoreograph it.\nPerform 
 it!\n\nThe main differences to the previous edition are:\n\nYour “stage” is
  the jam circle and everyone will be clapping around you.\nYou will dance a
  part of a complete song (the exact length will depend on the number of sig
 n ups\, but it will be between 16 and 32 x 8 counts) . Other dancers may da
 nce before and/or after you with their own routines.\nYou can choose betwee
 n two levels of challenge: allegro (medium tempo - 165 to 185 bpm) or prest
 o (fast tempo - 190 to 230 bpm)\n\nOn July 6th we are going to enjoy two co
 mplete “patchwork” routines. That’s why we have to limit the registration p
 eriod until June 10th\, so we can divide the songs between all the dancers 
 and each of you will have 3 weeks to prepare.\n\nWould you like to take par
 t? Sign up now:\nhttps://goo.gl/forms/4E0iyaMJv8M1ldFW2\n\nEntrance: 2€\n\n
 -of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20180528T095951Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swingin' Friday: Time to Shine - Choreo Jam @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
