DESCRIPTION:Do you like cozy\, comfortable bars? Do you like dancing? How a
 bout staying up really\, really late? Combine all three\, and you get the L
 ate Nite Blues Cafe. Immediately after the Thursday Fire & Ice dance at Lis
 beth\, haul on over to Filmkunst Bar (just two-and-a-half blocks away)\, wh
 ere we can start Friday in style! Dancing ends at Lisbeth at midnight\, and
  starts at Filmkunst Bar whenever we get over there\, probably from 1215-12
 30.\n\n(Achtung! I've listed this event as starting at 1130PM on Thursday\,
  but in reality...) Dancing ends at Lisbeth at midnight\, and starts at Fil
 mkunst Bar whenever we get over there\, probably from 1215-1230.\n\nNo cove
 r\, but a tip for the DJ is also appreciated. If you're coming from Lisbeth
  already\, consider yourself on the guestlist...
