DESCRIPTION:<p><span>"Swing Is in the Air andwe have an evening full of mus
 ic and dancing for you! Either if you are adancer\, musician or you just wa
 nt to learn your first steps and then enjoy theevening on a beautiful terra
 ce\, we got you covered!</span>  <span> All of this will wait for you in Or
 ville's\, formallya US army casino\, now a charming bar near Tempelhofer Fe
 ld. </span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp\;</span></span></p><p><span>So what's t
 he plan?</span>   </p><p><span><br>- 18:00 The floor is open with DJ Carlos
 </span> <span>&nbsp\;</span></p><p><span>- 18:30 Live music starts! </span>
 <br><span></span></p><p><span>- 19:15 DJ music<br>- 19:45 Band second set<b
 r>- 20:30 Jam session</span> <span> and DJ </span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp\
 ;</span></span></p><p><span>Free Entry!</span></p><p><span>Live music is a 
 special treatwe would like to continue having\, which is why we will be col
 lecting donationsfor musicians during the evening. A generous amount is hig
 hly appreciated!</span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp\;</span></span></p><p><span
 >Please don't bring drinks other than water! The bar has anexcellent drink 
 selection and of course\, we also want to support it!</span>  <span> Additi
 onally\, you should also try the Italianfood/snacks that the establishment 
 has to offer. </span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp\;</span></span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220607T111319Z
