 \n\nSummer in Berlin can be so great! Join us for our free & weekly OpenAir
  Dancing direct by the Spree tuesdays in Else Biergarten close to Ostkreuz 
 | Treptower Park. Get a drink\, sit down at the Spree\, meet amazing people
