 wn for a special event on 19.10. Introducing the Smooshers Unlimited: a fiv
 e-man band playing tunes ranging from New Orleans classics to fast-paced sw
 ing. We've got Laurent Humeau (trumpet) and Eldar Tsalikov (sax\, clarinet)
  up front playing dancing melodies\, and then Thomas Dekas on guitar\, Fran
 çois Perdriau on bass\, and Matt Griffiths on drums beating out crisp synco
 pated rhythm. Music you can't resist dancing to!\n\nHere we are again on th
 e fine floor at Nou Tango. The home of one of the best dancefloors in Berli
 n\, Nou is extremely cozy\, with easy ambiance and a relaxed atmosphere. Da
 nce and enjoy the glorious parquet floor\, or kick back with a glass of win
 e and enjoy the view.\n\n21:00 Dancefloor opens\n21:30-23:30 Live music wit
 h the Smooshers Unlimited\n23:30-close DJ\n\nParty entry 10-12€\, sliding s
 cale.\n\nThe Smooshers Unlimited are:\nEldar Tsalikov - saxophone\nLaurent 
 Humeau - clarinet\nThomas Dekas - guitar\nFrancois Perdiau - bass\nMatt Gri
 ffiths - drums\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/2865191336842447/\n\nkeep
  swingin'! \nberlinhop.com
