DESCRIPTION:On 02.08. we'll welcome live music to the Sunset floor for the 
 very first time with the Open Swing Orchestra! Dance\, listen to the band o
 r hang out in this very special location. We're looking forward to seeing y
 ou there!<br><br>***<br>Come fly with us: we'll dance OUTDOORS against the 
 imposing backdrop of Tempelhof's huge Hangar 1\, surrounded by greenery. Sh
 ake it to the best swing music under a fiery sky as the heat of the day fad
 es into the cool of night.<br><br>The dancefloor opens at 20:00. There will
  be drinks and food available to purchase. Come one\, come all!<br><br>With
  DJ Romolala Dingdong before and after the band.<br><br>Eintritt: Spende. Y
 our generous donations help keep us aloft- support live music!<br><br>About
  the band:<br>Das Open Swing Orchestra (OSO) ist ein nicht-professionelles 
 und selbst­organisiertes Orchester\, dessen Mitglieder überwiegend selbst S
 wing tanzen. Das OSO tritt an mit dem Anspruch\, den Spaß an der Musik zu v
 ermitteln und an ihr zu wachsen. Das Repertoire besteht aus Klassikern der 
 20er bis 40er Jahre\, also der Goldenen Ära des Swing.&nbsp\; <br>Die Beset
 zung variiert je nach Verfügbarkeit. Derzeit musizieren etwa 20 SängerInnen
  und IstrumentalistInnen bei den Proben mit. Das OSO ist offen – „Open“ – f
 ür Neuzugänge und freut sich über Interessenten.&nbsp\; <br>Viel Spaß bei d
 er Musik!<br><br><br>The Open Swing Orchestra (OSO) is a non-professional\,
  self-organised Orchestra whose members are mostly swing dancers. The OSO c
 laims to convey the fun of the music to its audience and tries to grow with
  the challenge of making it. The repertoire consist of classics from the go
 lden era of swing\, from the 1920s to the 1940s. The line-up of the instrum
 ents may vary\, depending on the availability. There are about 20 singers a
 nd instrumentalists that attempt the rehearsals. The OSO is open for new en
 trants and looking forward to see You. Have fun with the music! <br><br>Dir
 ections here: <br><a href="https://scontent-frt3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/fr
 /cp0/e15/q65/66129918_3293925913954677_3301825137514381312_n.jpg?_nc_cat=10
 7&efg=eyJpIjoidCJ9&_nc_oc=AQkTxq4-ZuISPPEC34hghdSzIq3m4WIyESeKddxCGQnwO6ew9
 D1LoofOgRTJGm3KIYE&_nc_ht=scontent-frt3-2.xx&oh=7d02f0ea2b5b5abd8f3c5277738
 d8c23&oe=5DC3F1B9">https://scontent-frt3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/fr/cp0/e15
 /q65/66129918_3293925913954677_3301825137514381312_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&amp\;e
 fg=eyJpIjoidCJ9&amp\;_nc_oc=AQkTxq4-ZuISPPEC34hghdSzIq3m4WIyESeKddxCGQnwO6e
 w9D1LoofOgRTJGm3KIYE&amp\;_nc_ht=scontent-frt3-2.xx&amp\;oh=7d02f0ea2b5b5ab
 d8f3c5277738d8c23&amp\;oe=5DC3F1B9</a><br><br>keep swingin'! <a href="http:
 //berlinhop.com">berlinhop.com</a><br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com
 /events/409733353084169/">https://www.facebook.com/events/409733353084169/<
 /a>
