DESCRIPTION:\nYeah\, you are reading right. This will be the second\, might
  be the last - but it won't be the least edition of the Golden Beans Blues 
 Night.\n\nLying in the very back of a nice kreuzberg flavoured bar\, this m
 ystical basement venue offers everything a blues night needs: Cozyness\, di
 rty wooden floor\, disco pig! and even a dance pole.\n\nLast month we had a
 n amazing party there during the EnJoy Blues! workshop - and this one won't
  be less!\n\nUnfortunately it might be the last one\, because the owner of 
 the bar has to be out of there on the end of the month.\n\n\nSO DON'T MISS 
 THIS LAST CHANCE TO HAVE A GOLDEN BEANED BLUES NIGHT!\n\n\nEntrance: Free -
  but DJ Euro-Schwein might be around \;)\n\n-- OF --
