 Hoppers but also some ear candy for Balboa and Blues lovers.\nThe large woo
 den dance floor\, the very good acoustics\, 50 lockers and a grand piano ma
 ke the WABE a perfect spot and the night will be a swinging affair!\n\nDJ C
 ement Mixer : 8.00pm\nBand starts 9pm\n\nYou'll find further details short 
 termed on facebook :\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/SavoySatellites\n\nThe Loc
 ation: https://www.wabe-berlin.info\n\n\nCheers\nHG
