DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the rough side of Swing!\n\nLive music session every
  week \n2 dancefloors: 1 for Lindy & Balboa 1 for Blues\n\nTo find Freudenz
 immer: Enter via the first side building\, then second floor / left door\n\
 nHEY\, YOU COOL CATS! We have a new event for you! The Jam Cats live sessio
 n carries on the legacy of the fabulous BLAUE STUNDE\, with a similar spiri
 t and many familiar faces.\n\nWe want everyone to have fun\, dancers and mu
 sicians alike with a stage open for early Jazz\, Jive\, Swing\, RnB\, and o
 ther fun styles to dance to. The jam will be run by members of the Syncopat
 ion Society to ensure that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, o
 r to simply sit back and enjoy the music.\n\nFOR THE FIRST EDITION we will 
 gather several musicians to play the all-time favorites. Expect members of 
 Old Fish Jazz Band\, Musicomaniacs\, The Ragtime Nightmare\, Dirty Honkers\
 , Goodnight Circus\, and many other cats from the scene..\n\nDISCLAIMER FOR
  MUSICIANS: There’s a restriction on drums\, for now\, no kick is allowed\,
  so it's going to be a speakeasy-style instrumentation. There's a piano on 
 the stage. If you want to get up and play\, let one of the musicians know y
 our name and instrument and you will be given a turn. \n\nENTRANCE:\n5€ - 1
 0€ sliding scale - Pay 5 if you're low on cash\, or 10 if you got money to 
 flash. Free for musicians. One drink on the house if you play.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190624T123134Z
LOCATION:Freudenzimmer (SF 2. Stock rechts)\, Mehringdamm 61\, Berlin
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jam Cats Live Session
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
