DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><header>Details</header><section><span>🎄We are cel
 ebrating the start of the winter holiday season with a party! 🎄<br> <br> W
 hat are we planning?<br> <br> 🎧 DJs Yasemin\, Ana and Imada from 20:00<spa
 n> to 00:00/open end<br> ☕ Glühwein<br> 🥧 Winter Holiday Food <br> 🍹 Spec
 ial cocktails <br> 👯 Open 1 min showcases<br> <br> <br> ✨ Open 1 Min Showc
 ase ✨<br> <br> We are opening a slot for everyone in Swing community in Ber
 lin to prepare a 1 minute showcase and perform in our party. You are free t
 o prepare your own performance that is between 30 seconds to 60 seconds lon
 g. Share your talents and/or culture with us! It can be swing dancing or si
 nging\, playing an instrument\, or any other crazy idea you can think of! T
 his will be a place for all of us to get to know the community better and c
 elebrate each other's unique skills and culture.<br> <br> There is a limit 
 for showcase participants\, so get your spots quickly by registering here: 
 <a href="https://lm.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fforms.gle%2FMUigoqm2
 vdKhuukb8%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2rS6AmMdvbF99ktT7_XQeOzAAKlDmyct4sn8D7aaonPtP-hFzQ
 7ioGsZY&amp\;h=AT0ogoaTXu7ix6NPBsyVEDlwQYqoJcFJ_bjUtt_x3ZLzASAHn9HL1fIeuqms
 uXdoTZZaeSnX2Aqk0u-H0hjclqMQYWTklMbt5Aformz-fPpWxVpxU1WukduVCOmYshuM5HoUwHT
 iggJHlv_pAk8"><span>https://</span><wbr><span>forms.gle/</span><wbr><span>M
 Uigoqm2vdKhuukb</span><wbr>8</a><br> <br> <br> 🍲Holiday Food 🍲<br> Not ev
 eryone celebrates Christmas\, and the winter holidays are different for eve
 ryone. But we all have one thing in common: binge eating for special events
 !  The team will prepare and share their favourite holiday food and there w
 ill be cake\, cookies and glühwein. If you're able\, bring your favourite h
 oliday food to the studio and share it with others! A special section of th
 e studio will be prepared for us to sit together and eat!<br> <br> <br> 💖 
 Sustainability Fund 💖<br> <br> All profit from this party will go towards 
 to our sustainability fund. Our students or members of the community who ar
 e struggling financially will be able to take our classes and workshops tha
 nks that fund. That way\, this and further parties we organize will be a di
 rect way to fund our community. <br> <br> Find out more about the fund: <a 
 href="https://lm.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rayuelaswing.com%2F
 sustainability-fund%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2cwRtP3Qjmq8_TgWgR5YdWewnNLbhdTZHiaxpwtS
 vJf3XmqOuliRqrP74&amp\;h=AT2N0mi3CUE189sTdROy7cUK-cVdtfAgBXHufi9utEjfU2lsXx
 Y_NaSuhgXjiU7_f3POIkCNFsy-LjKCul0zWm2KNMuJH5EzFfQ5a5gjwx9ZvCOeV50hUKhrGkqLF
 h6ADol57FEE0D6Rt70UKkY"><span>https://</span><wbr><span>www.rayuelaswing</s
 pan><wbr><span>.com/</span><wbr><span>sustainability-f</span><wbr>und</a><b
 r> <br> <br> 💸 Entry fee 💸<br> <br> 7 to 10 euros sliding scale. <br> Fre
 e for volunteers and showcase participants. <br> <br> <br> <br> 🩺 COVID SA
 FETY RULES 🩺<br> 2G+ Event (only vaccinated and recovered dancers)<br> Dis
 infectant will be provided.</span></span></section>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221111T132144Z
