DESCRIPTION:\nSwing Is in the Air\, with an evening full of music and danci
 ng for you! Either if you are a dancer\, musician or you just want to learn
  your first steps and then enjoy the evening on a beautiful terrace\, we go
 t you covered! All of this awaits you in Orville's\, formally a US army cas
 ino\, now a charming bar near Tempelhofer Feld\n\n🎷 This time we have agai
 n one and only Peperina Swing!\nEric Doyle - Guitar\nFabio Radermacher - Tr
 umpet\nFacundo Olivera - Drums\nHayley Kavanagh - Tenor Sax\nSteffan Müller
  - Double Bass\n\n\n🚀 So what's the plan?\n‣ 18:30 The floor is open with 
 DJ Carlos\n‣ 19:00 Live music sarts!\n‣ 19:45 DJ music\n‣ 20:15 Band second
  set\n‣ 21:00 DJ music\n\n😎 We will have an honor to have a guest DJ again
 - to be announced!\n⭐️ Free Entry!\n\n🍹 Please don't bring drinks other th
 an water! The bar has an excellent drink selection and of course\, we also 
 want to support it! Additionally\, you should also try some snacks and pizz
 a that the establishment has to offer.\n\n👉 Please also note that we want 
 to create an event that is a safe space and has a friendly and welcoming en
 vironment for everyone\, regardless of gender\, sexual orientation\, abilit
 y\, ethnicity\, socioeconomic status\, age and religion (or lack thereof). 
 In case it comes to your attention or you are affected by any inappropriate
  behavior\, we ask you to let us know\, so we can take action and prevent s
 uch situations to happen again. You can recognize the organizational team b
 y their yellow bands or contact us via the Facebook event.\n\nFB if the eve
 nt: https://www.facebook.com/events/1475364422920216\nFB of the organizers:
  https://www.facebook.com/Swing-is-in-the-Air-at-Orvilles-with-Live-Music-1
 09238155168591\n\nWe hope to see you there!\nThe Swing is in the Air Team\n
  \n\n-pt 
LAST-MODIFIED:20220812T222113Z
LOCATION:Orville's Cafè & Aperitivo Bar\, Platz d. Luftbrücke 4\, 12101 Ber
 lin\, Deutschland
