UID:5ljomqcp1h32gpr8a3id27t5gt@google.com
CREATED:20190811T155603Z
DESCRIPTION:the end of summer is a grieving time full of holiday blues\, me
 mories of our summer lovers and PTSD flashbacks to the sound of buzzing mos
 quitos and screams of ice cream dipped children stampeding thorugh the stre
 ets. As we are all preparing to re-start our post-vacational routine\, we’r
 e propose you: let's have one last summer ball. \n\nBut there are sacred ru
 les to this party. \n\n1.    No one shall miss the photoshoot. Come in your
  best blunder years self outfit. That outfit you wore to your yearbook pict
 ure\, the hardcore expression of your 15 year self\, the one you would wear
  for your myspace profile picture\, the one from when your Messenger userna
 me was xXxLadyDarkness85xXx: we want to see it. Non-awkward pictures will n
 ot be tolerated in our photobooth. \n(Need inspiration? Take a look! https:
 //imgur.com/a/FnYKJDn)\n\n2.    NO RUNNING IN THE CORRIDOR.\n\n3.    There 
 will be no crowned prom kings/queens nor crowned competetors\, but you can 
 show your best moves in our trio showdown. (Need inspiration -again-? https
 ://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kdQJaakCgcA). You can sign up for the showdown h
 ere: https://forms.gle/Xs2cw3fESq21mg2s9 \n\n4.    Your parents are not let
 ting you drive in their SUV yet? Come with your bike. A janitor will be out
 side from 21:00 to 22:30 to repair your bike for free. \n\n5.    Don’t be a
  dick. \n\n👾 PARTY SCHEDULE 👾\n\n\n21:30 – 22:30 DJ Ana Maeso\n22:30 – 23
 :15 Live Music (Band TBA!)\n23:15 – 23:30 DJ Ana Maeso\n23:30 – 00:00 Dance
  Trio Showdown \n00:00 – 00:45 Live Music (Band TBA!)\n00:45 – 2:00/until w
 e stand DJ Battle \n\n🎟️ PRICES 🎟️\n\n🌟Entry: \n11 Euros normal price \n
 9  Euros showing your best blunder years outfit \n\n\nYou can pre-register 
 here: https://forms.gle/qXKuGQBMNG7z51AP6\n\n📺  WHY THIS PARTY? 📺\n\nTran
 sparency is important to us\, so here you go! The Cronopias been invited to
  perform at Blue Skies Lisbon 2019\, but we need to fund our trip somehow. 
 All earnings from the door will go to pay for flights and studio training t
 imes\, and all earnings of the bar will go to the awesome staff of this ven
 ue that is helping us put this party together.  Not only you’ll be showing 
 off your freshly cut mullet for the sake of 80’s haircuts beauty\, you’ll a
 lso be doing it for a Good cause!
LAST-MODIFIED:20190811T155604Z
LOCATION:Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Back to School - The blunder years swing party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
