 />Join us for swinging music and dance from 18:00 with DJ- the band will st
 art around 19:00.<br /><br />Entry 16 – 20€\, sliding scale.<br /><br />The
  Alte Turnhalle is located in the middle of Friedrichshain\, around five mi
 nutes by foot from transit stations U/S Warschauer Str.\, S Ostkreuz\, or U
 /S Frankfurter Allee.<br /><br />---<br /><br />https://www.facebook.com/ev
 ents/5241769269217342/</span>
