 y for vaccinated and recovered persons.Please bring you digital Cov Pass wi
 th you. At weRK36 you need to register withLuca or handwritten at the place
 .</span></span></p><p><span><span>Fee: € 6 or pay € 10 if you want to suppo
 rt thelocation after such a long closing time. weRK36: S-Schönberg/S-S</spa
 n><wbr><span>üdkreuz - Ella-Barowsky-Straße 70 / Sachsendamm93\, 10829 Berl
 in </span></span></p>
