 wn for a second session with the Smooshers Unlimited: a five-man band playi
 ng tunes ranging from New Orleans classics to fast-paced swing. We've got L
 aurent Humeau (trumpet) and&nbsp\;<span>Daniel Duspiwa (sax\, clarinet)</sp
 an> up front playing dancing melodies\, and then <span>Jack Latimer on guit
 ar</span>\, François Perdriau on bass\, and Matt Griffiths on drums beating
  out crisp syncopated rhythm. Music you can't resist dancing to!<br><br>Her
 e we are again on the fine floor at Nou Tango. The home of one of the best 
 dancefloors in Berlin\, Nou is extremely cozy\, with easy ambiance and a re
 laxed atmosphere. Dance and enjoy the glorious parquet floor\, or kick back
  with a glass of wine and enjoy the view.<br><br>21:00 Dancefloor opens<br>
 21:30-23:30 Live music with the Smooshers Unlimited<br>23:30-close DJ<br><b
 r>Party entry 10-12€\, sliding scale.<br><br>The Smooshers Unlimited are:<b
 r><span>Daniel Duspiwa - saxophone<br>Laurent Humeau - clarinet<br>Jack Lat
 imer - guitar<br>Francois Perdriau - bass<br>Matt Griffiths - drums</span><
