DESCRIPTION:Live music every week\n2 dancefloors: 1 for Lindy & Balboa 1 fo
 r Blues\n\nTo find Freudenzimmer: Enter the first yard / first side-buildin
 g\, then second floor / left door\n\nHEY\, YOU COOL CATS! We have a new eve
 nt for you! The Jam Cats live session carries on the legacy of the BLAUE ST
 UNDE - strictly in danceable tempo! - mingling live sessions\, concerts and
  DJ-sets.\n\n\nWe want everyone to have fun\, dancers and musicians alike w
 ith a stage open for early Jazz\, Jive\, Swing\, RnB\, and other fun styles
  to dance to. The jam will be run by members of the Syncopation Society to 
 ensure that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, or to simply sit
  back and enjoy the music.\n\nENTRANCE:\n5€ - 10€ sliding scale - Pay 5 if 
 you're low on cash\, or 10 if you got money to flash.
