DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Swing Is in the Air\, with an evening full of music 
 and dancing for you! Either if you are an experienced dancer\, or you just 
 want to learn your first steps and then enjoy the evening on a beautiful te
 rrace\, we got you covered! All of this awaits you in Orville's\, formally 
 a US army casino\, now a charming bar near Tempelhofer Feld.<br><span><br><
 br><span>😎</span> This is a special edition connected with the slow lindy 
 workshop done by Kamila and Stephan. You can still register for it here: <a
  href="https://www.facebook.com/events/736236190910079/?__cft__[0]=AZVxTklH
 uivjLv8dNgQG1zVNUPVApuAiF-JyEBhLCaehGh-zwOhUTTRGjym2Z8PZRfQQNym4OvlIiqHDT4q
 UKEqrw4aQcqQV829zDflQiOA0liFTj4nDyfG1MNon7BIXhCU2gaGG-luyMoI42E_g-w6P&__tn_
 _=q"><span><span>https://www.facebook.com/<u></u>events/736236190910079</sp
 an></span></a><br><br><span>🎷</span> The music will be mostly slow lindy w
 ith a little bit of a bluesy feeling.  <br><br><span>🚀</span> So what's th
 e plan?<br>‣ 19:00 - 21.00 DJ Carlos<br>‣  21.00 - 23.00 DJ Elsa<br><br><br
 ><span>⭐️</span> Free Entry!<br><br><span>🍹</span> Please don't bring drin
 ks other than water! The bar has an excellent drink selection and of course
 \, we also want to support it! Additionally\, you should also try some snac
 ks and pizza that the establishment has to offer.<br><br><span>👉</span> Pl
 ease also note that we want to create an event that is a safe space and has
  a friendly and welcoming environment for everyone\, regardless of gender\,
  sexual orientation\, ability\, ethnicity\, socioeconomic status\, age and 
 religion (or lack thereof). In case it comes to your attention or you are a
 ffected by any inappropriate behavior\, we ask you to let us know\, so we c
 an take action and prevent such situations to happen again. You can recogni
 ze the organizational team by their yellow bands or contact us via the Face
 book event.<br><br>FB event: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/46843
 9825094417">https://www.facebook.com/<u></u>events/468439825094417</a><br><
 br>We hope to see you there!<br>The Swing is in the Air Team"</span></html-
 blob>
