 en though it’s about to get a bit warmer\, there is no bad time to donate f
 or the Kältebus. <br>Generally\, as the dark and cold declines\,  so does t
 he attention for people in need but the „Berliner Stadtmission“ needs our h
 elp all year long! <br><br>So we thought we do something about that and cur
 ated a pretty nice program for you to help us\, help those in need: <br>Com
 e by for plenty of „pay what you want beginner swing dance program“ for dan
 cers and complete beginners\, party with DJ Clément and take home good Karm
 a and if you want: a DIY beeswax-candle. <br><br>Date: 14/03 Start: 2pm<br>
 full program:&nbsp\;<br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/2348847575
 54438/" id="ow485" __is_owner="true">https://www.facebook.com/events/234884
 757554438/</a><br>4.15 – 7.00 pm: Dancing Time<br>2 pm - 4:15pm: DIY beeswa
 x candle- workshop (the revenue goes to the donation fund as well) <br><br>
