UID:1j7cmoqseertclhue02uhkva3b@google.com
CREATED:20220509T105300Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><span><span dir="auto"><br>We are celebrating
  our first year with a social party and want to invite all the dancers in t
 he scene to celebrate it with us! <br><br>What are we planning?<br><span>🎧
 </span> DJ Sevinç from 18.00<br><span>🎺</span> Live Band from 19.00<br><sp
 an>🍻</span> Bar to buy drinks<br><span>📸</span> Photobooth<br><span>👯</s
 pan> And…… 30 second showcases!<br><br><span>✨</span> 30 Second Showcase <s
 pan>✨</span><br>We are opening a slot for all the dancers in Berlin to prep
 are a 30 second showcase and perform in our party. You are free to prepare 
 your own performance that is between 30 seconds to 60 seconds long. It can 
 be solo\, partnered or with a group. We encourage all levels of dancers to 
 show us their creation\, since level is not an indication of creativity. Th
 ere is no limitation for tempo\, music choice or dance type. This is a big 
 chance for us to celebrate and support the dancers in the scene. <br>There 
 is a limit for showcase participants\, so get your spots quickly by registe
 ring here: <a href="https://forms.gle/MtGK844sFdLfTgTU8" id="ow520" __is_ow
 ner="true">https://forms.gle/MtGK844sFdLfTgTU8<br><br></a><br><span>🥁</spa
 n> Band <span>🥁</span><br>- Mette  Nadja Hansen - vocals<br>- Johannes von
  Ballestrem - piano<br>- Sidney Werner - bass<br>- Jordan Dinsdale - drums<
 br>- Horns TBA<br><br><span>💖</span> Sustainability Fund <span>💖</span><b
 r>All profit from this party will be dedicated to a sustainability fund. Ou
 r students or members of the community who are struggling financially will 
 be able to take our classes and workshops through that fund. <br>That way\,
  this and further parties we organize will be a direct way to fund our comm
 unity. <br><br><span>💸</span> Entry fee <span>💸</span><br>15 euros (Free 
 for volunteers and showcase participants)<br><br>PLEASE NOTE that a negativ
 e self-test will be required upon entry. It does not have to be an official
  antigen test\, a home test is fine\, but please do not forget about it. IF
  you forget you can still come in as we will have LIMITED tests on site. Pl
 ease do not rely on them but also do not turn back if you forgot yours\, as
 k us for one. <br><br><span>📍</span>Location<span>📍</span><br>Alte Turnha
 lle<br><br><span><span><span dir="auto"><span>🩺</span> COVID SAFETY RULES 
 <span>🩺</span><br>2G++ Event (only vaccinated and recovered dancers with a
  fresh antigen test)<br>Disinfectant will be provided.</span></span></span>
 <br><br><span>🐥</span>Questions?<span>🐥</span><br>Contact: Yasemin Alpay 
 and Michal Front</span></span><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blo
 b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220703T085542Z
LOCATION:Alte Turnhalle Berlin\, Holteistraße 6-9\, 10245 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rayuela Swing Birthday Party!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
