BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20220929T173000Z
DTEND:20220929T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:6bg8hj2bqga2r5dh8ff7718383@google.com
CREATED:20220809T134342Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><b>Tickets at the door: </b>15EUR</html-blob><br><ht
 ml-blob><b><br></b></html-blob><br><html-blob><u></u><u></u><b>Welcome to t
 he party! </b>For this first edition\, we have a fantastic line-up of bands
  and musicians to carry the music all through the night. Each concert will 
 lead to a Jam Session in the style of our regular Jam Cats Session where mu
 sicians and dancers can share the stage. Additionally to that we have plann
 ed a lot of cool activities also during the daytime:<br><br><b>Dancers </b>
 – This festival is for you! All the parties focus on dance music and to war
 m you up we will offer you some fun dance and movement related tasters on T
 hursday\, Friday and Sunday – as well as some lectures and panel discussion
 s on Friday and Saturday Afternoon. By the way: Come as you are! Feel free 
 to dance solo\, with a partner\, lead\, follow\, switch… Make the music you
 r friend\, bring your own spin to the style\, and don’t be afraid to stand 
 out. We make no differentiation based on level\, dance style\, or role and 
 welcome all of your happy feet! <br><br><b>Musicians </b>– We also organize
  music workshops during the day where you can practice and learn with profe
 ssional musicians from the Syncopation Society. These workshops will take p
 lace alongside lectures and panel discussions accessible to all participant
 s. We will discuss music styles\, history\, and the cultural significance o
 f jazz today. More fun awaits you with special daytime activities and taste
 rs curated for the occasion. More to be announced soon.<br><br><b>Everyone 
 </b>– We want to use this festival as a chance to educate ourselves in cult
 ural topics that are connected to\, but go beyond the dance and music commu
 nity today. Which is why we on Friday and Saturday afternoon we offer a set
  of lectures and panel discussions around the topics of Black American Cult
 ure\, Diversity and Inclusivity. These topics are very important to us\, so
  we hope you show up and show your support.<br><br><b>Program for Thursday:
 </b><u></u><br><u></u><b><br></b><u></u><br><u></u><b>20:00 – The Time Rag 
 Department</b><br>In Berlin\, the Time Rag Department doesn’t need an intro
 duction. They are powering the dance community with their regular appearanc
 es at the infamous Villa Neukölln. They have been polishing their sound eve
 rsince with a blend of old jazz songs\, forgotten standards and musical tun
 es. Anton Wunderlich\, the lead singer\, and trombonist of the band always 
 finds the way to communicates his love for the oldest of jazz to his audien
 ce. We are so happy to have them welcoming you all<b><br><br>21:00 – Ice br
 eaking taster with Joris &amp\; Joren<br></b>Joris and Joren will open the 
 celebration with a warming up and musical games to get us all in the mood.<
 br><br><br><br><b><br>More infos here:</b><br><a href="https://syncopation.
 de/areyou/"><u>https://syncopation.de/areyou/</u></a><br><br>-of-<u></u><u>
 </u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220929T132525Z
LOCATION:Ballhaus Wedding\, Wriezener Str. 6\, 13359 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Are You Syncopated ?! - Time Rag Department @ Ballhaus Wedding
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
