DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><font><span><span></span></span></font>Swing Is in t
 he Air\, with an evening full of music and dancing for you! Either if you a
 re an experienced dancer\, or you just want to learn your first steps and t
 hen enjoy the evening on a beautiful terrace\, we got you covered! All of t
 his awaits you in Orville's\, formally a US army casino\, now a charming ba
 r near Tempelhofer Feld.<br>&nbsp\;<br>🎷 We have new band for you - Edda H
 ohberg Quintet! :)<br>&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; Edda Hohberg - Clarinet<br>&nbsp\;
  Niccolò Leirich - Piano<br>&nbsp\; Nils Haack - Trumpet<br>&nbsp\; Salim B
 ouamama - Double bass<br>&nbsp\; Till Reisener - Drums<br>&nbsp\;<br>🚀 So 
 what's the plan?<br><br>‣ 18:00 The floor is open with DJ Carlos<br>‣ 18:30
  Live music starts!<br>‣ 19:15 DJ music<br>‣ 19:45 Band second set<br>‣ 20:
 30 DJ music<br>&nbsp\;<br>⭐️ Free Entry!<br>&nbsp\;<br>🍹 Please don't brin
 g drinks other than water! The bar has an excellent drink selection and of 
 course\, we also want to support it! Additionally\, you should also try som
 e snacks and pizza that the establishment has to offer.<br>&nbsp\;<br>👉 Pl
 ease also note that we want to create an event that is a safe space and has
  a friendly and welcoming environment for everyone\, regardless of gender\,
  sexual orientation\, ability\, ethnicity\, socioeconomic status\, age and 
 religion (or lack thereof). In case it comes to your attention or you are a
 ffected by any inappropriate behavior\, we ask you to let us know\, so we c
 an take action and prevent such situations to happen again. You can recogni
 ze the organizational team by their yellow bands or contact us via the Face
 book event.<br><br>We hope to see you there!</html-blob><br><html-blob><br>
 The Swing is in the Air Team<br><u></u><font><span><span><span><br>-pt </sp
 an></span></span></font><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
