 an - 1927 everywhere you went)\, and everybody loved Dixieland\, even the e
 lectro folks.\n\nJoin us for some glorious blood-pumping New Orleans jazz f
 rom some of the widest-traveled musicians in Europe at the Jockel Biergarte
 n on Wednesday!\n\nDoors open with DJ'd music at 21:15. Band starts around 
 22:00. Dancing will take place INSIDE.\n\nEntry 8-12€\, sliding scale.\n\nh
 ttps://www.facebook.com/events/534477303955006/
