 n>⭐️</span> Free Entry!<br><br><span>🍹</span> Please don't bring drinks ot
 her than water! The bar has an excellent drink selection and of course\, we
  also want to support it! Additionally\, you should also try some snacks an
 d pizza that the establishment has to offer.<br><br><span>👉</span> Please 
 also note that we want to create an event that is a safe space and has a fr
 iendly and welcoming environment for everyone\, regardless of gender\, sexu
 al orientation\, ability\, ethnicity\, socioeconomic status\, age and relig
 ion (or lack thereof). In case it comes to your attention or you are affect
 ed by any inappropriate behavior\, we ask you to let us know\, so we can ta
 ke action and prevent such situations to happen again. You can recognize th
