 ind art exhibitions\, film screenings\, and the occasional rock n' roll mar
 ket (???). \n\nNow\, it's home to a new Sunday event! For the first (and th
 e last) time in 2011\, HBC opens its doors to so we can bounce and sway!\n\
 nWith 120m2 of beautiful parquet and a great sound system (and no neighbors
 ...)\, the location is perfect for a big dance. Let's tear it up!\n\nDancin
 g starts at 800PM.\n\nEintritt: 5-10€\, pay what you can afford. This deman
 ds a bit of exposition\, actually. After discussing with the band\, who wer
 e understandably a little horrified at the prospect of playing two hours fo
 r people who'd paid the equivalent of a falafel sandwich\, I've decided to 
 increase the price appropriately. LIVE: Kind of Dukish\n\n-pt
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T094227Z
LOCATION:.HBC Berlin\, Karl-Liebknecht Str 9\, 10178 Berlin
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LIVE: Kind of Dukish@Sunday Hot Stomp!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
