DESCRIPTION:Join one of the very first after-quarantine-swing-parties! We’r
 e finally able to dance again… even to live music! We’re gonna have three e
 xceptional parties dedicated to the masters of the Swing Era.  <br><br>⭐ 11
 .06.: Tribute to Duke Ellington (1899 - 1974)<br><br>⭐ 18.06.: Tribute to L
 ouis Armstrong (1901 - 1971)<br><br>⭐ 25.06.: Tribute to Teddy Wilson (1912
  - 1986)<br><br><br><br>Very few places available (10 couples) and you can 
 also follow our live stream!<br><br>Tickets &amp\; donations here: <a href=
 "https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.startnext.com%2Fletsjazz%
 3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3YScOdCDyVU8NSww5nYmC6MknRnGaQm2JH8CApI0HLv2U3Mqs11kMuOqE&am
 p\;h=AT2zAZwiXhIdqoidpiD4as0nvnsfRKHp3SNV8wJTkSH0gQ6nrvU6wKSc3A1MhlCJvjdoSn
 W3A2cRmx9Ju3w6fJnf2BE_o3133-fQK5kAp-u370RNV5OwKrJgsOyS21nZv2ITXeg_B-OBzSf2w
 Q">https://www.startnext.com/letsjazz</a><br><br>Live stream: <a href="http
 s://www.facebook.com/institut.francais.berlin/live">www.facebook.com/instit
 ut.francais.berlin/live</a><br><br><br>Concert starts at 7.00 p.m.: 🎹 Decl
 an Forde &amp\; His Orchestra (2 Sets) 🎹<br><br>Entrance from 6.45 p.m.<br
 ><br>Address: Institut français Berlin\, Kurfürstendamm 211\, 10719 Berlin<
 br><br><br>Brought to you by <a href="https://www.facebook.com/institut.fra
 ncais.berlin/">Institut français Berlin</a> &amp\; <a href="https://www.fac
 ebook.com/SwingBase/">Swing Base</a><br><br><a href="https://l.facebook.com
 /l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.swingbase.de%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0TJaWEPQTNAVp4RPFW
 bJcnzZnGnRPqFIYtk2xEICNDxLwX2utiJFpaBM4&amp\;h=AT3kgn8QxRTWi-e2XGzR7eB4Wb5H
 hwdh0VQ2KW9DWW6eOHxN2dYxDjeBCplwUZvWbbfUKmV_5Zo5ApXqaAtvnFH_0nOvnOE1GLe-wOJ
 VNPXK1xIkSLJQjEFP_Eqij1JYU97YBiN-t7wYR_XIEQ">www.swingbase.de</a><br><br>be
 rlin.institutfrancais.de<br>.<br>.<br>Things are not completely back to nor
 mal and we’ll have following rules:<br><br>⚠ Event ends after the concert! 
 No DJ Set after.<br><br>⚠ Only dance couples are accepted. Switching partne
 r isn’t allowed.<br><br>⚠ Dance squares on the ground with 3 meters social 
 distancing<br><br>⚠ Mouth protection required when moving into the room and
  1\,5 meters social distancing<br><br>⚠ Tickets only online!&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
