DESCRIPTION:\n\nDescription:\nPlease join us again at the cozy Kaffeehaus A
 topia for a night of Blues dancing!\n\nWe're looking forward to seeing you 
 all on the dance floor!\n\nWhat is Blues Dancing you ask? It's a social dan
 ce focused on partner connection\, improvisation and natural body movement.
  Whether you're a beginner or an experienced dancer\, whether you are a guy
  and want to try following or a girl leader - all who like to dance are wel
 come!\n\nThe venue:\nKaffeehaus Atopia\nPrenzlauer Allee 187\, 10405 Berlin
 \nhttps://www.facebook.com/AtopiaKaffeehaus?fref=ts\n\nWhat does Blues danc
