 >Entrance from 6.45 p.m.<br><br>Address: Institut français Berlin\, Kurfürs
 tendamm 211\, 10719 Berlin<br><br><br>Brought to you by <a href="https://ww
 w.facebook.com/institut.francais.berlin/" target="_blank">Institut français
  Berlin</a> &amp\; <a href="https://www.facebook.com/SwingBase/" target="_b
 lank">Swing Base</a><br><br><a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A
