 ="http://berlin.institutfrancais.de" target="_blank">berlin.institutfrancai
 s.de</a><br>.<br>.<br>Things are not completely back to normal and we’ll ha
 ve following rules:<br><br>⚠ Event ends after the concert! No DJ Set after.
 <br><br>⚠ Only dance couples are accepted. Switching partner isn’t allowed.
 <br><br>⚠ Dance squares on the ground with 3 meters social distancing<br><b
