 e.com/watch?v=D538AztlE1M</a><br><br>Chat Noir is an international\, acoust
 ic swing quartet composed of soprano saxophone\, acoustic guitar\, double b
 ass and vibraphone. This original cast creates a distinctive sound! The fou
