 ite you all <br><u></u><u></u>to join us for the very first <br>Jam Cats Se
 ssion at Bellmer Balboa ! ! ! <br><u></u><br>From now on\, the Jam Cats Ses
 sion <br>(formerly at Freudenzimmer)<br><u></u><br><u></u>will take place o
 nce a onth at Crack Bellmer. <br><u></u><br><u></u><br><span><br>♫ THE JAM 
 CATS SESSION ♫ <br>⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂<br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! The Jam Cats liv
 e session finally returns to carry on the legacy of old jazz mingling live 
 sessions and DJ-sets.<br>We want everyone to have fun\, dancers and musicia
 ns alike with a stage open for early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, and other fun sty
 les to dance to with a focus on Balboa since we are operating with Bellmer 
 Balboa. The jam will be run by members of the Syncopation Society to ensure
  that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, or to simply sit back 
 and enjoy the music.<br>19:30 - Doors<br>21:30 - 0:00 Jam!!!<br>0:00 - Dj<b
 r><br><span>This event is 2G+ ! please come tested …und bleib schön negativ
 . </span><br></span><u></u><u></u><span>(An official negative test of the s
 ame day is mandatory to get in. For everyone.)<br></span><u></u><br><u></u>
 <span><br>⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂ ⁂<br>DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS<br>Coming out to the 
 JAM CATS grants you free entrance and 1 or 2 drinks if you play. However\, 
 this is a DANCE EVENT and it implies to be reactive and to keep your solos 
 short and sweet. <br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on s
 tage. When you know you want to play\, make it clear and talk to one of the
  night manager. No standing around! <br>There's a piano on the stage with a
  atmospheric amplification. </span><br><u></u><br><u></u>- - - - - <br><br>
 Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on every Tuesday ! <br><br>Fast\, mid-
 tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz. <br><br><br>If you like to part
 y <br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, <br>you will have a good tim
 e at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous donations for bands and djs <br>a
 re highly appreciated and expected !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br><br>Enter the 
