BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20191213T210000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20191214T030000
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:6b86qppbb0gatodmul42q4hs2a@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20191213T220000
CREATED:20190830T091414Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>*** Schedule (preliminary) ***<br>- 20:15 Doors open for th
 e Beginner Drop-In<br>- 21:00 Potluck Buffet + Mix&amp\;Mingle in the bar a
 rea<br>- 21:30 Dance floor opens (if soundcheck is done)&nbsp\;<br>- 21:30 
 - 23:30 Mole’s Wing Orchestra<br>- 0:00 - 2:00 Humboldt Big Band<br>- 3:00 
 Party End<br><br>*** Entrance at the door ***&nbsp\;<br>15-20€ (sliding sca
 le)<br><br>We have a super duper Christmas Surprise for you! For our last p
 arty of the year we got together with two amazing big bands to create a ver
 y special evening with more than 4 hrs of live music:<br><br>*** Mole's Win
 g Orchestra - Prague ***<br>Mole's Wing are coming in from Prague just for 
 this unique cooperation. The band is very popular amongst swing dancers in 
 the Czech Republic\, so we are really looking forward to have them on our s
 tage...<br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/The.Moles.Wing.Orchestra/">htt
 ps://www.facebook.com/The.Moles.Wing.Orchestra/</a><br><br>*** Humboldt Big
  Band - Berlin ***<br>This is not just an ordinary universtiy big band - so
 me of Berlin's most popular jazz musicians play here. They came up with a v
 ery danceable-swing-set especially for this evening - with some party music
  for the later hours \;)<br><a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A
 %2F%2Fhumboldt-bigband.de%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0wbAqT5DDUmO8ubS8hPvil6R9ZRJ9Xb
 rGCGnz7fsN5iOQOcf6BeW-nilU&amp\;h=AT0ODjMVlFpylemR6BUa_6UjJXBoKF7R9vyFIebrV
 2R5OnqY4Q2A6XVwwAz3HLPYe8K1oUKEDfMTsBUwo8Z0vG5-UkG4tUqYOlxG71wOJO4n_dxqQPB4
 oazoSs6xrp3zEg9QGOu8DaQFL4FKHAfyavBZRA">http://humboldt-bigband.de/</a><br>
 <br>We are still not sure how to squeeze all these extraordinary musicians 
 onto our little stage\, but we'll figure it out\, so don't you worry \;)<br
 ><br>*** Potluck Buffet ***<br>Also\, next to a lot of amazing live music\,
  we have the "Potluck Buffet" again. Potluck means that whoever wants bring
 s some fingerfood snack to share and in the end we have a nice buffet made 
 out of donations. <br><br>How to decide what to bring?<br>1. We want to avo
 id unnecessary waste\, so since we cannot ask everyone to bring their own p
 lates\, let's keep it all finger food*!<br>2. To ensure a nice variety we c
 reated a little spreadsheet where you can see what is already being brought
 \, so please add your stuff also to the list:<br><a href="https://docs.goog
 le.com/spreadsheets/d/1jBpQ59Q2Ne3DDTO4EfZYhFdmRyk4UIhBRNI_JbyB6h0/edit?fbc
 lid=IwAR0wbAqT5DDUmO8ubS8hPvil6R9ZRJ9XbrGCGnz7fsN5iOQOcf6BeW-nilU#gid=0">ht
 tps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jBpQ59Q2Ne3DDTO4EfZYhFdmRyk4UIhBRNI_J
 byB6h0/edit#gid=0</a><br>3. This works only if many people participate! It 
 doesn't need to be something super complicated\, homemade is nice\, but als
 o some stuff from the bakery is very welcome :)<br><br>* What works well:<b
 r>- Christmas cookies \;)<br>- bread<br>- pastes / stuff to put on bread<br
 >- vegetables<br>- fruits<br>...<br><br>Maybe a bit complicated as finger f
 ood is stuff that cannot be put on bread and needs a plate or bowl... but m
 aybe you get creative \;)<br><br>-ac-
LAST-MODIFIED:20210923T174826Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Wedding\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deut
 schland
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swingin' Friday - Double Christmas Tree(at)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
