DESCRIPTION:UPDATE:\nHey everybody\,\nsadly i need to cancel the Swing Expe
 dition Event for tomorrow! Our captain just informed me that the boat is su
 ddenly facing a technical issue that can only be solved next week. I am sup
 er sorry for this late notice but we also just found out about it! I was ve
 ry much looking forward to this special event with you and i am sorry for a
 ny inconveniences. All refunds will be made shortly.\nBut if you can not le
 t go of the idea of dancing on a boat tomorrow then feel warmly welcomed to
  join us at Märkisches Ufer 10 on our houseboat for dance classes (6-8pm) a
 nd open dance (8-10pm).\n \nHope to see you dancing soon\,\nLinus\n\n------
 ---------------------------\nThe trip starts at 12:30 in Köpenick (Rathaus)
 \, a new Berlin based Jazz Live Band "The Hot Nuts" will serve us delightfu
 l and danceable jazz music while we take you on an Expedition through the a
 rea of Müggelsee and the nature around. Our trip will end around 16:30/17:0
 0 right in the heart of Berlin at Fischerinsel. There is space for dancing 
 on the boat while we drive and we explicitly encourage everyone to shake yo
 ur hips on our little expedition trip. (the roof height is <1\,95m) We got 
 a bar for your refreshments on board as well as a communal buffet.\nPrice p
 . ticket: 15-20€ sliding scale\, Communal buffet incl. (please contribute s
 ome food to the buffet\, if you like to enjoy some food on the way)\nBookin
 g: Email to lgripp@gmx.de or whatsapp +49 176 47714735\n--> www.berlinriver
 swing.de (http://www.berlinriverswing.de/?fbclid=IwAR094wOUNSADb-e4Bx42BQ12
 GyLVBPVxyorsbYssbl2MviJo5IxKm5H89Ro)\nBand: "The Hot Nuts" \nDizzy Ella (Do
 uble Bass)\nNina Thaler (Banjita)\nAndrea Ramírez Ruiz (Guitar)\nNoam Carmo
 n (Clarinet)\nElena Policky (Washboard)
LAST-MODIFIED:20220521T013455Z
LOCATION:Schiffsanleger Köpenick
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cancelled: Berlin River Swing - EXPEDITION
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
