DESCRIPTION:This year Cirque du Solo will present a full scale cabaret show
  to you. It will contain one hour of finest entertainment by international 
 acts from all variety: Dancers\, acrobats\, jugglers\, comedians\, clowns\,
  singers\, …\n\n\nLocation\nThe Ackerstadtpalast is a theatre based in the 
 Ackerstraße 169/170 in Berlin Mitte. As a part of the Schokoladen\, formerl
 y known as TISCH and Orphtheater\, it carries a honorful history in the ope
 n theatre scene in Berlin. Shortly renovated and reopened it fits around 10
 0 guests in the audience and its a perfect setting for this years cabaret.\
 n\n\nAfterpaty with DJ Shorty George & Friends\nFlying him in again and aga
 in for Berlins biggest Swing events\, Shorty George can already be seen as 
 a regular – but still it feels special every time he plays in Berlin. He wi
 ll be the main DJ for this weekend and\, together with some friends of ours
 \, will make sure that we can still dance if the last trumpet is already de
 ep asleep.\nPhoto by David Gauffin \n\n\nEntrance\n10 € / 8 € (students wit
 h id)\n\n\nhttp://www.cirque-du-solo.com/the-cabaret/\n\n\n-OF-
