 ce in the green and glorious surroundings of Jockel Biergarten\, very near 
 the Landwehrkanal in Kreuzberg. There's beer\, lemonade\, and food there\, 
 not to mention plenty of sun- and all the fresh outdoor air you can breathe
 . (There is a bit of shade available as well.)\n\nThere are both indoor and
  outdoor spaces to dance\, so we can dance in all weather conditions.\n\nWi
 th DJ! Toss a bit of cash in the hat: your generous donations help keep the
  whole flying outdoor circus running.
