CREATED:20220428T104646Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><span><span>We thought it'd be a shame to let the 30th go
  by without an outdoor dance\, so we've improvised a little session on Temp
 elhofer Feld. It'll be something like a dance picnic. We'll have live music
  in the form of the Savoy Satellites\, organized in an outdoor-friendly for
 mation. There will be a bit of DJ music to keep your toes tapping before an
 d after the band.<br /><br />We'll collect donations for the band\, please 
 be generous! Be generous to your fellow dancers as well\, and get a corona 
 test before dropping by- pretty please.<br /><br />A word on the space: it'
 s a tennis court. We have a few benches and tables\, but it's advisable to 
 bring a blanket or something to sit on in any case. The floor isn't the fas
 test\, so wear your outdoor dance shoes. <br /><br />There's a map with a p
 in on it here: (<a href="https://goo.gl/maps/CM6ZrGXLABnybxqn8">https://goo
 .gl/maps/CM6ZrGXLABnybxqn8</a>). The easiest way to get to the location is 
 by entering the field from Columbiadamm.<br /><br />Final things: Bring som
 ething to drink. (No alcohol in the space\, please.) Don't forget sunblock 
 if you need it. If you've got a dance mat- bring it by!<br /><br />The Outd
 oor Savoy Satellites are:<br />Fox - ss<br />Patrick Braun - ts<br />Vojta 
 Drnek – acc <br />Conor Cantrell - git<br />Heiko Grumpelt - b<br />Jan Zim
 mermann – dr</span></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220429T100256Z
LOCATION:https://goo.gl/maps/CM6ZrGXLABnybxqn8
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swing Outdoors with the Savoy Satellites
TRANSP:OPAQUE
