DESCRIPTION:Last Swing Charity Event For Kids In Syria was a success and we
  would like to support people living directly in Berlin this time by collec
 ting donations for the Berliner Stadtmission.\nWe are especially interested
  in supporting the "Kältebus" (cold bus) project of this help organization.
  During the cold season the cold bus drives around the city every night to 
 collect homeless people\, who can't make it to the emergency accommodation 
 on their own. Those people got offered help\, hot tea\, transportation to d
 esired place or sleeping bags by the cold bus.\n\nTo support the Berliner S
 tadtmission we will offer a donation based Shim Sham workshop and a fundrai
 sing party. All the donations will go to the organization. Beside money don
 ations you can also donate items like food and clothes\, which includes:\n\
 ncoffee\, tea\, sugar\, margarine\, rice\, noodles\, marmelade\, fresh frui
 ts\, long-life milk\nunderwear\, socks\, hand gloves\, caps\, scarves\, win
 tershoes\, warm outer clothings\, sleeping bags\, sleeping mats\n\nSCHEDULE
 \n19:00 - 21:00 Shim Sham Workshop (please donate)\n21:00 Fundraising Party
  (min. 5EUR entry)\n\nLOCATION CHANGE!!!\nQueen Qotti\nAdalbertstrasse 98/U
 -Bahn Kottbusser Tor\, 10999 Kreuzberg\n\nWe hope to share this amazing dan
 cing night with all you dancers and at the same time help others\, who are 
 not as fortunate as us\, to have a better future. Every little bit will hel
 p\, no matter how small\, and we will ensure your goodwill and spirit of pa
 rticipation are recognised.\n\nDetails:\nwww.DancingDuc.com\n\nMade possibl
 e by:\nSwingspiration\nBerlin HOP\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/143583
 6003302759/
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T094349Z
LOCATION:Adalbertstr 98
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Swing Charity: Shim Sham Against the Cold
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
