 nThe official restrictions are lifted for now\, \nbut we still kindly ask\,
  well implore you \nto do a test before you come anyway.\n\n\nLet's stay sa
 fe and protect each other \nas much as we can !\n \n \nCome early and stay 
 late !\n\n  \nGenerous donations for bands and djs \nare highly appreciated
  and expected.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBeautiful Balboa beats and tunes \non every Tue
 sday.\n\nFast\, mid-tempo and slow. \n\nAll styles of Jazz. \n\n\nIf you li
 ke to party \n\nand enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, \n\nyou will have 
 a good time at Bellmer Balboa. \n\n\nGenerous donations for bands and djs \
 nare highly appreciated and expected !\n\n- - - - -\n\nEnter the RAW-area a
 t the corner \nof Revaler Straße & Simon-Dach-Straße \ndown the stairs and 
 then \n> it's the first bar to your right. \n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/bel
 lmerbalboa
