DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><span><br>Pack your dance shoes- we're
  going for a vintage flight of fancy in the historic surroundings of Tempel
 hof airport.<br><br>Move to the swinging tunes of the jazz era in open air-
  yet in the shade- thanks to what was at its time the largest awning in the
  world.<br><br>We'll be accompanied on our flight by a veteran of the Berli
 n Airlift: a sleek and stately C-54 "Skymaster".<br><br>There will be a com
 fortable dancefloor on site as well as drinks and light refreshments availa
 ble at the RosinenBAR.<br><br>15:30-19:00 DJ and dance dance dance<br>&nbsp
 \;<br>Entry: Spende. <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/76716
 95036235521">https://www.facebook.com/events/7671695036235521</a><br><br>--
 -<br></span><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
