 vening on a beautiful terrace\, we got you covered! All of this awaits you 
 in Orville's\, formally a US army casino\, now a charming bar near Tempelho
 fer Feld<br><br></span></span></span></font><p>This time we have again one 
 and only Peperina Swing!</p><p>Eric Doyle - Guitar<br>Fabio Radermacher - T
 rumpet<br>Facundo Olivera - Drums<br>Hayley Kavanagh - Tenor Sax<br>Steffan
  Müller - Double Bass</p><span>So what's the plan?</span><br></html-blob><h
 tml-blob><p><span>‣</span> 18:30 The floor is openwith DJ Carlos<br><span>‣
 </span> 19:00 Live music starts!<br><span>‣</span> 19:45 DJ music<br><span>
 ‣</span> 20:15 Band second set<br><span>‣</span> 21:00 DJ music</p><font><s
 pan><span><span><br><br><span>⭐️</span> Free Entry!<br><br><span>🍹</span> 
 Please don't bring drinks other than water! The bar has an excellent drink 
 selection and of course\, we also want to support it! Additionally\, you sh
 ould also try some snacks and pizza that the establishment has to offer.<br
 ><br><span>👉</span> Please also note that we want to create an event that 
 is a safe space and has a friendly and welcoming environment for everyone\,
  regardless of gender\, sexual orientation\, ability\, ethnicity\, socioeco
 nomic status\, age and religion (or lack thereof). In case it comes to your
  attention or you are affected by any inappropriate behavior\, we ask you t
 o let us know\, so we can take action and prevent such situations to happen
  again. You can recognize the organizational team by their yellow bands or 
 contact us via the Facebook event.<span><br><br>FB if the event: <a href="h
 ttps://www.facebook.com/events/1475364422920216">https://www.facebook.com/e
 vents/1475364422920216</a><br>FB of the organizers: <a href="https://www.fa
 cebook.com/Swing-is-in-the-Air-at-Orvilles-with-Live-Music-109238155168591"
 >https://www.facebook.com/Swing-is-in-the-Air-at-Orvilles-with-Live-Music-1
 09238155168591</a><br><br>We hope to see you there!<br>The Swing is in the 
 Air Team</span></span></span></span></font><font><span><span><span><br>&nbs
 p\;</span></span></span></font><u></u><br><u></u><font><span><span><span><b
 r>-pt </span></span></span></font><u></u><u></u></html-blob>
