 so has a plot. Want to come watch it with us? I've got a short or two I can
  show beforehand as well\, as an appetizer...\n\nSchedule:\n2145-2330 Movie
 \n2315-???? Dance!\n\nIf you're planning on coming please RSVP so we know h
 ow many to expect!\n\nYou can come alone or with a partner.\n\nNo cover\, b
 ut tip your V/DJ! (1€ would be nice...)\n\nAfterwards\, I'll lay down some 
 swing-dancing tunes to please your feet! See you there!
