 n Eurem Tanzstil basteln.\nIn den Pausen Swing + Hot Jazz zum Tanzen aus de
 r Konserve.\nFree entry.\nNice 20's ambience & you can try lots of sorts Ab
 sinth or non-alcoholic cocktails...\n\nPublic transfer: U1\, U2\, U3\, U4\,
  Bus M19\, Bus 187\, Bus 106\, Nollendorfplatz. (at night: Bus N26\, Bus N2
 )\n\nSwing by.\nCheers\nC.K.\n
