BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20131116T210000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20131117T040000
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:dgt5esofnrr58vqpeqi27g2h88@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20131116T210000
CREATED:20131024T112904Z
DESCRIPTION:BOOK the whole party pass for only 30€ at http://www.cirque-du-
 solo.com/party-pass/!\n\n\nSATURDAY 16th November - THE BALL\nDress code: F
 ancy. Evening dress to kill and tuxedo/suit to make the ladies go OMG!\nTim
 e: 21.00 - 04.00\nEntry fee: 15€\nDJs: Shorty George (US/Istanbul)\, Kris (
 Ghentlemen\, Ghent)\, Greta (Leipzig)\nHighlight: Nomad Swing live music fr
 om Belgium\n\nWhat to expect:\nA night at the Delphi just as if we were bac
 k in the 1920s\, when this was Berlin's cultural hotspot. Stars like Marlen
 e Dietrich and Fritz Lang were there. The Delphi theater miraculously survi
 ved WWII and remained closed during GDR times. In fact\, the theater has re
 mained closed to the general public since the war and is still today.\nCome
  dressed like a star and experience the glamour and flair of this extraordi
 nary venue. \nOur feet will be swinging to music from Nomad Swing\, a group
  of very talented musicians from Flanders who have a passion for music from
  the twenties to the fifties and already stunned many crowds of dancing and
  non-dancing audience.\n\n\nAll information also on website:\nhttp://www.ci
 rque-du-solo.com/parties/\n\nand Facebook:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events
 /585540338148951/?fref=ts\n\nThese parties are part of Cirque du Solo 2013 
 which also offers Authentic Jazz workshops:\nhttp://www.cirque-du-solo.com/
 workshop\n\n- OF -
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095339Z
LOCATION:Ehemaliges Stummfilmkino Delphi Berlin - Gustav-Adolf-Straße 2\, 1
 3086 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cirque du Solo - THE BALL
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
