DESCRIPTION:*bounce bounce bounce*\n\nTONIGHT: The Berlin Buskerteers\nDJ: 
 Marcus ISTF\n\nEintritt: three euro at the door\, for dancers and nondancer
 s alike. Cheaper than a döner kebab with cheese\, tastes better too.\n\nCan
 't afford the €3\, or are just plain nice? Help us for 30mins on the door (
 i.e. sit in a comfy chair\, take people's money and listen to the band) in 
 exchange for your ticket! We need people between 2130-0000. Message us at b
 erlinhop@gmail.com for details.\n\n\nVenue: Tante Emma is a relaxed bar at 
 Schlesisches Tor. Plush old furniture\, long\, extravagant bar\, tealights\
 , and... a wood floor. All fronted by big\, beautiful windows looking out o
 nto nighttime Kreuzberg. Lots of room for both dancing and hanging out.\n\n
 Live music every Thursday! A rotating cast of Berliner bands play for your 
 enjoyment. DJ before and after the band. Lindy\, balboa\, blues\, and every
 thing in between. Open end!\n\n-mh
