DESCRIPTION:HBC is a place full of strange and wonderful things. There\, yo
 u can find a Michelin-rated restaurant\, photo exhibitions\, and a bar with
  colored neon tubes on the ceiling (!!!). Every once in a while\, you might
  see a punk rock show.\n\nBut on Tuesday nights\, it's ours. 120m2 of parqu
 et with a great sound system. A stage for live acts. Comfortable chairs. (!
 !!)\n\nNo neighbors\, no problem. Let's dance. \n\nLIVE on the evening: The
  Berlin Buskerteers. They really wowed us before at Hochsitz Bar- now\, let
 's try hearing them in a much larger space.\n\nEintritt €5-10 (choose-your-
 own-price\, according to your own financial situation and love of live musi
 c.)\n\n-mh
