DESCRIPTION:Blues underground. Descend the secret staircase into a full-on 
 blues party\, where the lights are low\, the drinks are cheap\, and sweaty 
 bodies meet to shake the nights away. Music both fast and slow\, this is go
 ing to be an experience you don't want to miss!\n\nWith musical guests THE 
 JZ JAMES TRIO\, featuring\nJZ James on vocals and guitar\,\nPete "the Wildd
 uck" on harmonica\,\nand Heiko Grumpelt on double bass\,\nwe'll hear a set 
 of ass shakin' low down all time blues classics mixed with some of JZ´s tas
 ty originals. The band will begin promptly at 2200 and stop at midnight. Af
 terwards\, the DJs will keep you moving both fast and slow until the sun pe
 eks out from under its winter coat!\n\nI hear you stammering\, asking yours
 elf\, "but...well...erm...". I see you counting the pennies in your pocket 
 with apprehension. I have heard that Berlin is a city of poverty- well\, I 
 say to you that it is a city of riches both of spirit and soul! The pleasur
 e that this event will bring to you is available for the less-than-princely
  sum of 5€\, payable to the friendly folks at the door.\n\nBefore the event
 \, you also have the opportunity to learn a little bit of the blues from me
 ! I'll be teaching a class from 2045-2200 on the blues\, appropriate for be
 ginners and veterans alike. More details to follow!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T094621Z
LOCATION:Fuchs und Elster\, Weserstr 207\, 12047 Berlin
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Indigo Down Low Blues
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
