DESCRIPTION:Hep hep! Come and see what the swing era is all about! Dance wi
 th Berlin's biggest band\, Kind of Dukish + special guest vocalist Lisa Bas
 senge. Live hot jazz shakes your body and moves your feet in a beautiful vi
 ntage Kinosaal. Performance acts snap\, crackle\, and hop! Break out your s
 winging vintage attire and dress to impress\, it'll be a ball!\n\nWe start 
 off the night with a short introduction to Swing at 20h for those looking t
 o stretch their legs\, and then it's on to swinging big band music\, incred
 ible performances\, and- if we get it just right with the cocktails- we'll 
 travel back in time to what the swing epoch must have looked like\, so many
  years ago.\n\nDJ-team: Mad Oli v. Marcus ISTF v. Wild Chris\n\nEntry: 10€ 
 VVK\, 12€ AK\nTickets: berlinhop@gmail.com\nDress: 20s-30s\n\nhttps://www.f
