DESCRIPTION:**YES\, IT IS ON A TUESDAY\, BUT THE DAY AFTER IS A HOLIDAY! WH
 OOP!**\n\nBerlin workers! Don your best overalls and dance into May Day at 
 Kinostalgia’s 'Modern Times' themed Workers Ball. On Tuesday 30th April\, K
 inostalgia will screen Charlie Chaplin’s delightful and timeless film 'Mode
 rn Times' followed by a foot-loose party with industrial levels of dancing 
 and good old-fashioned fun.\n\nThe screening of 'Modern Times' will be foll
 owed by a Workers' Ball accompanied by Goodnight Circus. The party will con
 tinue on until the early hours of May 1st with DJ Marcus ISTF.\n\nSit back 
 in the charming surroundings of Villa Neukölln and enjoy a signature cockta
 il while watching one of the greatest comedies of all time before dancing t
 he night away.\n***********************************************************
 ***\nTickets are available for just the dance from midnight\, if you like (
 5€ AK). If you'd like to see the movie as well\, please see/join this event
 : https://www.facebook.com/events/277177969083246/\n\n*********************
 *****************************************\nLINEUP:\n21:30 Doors\n22:00 Scre
 ening of Modern Times\n00:00 Workers Dance hosted by Berlin HOP with Goodni
 ght Circus\n02:00 DJ Marcus ISTF\n\nTickets are:\n10€ for both the movie an
 d the dance (earlybird discount available if you purchase online: http://ki
 nostalgia.tickets.de/)\n5€ for just the dance (available at the door after 
 the movie).\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/277177969083246/\n\nModern T
 imes: http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0027977/\n\n-mh
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095042Z
LOCATION:Villa Neukölln\, Hermannstraße 233\, 12049 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Goodnight Circus @ Modern Times Workers' Ball!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
