DESCRIPTION:*bounce bounce bounce*\n\nTONIGHT: TBA\nDJ: Marcus ISTF\n\nEint
 ritt: three euro at the door\, for dancers and nondancers alike. Cheaper th
 an a döner kebab with cheese\, tastes better too.\n\nCan't afford the €3\, 
 or are just plain nice? Help us for 30mins on the door (i.e. sit in a comfy
  chair\, take people's money and listen to the band) in exchange for your t
 icket! We need people between 2130-0000. Message us at berlinhop@gmail.com 
 for details.\n\n\nVenue: Tante Emma is a relaxed bar at Schlesisches Tor. P
 lush old furniture\, long\, extravagant bar\, tealights\, and... a wood flo
 or. All fronted by big\, beautiful windows looking out onto nighttime Kreuz
 berg. Lots of room for both dancing and hanging out.\n\nLive music every Th
 ursday! A rotating cast of Berliner bands play for your enjoyment. DJ befor
 e and after the band. Lindy\, balboa\, blues\, and everything in between. O
 pen end!\n\n-mh
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095132Z
LOCATION:Köpenicker Str 1A\, 10997 Berlin
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LIVE @ Hop bei Emma!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
