CREATED:20120205T123010Z
DESCRIPTION:HBC is a place full of strange and wonderful things. There\, yo
 u can find a Michelin-rated restaurant\, photo exhibitions\, and a bar with
  colored neon tubes on the ceiling (!!!). Every once in a while\, you might
  see a punk rock show.\n\nBut on Tuesday nights\, it's ours. 120m2 of parqu
 et with a great sound system. A stage for live acts. Comfortable chairs.\n\
 nNo neighbors\, no problem. Let's dance. \n\nSpecial this week: The HBC "Va
 lentine's Sway". Yeah\, it's Valentine's Day. Whether you're a lonely heart
  or soul-bonded for all time\, this promises to be a fun dance. We're going
  to open up a little blues room off the main dance floor\, and lots of othe
 r special things will be going on\, too.\n\nDress to impress! We'll have so
 meone taking pictures on the evening so you can remember the coolest Valent
 ine's Day you've ever experienced...\n\nLive on the evening: Shoe Swing Str
 ingers and Friends. Basically the same guys as on Wednesday last week (they
  have a name!)\, but with shorter songs\, and Carlos on the keys! And two s
 ets. Whoop!\n\nEintritt €5-10 (choose-your-own-price\, according to your ow
 n financial situation and love of live music/special events.)
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095510Z
LOCATION:.HBC Berlin\, Karl-Liebknecht Str 9
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Valentine's Sway! LIVE: Shoe String Swingers @ HBC
TRANSP:OPAQUE
