DESCRIPTION:Let's bring in the spring with a swing! Dance with Berlin's big
 gest band\, Kind of Dukish. Hot jazz shakes your body and moves your feet i
 n a beautiful parquet-floored room. Performance acts snap\, crackle\, and h
 op! Break out your swinging vintage attire and dress to impress\, it'll be 
 a ball!\n\nWe start off the night with a short introduction to Swing at 210
 0 for those looking to stretch their legs\, and then it's on to swinging bi
 g band music\, incredible performances\, and- if we get it just right with 
 the cocktails- we'll travel back in time to what the swing epoch must have 
 looked like\, so many years ago.\n\nDJ: Mad Oli v.  Marcus ISTF  v. Romino 
 Power\n\nEntry: 15€ AK\nReservations: berlinhop@gmail.com\nDress: 20s-30s\n
 \nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/359027377541031/
