 cus\nTime: 21.00 - 03.00\nEntry fee: 5€\nHighlight: DJ BATTLE\n\nWhat to ex
 pect:\nWelcome to the Circus! This is the place where everyones talents are
  welcome for display\, whether it is a dance\, acrobatic\, stand-up comedy\
 , or simply looking amazingly funny. We want to see red noses\, hand-stands
 \, lots of chaos\, and colors! Flying carpets and bearded ladies!\n\nThe Ci
 rcus is going to rock (uhm... swing) your world with our visiting and local
  DJs that will be battling for fame and glory! Our MC and DJ coordinator Sh
 orty George will host this battle between the following line-up:\nDJ Kris (
 Ghentlemen)\, Belgium\nDJ Greta\, Germany\nDJ Chris “The Wild Man” Wild\, G
 ermany\nDJ Fröken Frida\, Sweden\n\n\nAll information also on website:\nhtt
 p://www.cirque-du-solo.com/parties/\n\nand Facebook:\nhttps://www.facebook.
 com/events/585540338148951/?fref=ts\n\nThese parties are part of Cirque du 
 Solo 2013 which also offers Authentic Jazz workshops:\nhttp://www.cirque-du
 -solo.com/workshop\n\n- OF -
