 ils.\n\nALSO\, free open practice in the backroom before the evening starts
 \, 2015-2130. Come on by and share what you learned over the summer!\n\n\nV
 enue: Tante Emma is a relaxed bar at Schlesisches Tor. Plush old furniture\
 , long\, extravagant bar\, tealights\, and... a wood floor. All fronted by 
