DESCRIPTION:CANCELLED/FÄLLT AUS! First\, we'll watch some of the best Lindy
  Hop scenes in history\, featuring no less than Whitey's Lindy Hoppers (Fra
 nkie Manning)\, Dean Collins\, and Martha Raye- surrounded by 80 minutes of
  bizarre vaudeville-musical acts and running gags- including a guy in a law
 nchair tied to balloons\, slow-motion shots of people jumping into swimming
  pools\, and the finest special effects of the late 1930s. A must-see for l
 indy hoppers. Show starts at 20h sharp!\n\nThen: Dance those demons out! En
 ter these hallowed halls\, pay your respects to the ghosts of Lindy Hop and
 - with a little luck- resurrect "that old feeling".\n\nLocation: GALILÄAKIR
 CHE - Widerstandsmuseum\, Rigaer Str.9\, 10247 Berlin\n\nDoors open at 1930
 h.\nFilm at 20h.\nEntry: 5€\n\n-mh
