DESCRIPTION:Come and celebrate the Blues Dance with us - all night long!\n\
 n21:30h: Teachers' demo\n23:00h: JZ James (Guitar) and Blues legend "SCH" (
 Blues Harp) will get you into the Blues groove with excellent live music\n\
 nEntrance fee: 5 Euro (free for participants of the Blues workshop with Cam
 pbell & Chris)\n\nLocation: Upstairs Room in the Frannz Club - Just go up t
 he stairs!\n\nAbout JZ James:\nOn stage since 1983 Jz James as singer songw
 riter guitarist composer mixes Blues with Folk\, Jazz\, Soul and Gospel in 
 a most unique way. Trademarks are his raspy and most expressive voice and h
 is virtuoso fingerpicking on acoustic and electric guitar. Influences reach
  from Lightning Hopkins to Big Bill Broonzy\, from Nina Simone to Ray Charl
 es\, from Charles Mingus to Thelonious Monk\, from Van Morrison to Tom Wait
 s\, from Staple Singers "Soul Folk" to String Band Music and to Americana R
 oots Sounds.\n\nFor the Blues Workshop Party Jz James will deliver a mix of
  Blues sounds\, from Down Home to Big City\, from Classics to Originals.\n\
 nJz James will be supported by Berlin Blues Legend "SCH" on Blues Harp.\n\n
 Facebook event: http://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=169840313071080\nWebs
 ite: http://bluesberlin.jimdo.com/blues-workshop-with-campbell-chris/partie
 s/
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T094811Z
LOCATION:Frannz Club (Upstairs)\, Schönhauser Allee 36\, 10435 Berlin
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Big Blues Dance Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
