DESCRIPTION:We will be opening this years Cirque du Solo with an incredible
  circus party! The line up will include instant artistry with jugglers\, cl
 owns\, soothsayers and an open stage for the braves\, famous international 
 DJs and a live music show!\n\n\nKind of Circus – live music show\nIn coorpo
 ration with Christian Ahrens\, leader of Berlins finest small big band Kind
  of Dukish\, we will create a live music show with dancing\, singing and – 
 of course – finest swing & hot jazz music!\nPhoto by David Gauffin \n\n\nDJ
  Shorty George & Friends\nFlying him in again and again for Berlins biggest
  Swing events\, Shorty George can already be seen as a regular – but still 
 it feels special every time he plays in Berlin. He will be the main DJ for 
 this weekend and\, together with some friends of ours\, will make sure that
  we can still dance if the last trumpet is already deep asleep.\nPhoto by D
 avid Gauffin \n\n\nLocation\nB-swingt is a dance studio. You won’t expect a
  circus there? Be told a better by our excellent party & decoration team ar
 ound Party Amanimal! They will magically transform this charming old factor
 y basement into a circus tent! You will find it following Reichenberger Str
 aße from Kottbusser Tor and ending up in Ritterstr. 12.\n\n\nEntrance\n10 €
  – but only…\n7 € – if you dress up according to the circus theme and not m
 ore than…\n5 € – if you also perform your best (or funniest\, or worst\, or
  just any) trick on our open stage!\n\n\nhttp://www.cirque-du-solo.com/part
 ies/the-circus/\n\n\n-OF-
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095420Z
LOCATION:B-swingt\, Ritterstr. 12\, Berlin Kreuzberg
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Circus - Cirque du Solo 2012
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
