DESCRIPTION:*bounce bounce bounce*\n\nTONIGHT: Savoy Satellites\nDJ: Marcus
  ISTF\n\nEintritt: three euro at the door\, for dancers and nondancers alik
 e. Cheaper than a döner kebab with cheese\, tastes better too.\n\nCan't aff
 ord the €3\, or are just plain nice? Help us for 30mins on the door (i.e. s
 it in a comfy chair\, take people's money and listen to the band) in exchan
 ge for your ticket! We need people between 2130-0000. Message us for detail
 s.\n\n\nVenue: Tante Emma is a relaxed bar at Schlesisches Tor. Plush old f
 urniture\, long\, extravagant bar\, tealights\, and... a wood floor. All fr
 onted by big\, beautiful windows looking out onto nighttime Kreuzberg. Lots
  of room for both dancing and hanging out.\n\nLive music every Thursday! A 
 rotating cast of Berliner bands play for your enjoyment. DJ before and afte
 r the band. Lindy\, balboa\, blues\, and everything in between. Open end!\n
 \n-mh
