DESCRIPTION:Do that lindy hop!\n\nTante Emma is a relaxed bar at Schlesisch
 es Tor. Plush old furniture\, long\, extravagant bar\, tealights\, and... a
  wood floor. All fronted by big\, beautiful windows looking out onto nightt
 ime Kreuzberg. Lots of room for both dancing and hanging out.\n\nLive music
  every Thursday! A rotating cast of Berliner bands play for your enjoyment.
  DJ before and after the band. Open end!\n\nACHTUNG! We'll start a little l
 ater this week- we'll watch the semifinal and then will either celebrate or
  mourn by dancing to live music afterwards- from 23 Uhr or so? Dancing star
 ts right after the match. Yes\, we will return to the normal schedule after
  all of this football madness dies down.\n\nTONIGHT: The Berlin Buskerteers
 \nDJ: Marcus ISTF\n\nEintritt: two whole euro at the door\, for dancers and
  nondancers alike. Cheaper than a döner\, tastes better too.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095251Z
LOCATION:Köpenicker Str 1A\, 10997 Berlin
