DESCRIPTION:Let's go to the movies! And then dance afterwards!\n\nFeaturing
  some of the most amazing lindy hop sequences ever recorded\, utterly bizar
 re self-referential humor\, and slow-motion shots of people jumping into a 
 pool\, Hellzapoppin' (1941\, 84min) is a great film. Want to come watch it 
 with us? I've got a short or two I can show beforehand as well\, as an appe
 tizer...\n\nSchedule:\n2015-2145 Movie\n2200-???? Dance!\n\nNo cover\, but 
 tip your V/DJ!\n\nAfterwards\, DJ Marcus Is Stranger Than Fiction will lay 
 down some swing-dancing tunes to please your feet! Fast and slow\, old and 
 new. See you there!
