  (Electro Swing Malta)\nhttps://soundcloud.com/thechef-2\n* Dockerbone (Ele
 ctro Swing Malta)\n\n\nAndere Specials: Glitzer-Service\, Absinth Cocktails
 \, Siebdruck uvm.\n\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/events/217503995058677/?fref
 =ts\n\nWeb: www.spartacus-potsdam.de
