DESCRIPTION:Froggy Mountain Boys are playing our last concert of the year\,
  and Aaron (of the Froggys) is turning 30. Come and celebrate with us in 3 
 Schwestern\, we're going to play that sweet Western Swing music you love to
  dance to. Featuring Roland on fiddle\, Laurent on guitar\, Johannes on bas
 s\, Laurin on clarinet\, and Aaron on banjo and fiddle. Also featuring DJ L
 obotomy for the after party!\n\nAnd for his birthday Aaron doesn't want any
  gifts\, he only wants to make a new recording with the Froggys\, so all th
 e money from the door will go to pay for studio time and recording expenses
 .\n\nDoors open at 9:30\, entry 5-10 euros.\n\nwww.myspace.com/thefroggymou
 ntainboys\nhttp://3schwestern-berlin.de/\n\nWeb: https://www.facebook.com/e
 vent.php?eid=118961354874819\n\nIH
