DESCRIPTION:*bounce bounce bounce* \nEXTRA: Tonight is the opening party of
  the Argentino Lindy Invasion workshop! See Manu\, Mari\, and Gaston shake 
 a leg!\n\nTONIGHT: Brave Buben Jazzband\nDJ: Marcus ISTF\n\nEintritt: three
  euro at the door\, for dancers and nondancers alike. Cheaper than a döner 
 kebab with cheese\, tastes better too.\n\nCan't afford the €3\, or are just
  plain nice? Help us for 30mins on the door (i.e. sit in a comfy chair\, ta
 ke people's money and listen to the band) in exchange for your ticket! We n
 eed people between 2130-0000. Message us for details.\n\n\nVenue: Tante Emm
 a is a relaxed bar at Schlesisches Tor. Plush old furniture\, long\, extrav
 agant bar\, tealights\, and... a wood floor. All fronted by big\, beautiful
  windows looking out onto nighttime Kreuzberg. Lots of room for both dancin
 g and hanging out.\n\nLive music every Thursday! A rotating cast of Berline
 r bands play for your enjoyment. DJ before and after the band. Lindy\, balb
 oa\, blues\, and everything in between. Open end!\n\n-mh
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095251Z
LOCATION:Köpenicker Str 1A\, 10997 Berlin
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Argentinos + Brave Buben Jazzband @ Hop bei Emma!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
