DESCRIPTION:Elle G - two young ladies from Vilnius\, Lithuania\, playing so
 ft\, swinging songs from the 30s to the 80s. The fun-loving duo‘s chemistry
  revives English\, french & lithuanian melodies from the vinyl era. As a sm
 all band\, Elle G use only a few instruments – the ukulele\, melodica\, kaz
 oo\, some shakers and rattles\, and their own voices. However\, they put on
  a performance for both ears and eyes. Elena and Giedrė have already shared
  the warmth and softness of their cashmere voices in Lithuania and neighbou
 ring Latvia. This year they‘ve decided to warm up the chilly autumn in Berl
 in!\n\n\nElena Augustinaitė - ukulele\, vocal\, smile\nGiedrė Nalivaikaitė 
 - vocal\, kazoo\, melodica\, glockenspiel\, shakers\, eyes
