DESCRIPTION:<p>This is the Monday Shuffle\, our new weekly social dance in 
 Ballhaus Prinzenallee. We are adopting the former Monday Social that has be
 en a fixture in the Berlin Lindy Hop community for 14! Years (first at Jede
 r ist Tanzbar and later with SwingStep)\, but we want to shuffle it around 
 a bit. We are still in the process of creating the exact schedule\, but the
 re is a rough outline for each Monday evening\, so this is what you can exp
 ect:</p><p>We will have different DJs for your dancing pleasure and a reaso
 nably priced bar. Besides occasional live music we will have recorded music
  with different DJs that focus on danceable Swing music\, but not only. We 
 want to embrace all the different Black American cultural art forms\, so we
  invite our DJs (and bands) to be free in choosing their music with variety
 . There might be New Orleans Jazz\, Big Band Swing\, Kansas City Blues\, Be
 bop\, Rhythm'n'Blues\, Funk\, Soul\, Disco\, House\, Hip Hop (you name it..
 .)\, so we can all explore how our bodies want to move to different syncopa
 ted rhythms!</p><p><span>Price: From </span><span>5 EUR</span></p><p><span>
 If you cannot afford to pay our suggested prices\, just talk to us at the d
 oor and let’s find a solution! We don’t want your financial situation to st
 op you from joining our event.</span><br></p><br><p>The social dancing is p
 art of a bigger evening program that includes also dance classes\, music cl
 asses and a jam session for musicians. <span>Here are more details about th
 e different activities:</span></p><p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/even
 ts/117645537968785/117648304635175/">https://www.facebook.com/events/117645
 537968785/117648304635175/</a><span><br></span></p><p>-of-</p><br><br><p><b
 r></p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T105020Z
LOCATION:Ballhaus Prinzenallee\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deutschla
 nd
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Shuffle @ Ballhaus Prinzenallee
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
