DESCRIPTION:[On *Monday* this time! But usually on Sundays!]\n\nLet's go to
  the movies! And then dance afterwards!\n\nFeaturing some of the most amazi
 ng lindy hop sequences ever recorded\, utterly bizarre self-referential hum
 or\, and slow-motion shots of people jumping into a pool\, Hellzapoppin' (1
 941\, 84min) is a great film. Want to come watch it with us? I've got a sho
 rt or two I can show beforehand as well\, as an appetizer...\n\nSchedule:\n
 2100-2145 Free Swing Dance Lesson for Complete Beginners\n2145-2315 Movie\n
 2315-???? Dance!\n\nThe lesson before the movie is a free 45-minute intro c
 lass to swing dancing from 2100-2145. Afterwards\, we'll watch Hellzapoppin
  and then there's an open dance party from 2315 on.\n\nYou don't need any p
 rior dance experience\, the class is designed for complete beginners. If yo
 u're planning on coming please RSVP so we know how many to expect! (rsvp he
 re: http://www.facebook.com/events/287000621343364/\, or just send me an em
 ail!)\n\nYou can come alone or with a partner\, we'll ask you to dance just
  the same. We're all friendly people\, and everyone's a beginner\, so no wo
 rries!\n\nNo cover\, but tip your V/DJ! (1€ would be nice...)\n\nAfterwards
 \, I'll lay down some swing-dancing tunes to please your feet! See you ther
 e! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095542Z
LOCATION:Filmkunst Bar\, Reichenberger Str 133
