BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230522T204500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230522T234500
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:16r5lml12gfq6ejkm84n8rtnt1_R20230522T184500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230522T204500
CREATED:20221128T223912Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>We are so happy to present you our first special workshop. T
 his time we want to highlight Caribbean cultures\, especially dancehall\, w
 hich originated in Jamaica in the 1970s and Soca\, which originated arond t
 he same time in Trinidad and Tobago. Both still today are some of the most 
 popular afro-diasporic dance and music forms. Here you find all information
  for this special evening:<br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/
 215019981238243">https://www.facebook.com/events/215019981238243</a><br><br
 ><br>Regular event text:</p><p><span>This is the Monday Shuffle\, our new w
 eekly social dance in Ballhaus Prinzenallee. We are adopting the former Mon
 day Social that has been a fixture in the Berlin Lindy Hop community for 14
 ! Years (first at Jeder ist Tanzbar and later with SwingStep)\, but we want
  to shuffle it around a bit. We are still in the process of creating the ex
 act schedule\, but there is a rough outline for each Monday evening\, so th
 is is what you can expect:</span><br></p><p>We will have different DJs for 
 your dancing pleasure and a reasonably priced bar. Besides occasional live 
 music we will have recorded music with different DJs that focus on danceabl
 e Swing music\, but not only. We want to embrace all the different Black Am
 erican cultural art forms\, so we invite our DJs (and bands) to be free in 
 choosing their music with variety. There might be New Orleans Jazz\, Big Ba
 nd Swing\, Kansas City Blues\, Bebop\, Rhythm'n'Blues\, Funk\, Soul\, Disco
 \, House\, Hip Hop (you name it...)\, so we can all explore how our bodies 
 want to move to different syncopated rhythms!</p><p><span>Price: From </spa
 n><span>5 EUR</span></p><p><span>If you cannot afford to pay our suggested 
 prices\, just talk to us at the door and let’s find a solution! We don’t wa
 nt your financial situation to stop you from joining our event.</span><br><
 /p><br><p>The social dancing is part of a bigger evening program that inclu
 des also dance classes\, music classes and a jam session for musicians. <sp
 an>Here are more details about the different activities:</span></p><p><a hr
 ef="https://www.facebook.com/events/117645537968785/117648304635175/">https
 ://www.facebook.com/events/117645537968785/117648304635175/</a><span><br></
 span></p><p>-of-</p><br><br><p><br></p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T105020Z
LOCATION:Ballhaus Prinzenallee\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deutschla
 nd
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Shuffle: Carribean Cultures Special @ Ballhaus Prinzenallee
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
