 e <br>a music-video for their piece <b>“Sashimi Strut”</b>. <br><br>Taking 
 almost a year from conception to completion\, <br>this animation has proven
  to be their most ambitious project to date.<br><b>This afternoon event wil
 l feature both a live concert <br>from the Rufus Temple Orchestra and a scr
