DESCRIPTION:\nWelcome to Shag Jam Berlin\, our shag social in Café Fincan N
 eukölln 👯‍♂️🤗 \n\nThe Social will start at 15:00 with DJ Music. \n\nCafe 
 Fincan has a beautiful back room of 55m2 with a great dance floor. We will 
 have a variety of shaggy music with different tempos for you 🎵\n\nIf you w
 ant to take a break or want to hang out you can go for a coffee/drink or so
 me snacks in the entrance room of the cafe ☕🍰🍪\n\nThe social is an event 
 open for all levels\, no matter if you are shagging very actively or if you
 r shag is a bit rusty.\n\nWe can play music with open windows and we have b
 ig ventilators to keep you shagging without breaking a sweat 💨\n\nIn case 
 you feel uncomfortable or overwhelmed with a person or any incident\, pleas
 e come to us at any time!\n\nWe are also happy to receive your feedback aft
 er the event 👍\n\nThis is a donation based event\, which will support the 
 cafe Fincan. Pay as much as you want or what feels appropriate 😊\n\n\nWe a
 re looking forward to seeing you there and to shagging with you 👯‍♂️\n\nFo
 r more info about the class or the social 👉 www.facebook.com/shagjam
