BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230320T204500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230320T234500
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:3p8b18h30fp7rqoek8hdrmcmo4_R20230206T194500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230320T204500
CREATED:20221128T223912Z
DESCRIPTION:TODAY with DJ <span>Sevinç!!!<br></span><br>Facts:<br>- Every M
 onday\, 20:45 - 23:45<br>- Ballhaus Prinzenalle\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 B
 erlin (close to U Pankstr\, U Osloer Str\, S+U Gesundbrunnen)<br>- Entrance
 : 5-15 EUR (free for SwingStep city pass subscribers)*<br><br>We are back! 
 After more than two years of break\, we are very happy that we can do our M
 onday Social again\, because we really missed that cozy atmosphere\, dancin
 g to great music\, enjoying a drink at the bar\, socializing and hanging ou
 t...<br><br>Besides occasional live sets we will have recorded music with d
 ifferent DJs that focus on danceable Swing music\, but not only. We want to
  embrace all the differernt Black American cultural art forms\, so we invit
 e our DJs (and bands) to be free in choosing their music with variety. Ther
 e might be New Orleans Jazz\, Big Band Swing\, Kansas City Blues\, Bebop\, 
 Rhythm'n'Blues\, Funk\, Soul\, Disco\, House\, Hip Hop (you name it...)\, s
 o we can all explore how our bodies want to move to different syncopated rh
 ythms!<br><br>Other than that\, we aim to create a relaxed atmosphere that 
 feels welcome to anyone and everyone. There is no dress code\, but there is
  a code of conduct (<a href="https://swingstep.com/legal/safer-space-code-o
 f-conduct/).">https://swingstep.com/legal/safer-space-code-of-conduct/).</a
 > We want you to know that if you feel unsafe / bothered by something or so
 meone\, you can always come to talk to any of us. Also\, if you have any fe
 edback / advice on our code of conduct or policies\, please reach out to us
  (we are always learning) :)<br><br>There might be moments during the party
  when we take photos or film for documentation and social media. By coming 
 to the event you are agreeing to this\, but you can always talk to the pers
 on behind the camera or us\, if you prefer not to be captured\, so please d
 on't hesitate. <br>All infos on our media policies: <a href="https://swings
 tep.com/legal/filming-and-photography-at-events-privacy-notice/">https://sw
 ingstep.com/legal/filming-and-photography-at-events-privacy-notice/</a><br>
 <br>* About the entrance fee:<br>We wish we could make social dancing free 
 for everyone! Unfortunately we have costs to cover like the venue\, DJs\, b
 ands etc.\, so we ask an entrance of 7-15 EUR. You choose how much you can 
 give\, our hope is that we get an average of 11 EUR. If you cannot afford t
 his\, please talk to us at the door or in advance. We don't want money to b
 e the reason that you cannot join the party (eg. we always look for people 
 to help out\, but also we have a fund to support dancers without financial 
 means).<br><br>-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T105020Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Wedding\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deut
 schland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Social @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
