DESCRIPTION:Facts:<br>- Every Monday\, 20:45 - 23:45<br>- Ballhaus Prinzena
 lle\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin (close to U Pankstr\, U Osloer Str\, S
 +U Gesundbrunnen)<br>- Entrance: 5-15 EUR (free for SwingStep city pass sub
 scribers)*<br><br>We are back! After more than two years of break\, we are 
 very happy that we can do our Monday Social again\, because we really misse
 d that cozy atmosphere\, dancing to great music\, enjoying a drink at the b
 ar\, socializing and hanging out...<br><br>Besides occasional live sets we 
 will have recorded music with different DJs that focus on danceable Swing m
 usic\, but not only. We want to embrace all the differernt Black American c
 ultural art forms\, so we invite our DJs (and bands) to be free in choosing
  their music with variety. There might be New Orleans Jazz\, Big Band Swing
 \, Kansas City Blues\, Bebop\, Rhythm'n'Blues\, Funk\, Soul\, Disco\, House
 \, Hip Hop (you name it...)\, so we can all explore how our bodies want to 
 move to different syncopated rhythms!<br><br>Other than that\, we aim to cr
 eate a relaxed atmosphere that feels welcome to anyone and everyone. There 
 is no dress code\, but there is a code of conduct (<a href="https://swingst
 ep.com/legal/safer-space-code-of-conduct/).">https://swingstep.com/legal/sa
 fer-space-code-of-conduct/).</a> We want you to know that if you feel unsaf
 e / bothered by something or someone\, you can always come to talk to any o
 f us. Also\, if you have any feedback / advice on our code of conduct or po
 licies\, please reach out to us (we are always learning) :)<br><br>There mi
 ght be moments during the party when we take photos or film for documentati
 on and social media. By coming to the event you are agreeing to this\, but 
 you can always talk to the person behind the camera or us\, if you prefer n
 ot to be captured\, so please don't hesitate. <br>All infos on our media po
 licies: <a href="https://swingstep.com/legal/filming-and-photography-at-eve
 nts-privacy-notice/">https://swingstep.com/legal/filming-and-photography-at
 -events-privacy-notice/</a><br><br>* About the entrance fee:<br>We wish we 
 could make social dancing free for everyone! Unfortunately we have costs to
  cover like the venue\, DJs\, bands etc.\, so we ask an entrance of 7-15 EU
 R. You choose how much you can give\, our hope is that we get an average of
  11 EUR. If you cannot afford this\, please talk to us at the door or in ad
 vance. We don't want money to be the reason that you cannot join the party 
 (eg. we always look for people to help out\, but also we have a fund to sup
 port dancers without financial means).<br><br>-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T105020Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Wedding\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deut
 schland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Social @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
