 00 €<br></i><br>3. Donnerstag Live &amp\; DJ<br>20.30 Uhr - 22.00 Uhr: Live
 : Time Rag Department<br><i>S/D: 10\,00 - 15\,00 €\, nach eigenem Ermessen\
 , für die ganze Nacht\, Band + DJ</i><br>22.00 Uhr - 00.30 Uhr: DJ<br><i>S/
 D: 5\,00 €</i><br><br>4. Donnerstag- DJ Night<br>21.00 - ca. 00:30 Uhr_ "Ea
 rly R'n'B Night"* &amp\; Swing Night mit DJ Hari Bo<br><i>S/D: 5\,00 €</i><
 br><u></u><br><br>*Early Rhythm &amp\; Blues: from the 1940s<br>Rhythm and 
 blues (R &amp\; B) was the most popular music created by and for African Am
 ericans between the end of World War II and the early 1960s.<br>Rhythm and 
 Blues is “a distinctly African American music drawing from the deep roots o
 f African American culture. It is a mix of jump blues\, big band swing\, go
 spel\, boogie-woogie\, and the blues. The early development of R &amp\; B o
 ccurred during the second migration of African Americans who moved from the
  South during and after World War II.  (abridged text from “The Jazz Histor
 y Tree”)<br><br>Bar &amp\; Restaurant mit sehr guten Speisen und Getränken 
 sind vorhanden.<br><br><a href="https://timerag.de/"><u>https://timerag.de/
 </u></a><br><br><u></u>------------------------------------------<br><u></u
