DESCRIPTION:<p> ⭐ Swingin’ New Years @BADEHAUS - Grande Premiere ⭐</p><p>Br
 ought to you by Swing Base!</p><p>Join us at Badehaus Szimpla in Berlin to 
 ring in 2024 with the "Swingin’ New Years @BADEHAUS - Grande Premiere"\, fe
 aturing the great swing band The Big Five. This event marks our inaugural c
 elebration at this renowned venue\, setting the stage for a memorable swing
  music experience. </p><p>Full program &amp\; booking: <a href="https://buy
 tickets.at/swingbase/1091919">https://buytickets.at/swingbase/1091919</a></
 p><p>Tickets available at the door!</p><p><span>🕘 21:00 DJ Clément and The
  Big Five (3 sets) </span><br></p><p>🎶 The Big Five 🎶</p><p>🎷 Daniel Dus
 piwa - Tenor Sax</p><p>🎺 Johannes Böhmer - Trumpet</p><p>🎷 Laurin Habert 
 - Bar Sax / Clarinet</p><p>🎸 George Birkett - Guitar🎹 Andrej Hermlin - Pi
 ano</p><p>🎻 Malte Tönissen - Double Bass</p><p>🥁 David Hermlin - Drums / 
 Vocals </p><p>Badehaus Szimpla\, with its unique charm and diverse musical 
 scene\, is the perfect venue for our swing music event. It's an opportunity
  to immerse yourself in the vibrant culture of Berlin's music scene. </p><p
 >🎟️ Entrance Fee: €15 VVK (+ booking fees) Door: 17€</p><p>📍 Venue: Badeh
 aus Berlin\, Revaler Str. 99\, 10245 Berlin\, Germany </p><p>Be part of a n
 ight where the swing community comes together to celebrate with music\, dan
 ce\, and unforgettable moments. Let's swing into the New Year with style an
 d energy!</p><h3>LOCATION</h3><p>Revaler Strasse 99\, (auf dem RAW-Gelände\
 , Zugang Höhe Simon-Dach-Str.)\, 10245<br></p>
