DESCRIPTION:<div dir="auto">Join us in a groovy party where swing will meet
  house\, hip hop and afro vibes. DJs Nils\, Felix\, Malkm and KouaDJo will 
 bring the best of each music style to the dancefloor ! <div dir="auto"><div
  dir="auto">21:00 doors open with DJ <div dir="auto">22:00 The Xperience sh
 ow<div dir="auto">22:30 DJ <br> <br>This party is co-organized with The Xpe
 rience event.<br><br>The Xperience offers a weekend of workshops and partie
 s to create a link between different cultures and dances from the African d
 iaspora. Together with 8 amazing artists participants will explore the Jazz
  continuum.<br><br>It will include 7 hours of workshops that are open to ev
 ery dancer who wishes to broaden their horizons! The workshops will feature
  both specialty classes focused on each dancestyle represented (house\, hip
  hop\, jazz and lindy hop) and the collaboration of artists exploring the c
 onnection between their dance styles.<br><br>For its fourth edition The Xpe
 rience will work in collaboration with Syncopation Society in Berlin.<br><b
 r>Follow this link if you wish to participate in the full event ! : <a href
 ="https://www.billetweb.fr/the-berlin-xperience">https://www.billetweb.fr/t
 he-berlin-xperience</a><br><br>---<br><br>Donations greatly appreciated!<br
 ><br>The main entrance of the Schloss-Strassen Center is open until 21:00. 
 From 21:00\, we can use the side entrance directly from U9 Walther-Schreibe
 r-Platz from Bundesallee.<br><br><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/GAgrBpstL
 CZ4s7ow8">https://maps.app.goo.gl/GAgrBpstLCZ4s7ow8</a>
