DESCRIPTION:1 Year of Shag Jam Berlin! 🎈🍰🥳👯‍♂️ - The last months you ha
 ve been diligently shagging your legs with us and we want to celebrate that
  with you on the 4th of May for our anniversary! <br><br><br>First\, as usu
 al\, with our Shag Jam (15:00-18:00h) 👯 We will have a variety of shaggy m
 usic with different tempos for you 🎵 If you want to take a break or want t
 o hang out you can go for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the entrance roo
 m of the cafe ☕🍰🍪<br><br>Following our Jam we will make ourselves comfort
 able at Fincan with a movie night\, where we will show the documentary "The
  Rebirth of Shag“ by Ryan Martin at 19:00h 📽️ 🎞️🎥 Before that we will ha
 ve a little break to get some fresh air and some chairs and cozy pillows in
  the room and during which you can supply yourself with a few drinks at the
  bar🍹🧉🍺 Feel free to bring some snacks (e.g. popcorn\, sweet &amp\; salt
 y stuff 🍿🍭🍪🥨🍫) to share for the movie night 🤗<br><br>This is a donati
 on based event\, which will support the cafe Fincan. Pay as much as you wan
 t or what feels appropriate ☺️⚡ <br><br>By the way: This is an event open f
 or all levels\, no matter if you are shagging very actively or if your shag
  is a bit rusty or if you just want to stop by to watch the film with us 👯
 ‍♂️📽️<br>We are looking forward to seeing you there and celebrate together
 ! 🤗🥳<br><br>In case you feel uncomfortable or overwhelmed with a person o
 r any incident\, please come to us at any time!<br>We are also happy to rec
 eive your feedback after the event 👍🏿<br><br><a href="http://www.facebook
 .com/shagjam">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a>
