 dar Tsalikov - Saxophon/Klarinette<br>Johannes Böhmer - Trompete<br>Declan 
 Forde - Klavier<br>Leigh Barker - Kontrabass<br><span><br>---<br><br>Join u
 s for swinging music and dance from 18:00 with DJ- the band will start arou
 nd 19:00.<br><br>The Alte Turnhalle is located in the middle of Friedrichsh
 ain\, around five minutes by foot from transit stations U/S Warschauer Str.
 \, S Ostkreuz\, or U/S Frankfurter Allee.<br><br>---<br></span><u></u><u></
 u>
