DESCRIPTION:Yes\, it is true: This is going to be the last Monday Shuffle.<
 br><br>It is going to be a special evening with live music: After some fun 
 classes the social dance opens with a short concert by the TMJ All-Stars - 
 the musicians from the That’s My Jam music sessions that were happening par
 allel to the dance classes (did you notice?). Afterwards there will be an o
 pen jam session\, so bring your instrument if you want!<br><br>We are reall
 y looking forward to seeing you there next Monday\, it might be the very la
 st Swing dance event happening in Ballhaus Prinzenallee for a while. And we
  are ready to celebrate with you one last time\, before we disperse into th
 e night…<p><span>Price: From 5</span><span> EUR</span></p><p><span>If you c
 annot afford to pay our suggested prices\, just talk to us at the door and 
 let’s find a solution! We don’t want your financial situation to stop you f
 rom joining our event.</span><br></p><p>The social dancing starts at 21:00 
 and is part of a bigger evening program that includes also dance classes\, 
 music classes and a jam session for musicians. <span>Here are more details 
 about the different activities:</span></p><p><a href="https://www.facebook.
 com/events/117645537968785/117648304635175/">https://www.facebook.com/event
 s/117645537968785/117648304635175/</a><span><br></span></p><p>-of-</p><br><
 br><p><br></p><p><br></p>
