DESCRIPTION:The 3rd edition!<br><br>The Berlin Festival for early jazz\, SW
 ING dance\, and jazz culture... &amp\; beyond!<br><br>Doors open  at 16:30<
 br>with a Warming Up Program:  <a href="https://areyousyncopated.de/program
 /" target="_blank"><u><u><u>https://areyousyncopated.de/program/</u></u></u
 ></a><br><br>Accessible only with a Party\, Music or Dance Pass.<br><br>Lim
 ited single tickets available at the door\, first come first serve!<br><br>
 <b>Rufus Temple Orchestra </b>- In Berlin’s vibrant jazz scene\, the Rufus 
 Temple Orchestra stands out for its authenticity and passion for the classi
 c sounds of hot jazz.<br><br><b>The Tenement Jazzband </b>-  The band has b
 ecome a fixture on the UK touring circuit and we are delighted to bring the
 m to mainland Europe. Their music is rooted in classic New Orleans jazz\, e
 mphasizing collective improvisation over solos\, with creative arrangements
  and a distinctive sound<br><br>DJ Genial Jean - what the dancefloor wants\
 ; Swing them out!<br><br><br><br>Tickets: <a href="https://areyousyncopated
 .de/registration/" target="_blank"><u>https://areyousyncopated.de/registrat
 ion/</u></a><br><br>🌍 “Are You Syncopated?!” is part of the <a href="https
 ://www.instagram.com/Swinging/" target="_blank"><u>@Swinging</u></a> Europe
  network. Co-funded by the Creative Europe Programme of the European Commis
 sion.<br><br><br>Entrance of Statthaus Böcklerpark by the riverside!
