DESCRIPTION:<br><table><tbody><tr><td><table><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr><
 /tbody></table></td><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table><br><br><br><br>Welco
 me to Shag Jam Berlin\, our shag social in Café Fincan Neukölln 👯‍♂️🤗 <br
 ><br>The Social will start at 15:00 with DJ Music and Live band <br><br>Ban
 d: The Infinite Chocolate Jar 🎵<br><br>Anna - Tenor Guitar<br>Lucia - Drum
 s<br>Mats - Violin<br>Oli - Piano / Trombone<br>Raul - Trumpet<br>Joris - T
 rombone<br>Sam - Bass<br> <br><br>Cafe Fincan has a beautiful back room of 
 55m2 with a great dance floor. We will have a variety of shaggy music with 
 different tempos for you 🎵<br><br>If you want to take a break or want to h
 ang out you can go for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the entrance room o
 f the cafe ☕🍰🍪<br><br>The social is an event open for all levels\, no mat
 ter if you are shagging very actively or if your shag is a bit rusty.<br><b
 r>We can play music with open windows and we have big ventilators to keep y
 ou shagging without breaking a sweat 💨<br><br>In case you feel uncomfortab
 le or overwhelmed with a person or any incident\, please come to us at any 
 time!<br><br>We are also happy to receive your feedback after the event 👍<
