 \, for "<b>Slow Feet / Fast Feet</b>" <span>🎉</span><span>🎶</span><br><br
 >A swing dance party with both slow and fast rhythms\, <br>featuring DJs an
 d live music\, <i><b>for Slow Bal and Balboa enthusiasts!</b> </i><span>💃<
 /span><span>🕺</span><br><br><b>Why this party?</b><br><br><b>#1</b> – Wrap
 ping Up the Workshop <span>💡</span><span>🎶</span><br>After the Slow Bal w
 orkshop with Leanna\, Shieva\, and Gašper <br>on November 30th and December
  1st\, let’s celebrate with a fun dance party! <br>Haven’t seen the event d
 etails yet? Check them out here - <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=h
 ttps%3A%2F%2Ffb.me%2Fe%2F3XVns8PkD&h=AT1uxMVIpIQYquD9206rs7mP0iLgHf0WFgqH0h
