 n_l74VtEF_W590GeQ&__tn__=q&c[0]=AT32nYdXLAxNET7wVEQkN5Xj4-BrndxaBikuP0jEdS3
 dov4Vd2zwu0NwnfhS7LEqPslc957tWh_9qw74cE2VQF5rRY30OAp9vNN9L0yS1qByLWK_s9HzRq
 K9oumpnQtXtgw" target="_blank">https://fb.me/e/3XVns8PkD</a><br><br><b>#2</
 b> – Kicking Off My New Decade <span>🎂</span><span>🎉</span><br>December 1
 st is the day before my birthday\, <br>and I want to start my 40s doing wha
 t I love most: dancing with friends. <br>I can’t think of a better way to s
 tart this new chapter than with all of you! <span>🌟</span><br><span><br><b
 >🎶</b></span><b> Details:</b><br><br><b>When:</b> Sunday\, December 1st<br
 >Time: 21:00 - 2:00</span><span></span><span><br><br><span><span>🌟</span> 
 <span><b>Important Update &amp\; Full Schedule!</b></span> <span>🌟</span><
 /span><br><br><span>Due to an<span><b> event earlier in the day</b></span>\
 , our Balboa and Slow Balboa party will start a bit later. Here's the updat
 ed plan:</span><br><br><span><span>🎧</span> <span><b>DJ kicks off at 21:00
 </b></span> – warm up the dance floor! <span>🎶</span> <br><span><b>Live ba
 nd starts at 21:30 sharp</b></span> – you don’t want to miss it!</span><br>
 <br><span>Thank you for your understanding. <br>We’re looking forward to an
  amazing evening of music\, dancing\, and good vibes. <br>See you there! <s
 pan>💃</span><span>🕺</span><span>✨</span></span></span><br><span><br><b>Wh
 ere:</b> Bebop\, Pfuelstraße 5\, 10997 Berlin<br><br><b>Costs: </b>Sliding 
 entry fee (12€ - 18€) for DJs and band<br><br>No presents\, please —<br>I’m
  just happy to have the chance to see you all and celebrate together! <span
 >💕</span><br>See you on the dance floor! <span>✨<br><br></span></span><spa
 n><span>Yours<br></span></span><span><span>Giovanni<br></span></span>
