DESCRIPTION:<p>*** SWING BASE NEW EVENT <span>***</span><span> </span></p><
 p>Berlin blooms into spring\, and with it comes <strong><b>Berlin Swing Blo
 ssom (April 6th)</b></strong>\, a brand new swing dance event set in the st
 unning <strong><b>Peter Edel ballroom</b></strong>. Join us for a night of 
 lively <strong><b>Swing Music &amp\; Dance</b></strong>\, featuring the sen
 sational <b><b>The Big Five</b></b> 🌸🎶 Dive into the heart of swing in Be
 rlin’s springtime splendor!</p><p>Full program and tickets: <a href="https:
 //swingbase.de/swingblossom">https://swingbase.de/swingblossom</a></p><p>🕗
  Evening Schedule (06/04):</p><p><span>🎵</span><span> </span><span>21:00 –
  21:30: DJ Clément</span><br></p><p>🎷 21:30 – 01:00: Live Band Sextet &amp
 \; DJ Clément</p><p>🏆 Rookie Mix &amp\; Match Competition – for dancers wi
 th less than 2 years experience!<br></p><p> <span>Don’t miss our “Rookie Mi
 x &amp\; Match” competition! Open to dancers with less than 2 years experie
 nce\, you’ll be paired with a random partner for a fun social dance. Great 
 prizes for the winners! 🌟💃🕺</span></p><p><span>🎵</span><span>The Big Fi
 ve – Septet </span><span>🎵</span></p><p> <span>See you on the dance floor!
  </span><span>🌟</span></p>
