BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230220T204500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230220T234500
DTSTAMP:20260530T105130Z
UID:3p8b18h30fp7rqoek8hdrmcmo4_R20230206T194500@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20230220T204500
CREATED:20221128T223912Z
DESCRIPTION:TODAY with DJ Yasemin!!! <br><br>Facts:<br>- Every Monday\, 20:
 45 - 23:45<br>- Ballhaus Prinzenalle\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin (clos
 e to U Pankstr\, U Osloer Str\, S+U Gesundbrunnen)<br>- Entrance: 5-15 EUR 
 (free for SwingStep city pass subscribers)*<br><br>We are back! After more 
 than two years of break\, we are very happy that we can do our Monday Socia
 l again\, because we really missed that cozy atmosphere\, dancing to great 
 music\, enjoying a drink at the bar\, socializing and hanging out...<br><br
 >Besides occasional live sets we will have recorded music with different DJ
 s that focus on danceable Swing music\, but not only. We want to embrace al
 l the differernt Black American cultural art forms\, so we invite our DJs (
 and bands) to be free in choosing their music with variety. There might be 
 New Orleans Jazz\, Big Band Swing\, Kansas City Blues\, Bebop\, Rhythm'n'Bl
 ues\, Funk\, Soul\, Disco\, House\, Hip Hop (you name it...)\, so we can al
 l explore how our bodies want to move to different syncopated rhythms!<br><
 br>Other than that\, we aim to create a relaxed atmosphere that feels welco
 me to anyone and everyone. There is no dress code\, but there is a code of 
 conduct (<a href="https://swingstep.com/legal/safer-space-code-of-conduct/)
 .">https://swingstep.com/legal/safer-space-code-of-conduct/).</a> We want y
 ou to know that if you feel unsafe / bothered by something or someone\, you
  can always come to talk to any of us. Also\, if you have any feedback / ad
 vice on our code of conduct or policies\, please reach out to us (we are al
 ways learning) :)<br><br>There might be moments during the party when we ta
 ke photos or film for documentation and social media. By coming to the even
 t you are agreeing to this\, but you can always talk to the person behind t
 he camera or us\, if you prefer not to be captured\, so please don't hesita
 te. <br>All infos on our media policies: <a href="https://swingstep.com/leg
 al/filming-and-photography-at-events-privacy-notice/">https://swingstep.com
 /legal/filming-and-photography-at-events-privacy-notice/</a><br><br>* About
  the entrance fee:<br>We wish we could make social dancing free for everyon
 e! Unfortunately we have costs to cover like the venue\, DJs\, bands etc.\,
  so we ask an entrance of 7-15 EUR. You choose how much you can give\, our 
 hope is that we get an average of 11 EUR. If you cannot afford this\, pleas
 e talk to us at the door or in advance. We don't want money to be the reaso
 n that you cannot join the party (eg. we always look for people to help out
 \, but also we have a fund to support dancers without financial means).<br>
 <br>-of-
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T105020Z
LOCATION:SwingStep Berlin - Wedding\, Prinzenallee 33\, 13359 Berlin\, Deut
 schland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Monday Social @ SwingStep Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
