 >will be stepping out to Sinbar in Kreuzberg.<br> <br>Inspired by the great
  American country singers <br>and the hot bands of the 1940s/50s/60s\, <br>
 this group is out to dispel the lame old myths <br>that country music doesn
 &#39\;t swing. <br><br>Led by the golden voice of Virginia&#39\;s-own Georg
 e Aschmann\, <br>these boys will break your heart and scuff your dance shoe
 s...<br>with their invitation to the blues.<br><br>All dancers are invited 
 to join this wonderful journey <br></span><span>and fabulous musical experi
 ence !<br><br></span><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.face
