DESCRIPTION:The 3rd Edition!<br><br>The Berlin Festival for early jazz\, SW
 ING dance\, and jazz culture... &amp\; beyond!<br><br>Doors open  at 18:30<
 br>with a Warming Up Program: <a href="https://areyousyncopated.de/program/
 " target="_blank"><u>https://areyousyncopated.de/program/</u></a><br><br>Ac
 cessible only with a Party\, Music or Dance Pass. <br><br>Limited single ti
 ckets available at the door\, first come first serve!<br><br><b>Syncopated 
 Sisters All Star Band</b> - Named after the residency and podcast of the sa
 me name that spotlights female musicians and composers\, this band is a com
 pletely new formation for the festival and a first meeting for all of them 
 <br><br><b>Fat 6 &amp\; Friends</b> - Kick off the Jam Session<br><br><b>DJ
  Randy aka Hot Soup</b> - With a passion for swing dancing and a love for j
 azz and black music\, Hot Soup brings a soulful vibe to every set. Inspired
  by legends like Earl Hines\, Duke Ellington\, Count Basie\, Johnny Hodges\
 , Lester Young. He crafts a musical journey that celebrates the rich herita
 ge of blues\, swing\, bebop and rhythm &amp\; blues.<br><br><b>The legendar
 y OJ Brothers</b> - The Host of tonight<br><br><br>Program: <a href="https:
 //areyousyncopated.de/program/" target="_blank">https://areyousyncopated.de
 /program/</a><br><br>Tickets: <a href="https://areyousyncopated.de/registra
 tion/" target="_blank">https://areyousyncopated.de/registration/</a><br><br
 >🌍 “Are You Syncopated?!” is part of the <a href="https://www.instagram.co
 m/Swinging/" target="_blank">@Swinging</a> Europe network. Co-funded by the
  Creative Europe Programme of the European Commission.<br><br><br>Entrance 
 of Statthaus Böcklerpark by the riverside!
