DESCRIPTION:Did you ever hear about Speakeasy? Those illegal bars & clubs s
 erving strong alcoholic drinks during the prohibition era? Where you had to
  knock on the door and pass by a closet (of a guy) to get in? We will bring
  you into that world on the sunday\, having a down & dirty basement blues p
 arty! We really can’t tell you where it is now\, guess you just have to fin
 d out yourself!\n\n\nBlue Finger Buffet\nAs the workshop ends a little earl
 ier on the sunday we will take that opportunity to grab a grub together at 
 the party. Our Blue Finger Buffet will serve hot & cold finger food\, snack
 s\, cakes & sweets – basically everything you bring (see below)!\n\n\nFines
 t Blues Music selected by Shorty George & Friends\nFlying him in again and 
 again for Berlins biggest Swing events\, Shorty George can already be seen 
 as a regular – but still it feels special every time he plays in Berlin. He
  will be the main DJ for this weekend and\, together with some friends of o
 urs\, will make sure that we can still dance if the last trumpet is already
  deep asleep.\nPhoto by David Gauffin \n\n\nLocation\nMaybe we can give you
  a small hint! Birds told us that you have to search for us at Eisenbahnstr
 aße 6\, just a stone throw away from U-Görlitzer Bahnhof.\n\n\nEntrance\n3 
 €…\n…or you can bring a grub for the Blue Finger Buffet. We appreciate all 
 kinds of food: hot or cold\, meat or vegetarian\, sweet\, sour or spicy… bu
 t no drinks – therefore we have a well stocked bar!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230126T095602Z
LOCATION:Vögelchen\, Eisenbahnstraße 6\, Berlin Kreuzberg
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Speakeasy - Cirque du Solo 2012
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
