DESCRIPTION:The 3rd Edition!\n\nThe Berlin Festival for early jazz\, SWING 
 dance\, and jazz culture... & beyond!\n\nDoors open  at 18:30\nwith a Warmi
 ng Up Program:  https://areyousyncopated.de/program/\n\nAccessible only wit
 h a Party\, Music or Dance Pass.\n\nLimited single tickets available at the
  door\, first come first serve!\n\nNick Rossi Swing Six - A swing sensation
 . With an approach grounded in classic Kansas City jazz and a strong affini
 ty for the Swing Era of the mid-to-late 1930s into the early 1940s\, Nick’s
  Swing Six mixes earthy roots with style and sophistication. The group will
  showcase favourites from its riff-based repertoire of head arrangements an
 d spotlight features\, mixing classics with lesser-known favourites.  \n\nA
 ngela Strandberg & Friends - Will kick off the Jam Session\n\nDJ Anna G - S
 pecial session of House dance and beyond\nDJ hOlistic - Jazz and beyond\n\n
 \nProgram: https://areyousyncopated.de/program/\n\nTickets: https://areyous
 yncopated.de/registration/\n\n🌍 “Are You Syncopated?!” is part of the @Swi
 nging Europe network. Co-funded by the Creative Europe Programme of the Eur
 opean Commission.
LAST-MODIFIED:20241010T003652Z
LOCATION:Säälchen\, Holzmarktstraße 25\, 10243 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Are You Syncopated?! 2024
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
