DESCRIPTION:📌 Rooftop of ZK/U (Zentrum für Kultur und Urbanistik) <br>    
   Siemensstraße 27\, 10551 Berlin<br>📆 September 7th 2025\, 15-18Uhr<br><b
 r>Every second month\, the ZK/U grounds transform into a vibrant meeting po
 int for the neighborhood. The Gütermarkt is much more than a traditional fl
 ea market – it brings together second-hand goods\, local crafts\, stores an
 d services and workshops where you can get creative as well. It is a place 
 where sustainability\, creativity\, and community come together. <br><br>ma
 rket opening hours: 11:00-19:00<br><br>Join us for our very first edition a
 t Gütermarkt and move your body to the finest swing tunes on the big roofto
 p of ZK/U. Whether you dance\, enjoy the view over Moabit\, or explore the 
 design market - this event has something for everyone. Come around and have
  a great Sunday outdoor experience with us. <br>And pssst... there might be
  a surprise performance by dancers from our lovely community! Don't miss th
 at! <br><br><br><br>      16:00-18:00 Swing Social with DJ Music*<br>   <br
 >      * with a surprise performance by dancers from<br>         our swing 
 community (around 16:20) <br><br>💰  Social is donation based. All<br>     
   donations will go to the 'Collective Voices for change'<br><br>Cheers\, L
 otte &amp\; Dafa (for more questions\, contact Lotte <a href="https://www.i
 nstagram.com/frau_lott" target="_blank">frau_lott</a> )<br><br>Link to the 
 event: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DNWD_woNFsi/?igsh=YXcxcHhlbHhzc
 Tl3" target="_blank">https://www.instagram.com/p/DNWD_woNFsi/?igsh=YXcxcHhl
 bHhzcTl3</a>
