DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Shag Jam Berlin\, our shag social in Café Fincan Neu
 kölln 👯‍♂️🤗 <br>Cafe Fincan has a beautiful room of 55m2 with a great dan
 ce floor. We'll be playing a variety of shag music with different tempos to
  keep you dancing all night 🎵<br><br>If you want to take a break or just w
 ant to hang out you can go for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the entranc
 e area of the café  ☕🍰🍪<br><br>The social is open to all levels\, whether
  you're dancing actively or you're a little rusty with your shag steps.<br>
 <br>We’ll keep things cool with open windows and large fans\, so you can ke
 ep shagging without breaking a sweat 💨 <br><br>If at any point you feel un
 comfortable or overwhelmed\, whether by a person or a situation\, please do
 n’t hesitate to come to us at any time!<br><br>We also welcome any feedback
  you might have after the event 👍 <br><br>This is a donation-based event\,
  and all contributions will support Café Fincan. Pay as much as you feel is
  appropriate 😊<br><br>We look forward to seeing you there and shagging wit
 h you 👯‍♂️<br><br>For more information about the class or social\, visit: 
 <a href="www.facebook.com/shagjam">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251204T215529Z
