CREATED:20220311T114943Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><span dir="auto"><br>The incomparable Angela 
 Strandberg <br>is visiting from Paris\, <br>and she'll open the jam <br>tog
 ether with some of the jam cats you know and love!<br><br>Angela plays trum
 pet\, washboard\, sings\, dances\, <br>and looooooooooves crazy high energy
  songs\, <br>so come to Bellmer for an especially wild evening!<br><br>Ange
 la Strandberg – Trumpet\, Washboard\, Vocals<br>Laurin H. Bert – Reeds<br>C
 hristoph Klan – Piano\, Reeds<br>Giedre Dizzy Ella – Bass<br>Andrea Ramírez
  Ruiz – Guitar<br>&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;- - - <br><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION ♫<
 br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats live session finally returns <br>t
 o carry on the legacy of old jazz mingling live sessions and DJ-sets.<br>-<
 br>We want everyone to have fun\, <br>dancers and musicians alike <br>with 
 a stage open for early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, <br>and other fun styles to dan
 ce to <br>with a focus on Balboa <br>since we are operating with Bellmer Ba
 lboa. <br>-<br>The jam will be run by members <br>of the Syncopation Societ
 y <br>to ensure that the party flows\, <br>allowing everyone to dance\, <br
 >or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br>-<br>Generous donations for 
 the band and dj <br>are highly appreciated and expected.<br>-<br>TIME TABLE
 <br>20:00 - Doors<br>20:30 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Set 2 + guests<br>23:00 - JAM
  CATS<br>-<br><span>⚠</span> Corona <span>⚠</span><br>The official restrict
 ions are lifted for now\, <br>but we still kindly ask\, well implore you <b
 r>to do a test before you come anyway.<br>-<br>Let's stay safe and protect 
