 <span>⚜</span> DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS <span>⚜</span><br>We are happy to s
 ee new faces in the scene\, <br>coming to the JAM CATS grants you free entr
 ance <br>and 1 or 2 drinks if you play. <br>Just keep in mind that this is 
 a DANCE EVENT <br>and it implies to be reactive <br>and to keep your solos 
 short and sweet. <br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on s
 tage. <br>If you want to play\, make it clear and talk to one <br>of the mu
 sicians on stage to see when is a good time to step in. <br>There's a piano
  on the stage with atmospheric amplification.</span><br><br><br>- - - - - <
 br><br><span>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on every Tuesday ! <br><b
 r>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz. <br><br><br>If you
  like to party <br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, <br>you will ha
 ve a good time at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous donations for bands 
 and djs <br>are highly appreciated and expected !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br>E
 nter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revaler Straße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Str
 aße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it's the first bar to your right
 . <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa">https://www.face
 book.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></u></html-blob>
