DESCRIPTION:<u></u><span dir="auto"><br>If you have ever been to New Orlean
 s for Mardi Gras\, <br>you will probably feel a little nostalgic this time 
 of year. <br>Months of excitement and preparation culminating in one day <b
 r>of excessive debauchery with parades\, music\, beads... <br><br>We don't 
 have this tradition in Berlin\, but <br>we will certainly celebrate the occ
 asion in style! <br>So come down in your best\, weirdest\, flashiest\, <br>
 oddest\, funniest outfit. <br>Or not. <br>Either way\, make your way down t
 o the <br>Jam Cats and celebrate with us!<br><br>LINE UP TBA!!!<br><br>♫ TH
 E JAM CATS SESSION ♫<br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats live session 
 finally returns to carry on <br>the legacy of old jazz mingling live sessio
 ns and DJ-sets.<br><br>We want everyone to have fun\, dancers and musicians
  alike <br>with a stage open for early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, <br>and other f
 un styles to dance to <br>with a focus on Balboa since we are operating wit
 h Bellmer Balboa. <br><br>The jam will be run by members of the Syncopation
  Society <br>to ensure that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, 
 <br>or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br>Generous donations for th
 e band and dj <br>are highly appreciated and expected.<br><br>TIME TABLE<br
 >20:00 - Doors<br>20:30 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Set 2 + guests<br>23:00 - JAM CA
 TS<br><br><span>⚠</span> Corona <span>⚠</span><br>The official restrictions
  are lifted for now\, <br>but we still kindly ask\, well implore you <br>to
  do a test before you come anyway.<br><br>Let's stay safe and protect each 
 other<br>as much as we can ! <br>Come early and stay late !<br><br>  <br><s
 pan>⚜</span> DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS <span>⚜</span><br>We are happy to see
  new faces in the scene\, <br>come to the JAM CATS grants you free entrance
  <br>and 1 or 2 drinks if you play. <br>Just keep in mind that this is a DA
 NCE EVENT <br>and it implies to be reactive <br>and to keep your solos shor
 t and sweet. <br><br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on s
 tage. <br>If you want to play\, make it clear and talk to one of the musici
 ans on stage <br>to see when is a good time to step in.<br><br>There's a pi
 ano on the stage with atmospheric amplification.</span><br><br>- - - - - <b
 r><br><span>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on every Tuesday ! <br><br
 >Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz. <br><br><br>If you 
 like to party <br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, <br>you will hav
 e a good time at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous donations for bands a
 nd djs <br>are highly appreciated and expected !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br>En
 ter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revaler Straße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Stra
 ße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it's the first bar to your right.
  <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa">https://www.faceb
 ook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></u>
