 e welcoming you all dancing folks and non dancing friends to join this spec
 ial event\, to celebrate the summer and the Blues.\n\nLocation: Dockx Berli
 n (Ordensmeisterstr. 1\, 2.OG --> on the rooftop). Entry from "Lady Company
 "\n\nWe would love to invite you to a very special blues party: DJ edition!
 \nWhy not a live event this time? Because we want to ask you support for fu
 ture events so we can invite a bigger bands or even from further away?\nWe 
 want to invoke your community spirit and ask for your support.\nWe love to 
 organise these special events for you and see you dance your feet off. But 
 we also love to show appreciation for the artists.\n\n18:00 Start time\n18:
 30 DJ Olga and DJ Rosa Lee\n22:00 End time\n\nWe are hosting a donation bas
 ed event. Your Support and kind donations are highly appreciated.\nSpread t
 he word and invite your friends\, repost\, share in your groups and communi
 ties ❤\nWe want to support live music and dance events.
