  situation\, please don’t hesitate to come to us at any time!<br><br>We als
 o welcome any feedback you might have after the event 👍<br><br>This is a d
 onation-based event\, and all contributions will support Café Fincan. Pay a
 s much as you feel is appropriate 😊<br><br>⚡️ Date and time : December 6th
