DESCRIPTION:EVERY LAST FRIDAY OF THE MONTH! \n\nFree practice 18:00 - 20:00
  \nTea dance 20:00 - 22:00 (3-7 euro donation) \n\n\n💥FREE PRACTICE 💥\nCo
 me to our studio from 18:00 to 20:00 and practice your dance for free! Open
  to everyone (not only students of the school).\n\nThe space is open every 
 Friday and a DJ set list is on: you can come alone or with fellow friends &
  students to practice what you learned in classes or wish to learn from cli
 ps & other forms of inspiration.\n\nNote: people being responsible to run t
 he free practice are not there to offer dance guidance\, the free practice 
 is meant to be a "you're responsible for yourself" space.\n\n🏠 HOUSE RULES
  🏠\nNo outside shoes - bring indoor shoes or tape your outside shoes with 
 american tape provided by us.\n\nNo drinks are sold in our studio. If you w
 ish to bring drinks\, please dispose of them appropiately: bring back the b
 ottles with you or leave the bottles in the crates in the garden.\n\nSee yo
 u Fridays! 💗
