 t 🎵<br><br>If you want to take a break or just want to hang out you can go
  for a coffee/drink in the entrance area of the café ☕️<br><br>The social i
 s open to all levels\, whether you're dancing actively or you're a little r
 usty with your shag steps.<br><br>We’ll keep things cool with open windows 
