DESCRIPTION:NEW NEW NEWSSSS!\n\nThis weekend will be all about celebrating 
 the beats that bring us together - House\, New Style Hustle\, Lindy Hop\, a
 nd Solo Jazz Dance. It’s about finding the common ground in our dance roots
  and sharing those vibes with each other. 🎶✨\n\n*What‘s cooking?*Fun battl
 es to various music genres\, and dance moments to tunes selected from heart
 . It’s all about creating brand new connections across dance communities wi
 th the same rich history and vibe. It‘s about crafting a space for creativi
 ty and learning\, and the love for rhythm and movement. 🕺💃\n\nWhat is goi
 ng to happen today?\nPreselection for the battles\n1) Lindy Hop & Solo Jazz
 \n2) New Style Hustle\n3) House Dance\n\nTop 8 & 4\n1) Lindy Hop will dance
  to live band\n2) Solo Jazz the same\n3) New Style Hustle to DJ \n4) House 
 Dance to DJ\n\ntowards the final we are going to hustle around\n1) Lindy Ho
 p & New Style Hustle 2vs2\n2) Solo Jazz & House Dance 1vs1\n\nInbetween the
  battles there will be social dance\, jams\, live music and performances!\n
 \n!! Swing Dancers don't miss this\, come with your best Swing Mates\, repr
 esent the swing dance community and sign up for the battles or as an audien
 ce to support the Swing community.\n\nMore info in the registration form: h
 ttps://linktr.ee/rhythm.trinity\n\nIf you have any questions contact us: rh
 ythm.trinity@gmail.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20250414T124032Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Rhtyhm Trinity Battles/Jams/Social Dance
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
