DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Shag Jam Berlin\, our shag social in Café Fincan Neu
 kölln 👯‍♂️🤗 <br>Cafe Fincan has a beautiful room of 55m2 with a great dan
 ce floor. We&#39\;ll be playing a variety of shag music with different temp
 os to keep you dancing all night 🎵<br><br>If you want to take a break or j
 ust want to hang out you can go for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the en
 trance area of the café  ☕🍰🍪<br><br>The social is open to all levels\, wh
 ether you&#39\;re dancing actively or you&#39\;re a little rusty with your 
 shag steps.<br><br>We’ll keep things cool with open windows and large fans\
 , so you can keep shagging without breaking a sweat 💨 <br><br>If at any po
 int you feel uncomfortable or overwhelmed\, whether by a person or a situat
 ion\, please don’t hesitate to come to us at any time!<br><br>We also welco
 me any feedback you might have after the event 👍 <br><br>This is a donatio
 n-based event\, and all contributions will support Café Fincan. Pay as much
  as you feel is appropriate 😊<br><br>We look forward to seeing you there a
 nd shagging with you 👯‍♂️<br><br>For more information about the class or s
 ocial\, visit: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.facebook.co
 m/shagjam&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0tlJSBZk
 ks8AAI-gwV6mvb" target="_blank">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a>
