DESCRIPTION:<span><span><br><span><span>Welcome to Shag Jam Berlin\, our sh
 ag social in Café Fincan Neukölln 👯‍♂️🤗 </span></span><br><span><span><br
 >Cafe Fincan has a beautiful room of 55m2 with a great dance floor. We'll b
 e playing a variety of shag music with different tempos to keep you dancing
  all night 🎵<br><br>If you want to take a break or just want to hang out y
 ou can go for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the entrance area of the caf
 é  ☕🍰🍪<br><br>The social is open to all levels\, whether you're dancing a
 ctively or you're a little rusty with your shag steps.<br><br>We’ll keep th
 ings cool with open windows and large fans\, so you can keep shagging witho
 ut breaking a sweat 💨 <br><br>If at any point you feel uncomfortable or ov
 erwhelmed\, whether by a person or a situation\, please don’t hesitate to c
 ome to us at any time!<br><br>We also welcome any feedback you might have a
 fter the event 👍 <br><br>This is a donation-based event\, and all contribu
 tions will support Café Fincan. Pay as much as you feel is appropriate 😊<b
 r><br>We look forward to seeing you there and shagging with you 👯‍♂️<br><b
 r>For more information about the class or social\, visit: <a href="http://w
 ww.facebook.com/shagjam" target="_blank">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a></span
 ></span><br><a href="https://www.instagram.com/shag_jam_berlin">www.instagr
 am.com/shag_jam_berlin</a><span><span> </span></span></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260428T081526Z
LOCATION:Fincan\, Altenbraker Str. 26\, 12051 Berlin\, Germany
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shag Jam Berlin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
