DESCRIPTION:YOU ARE INVITED! 🥰🥳🎂\nThe very first Rausch takes place\, an
  opening night where Blues meets Slowbal. A cozy space\, great cocktails\, 
 sweet dances with friends\, and the music we love. This night marks a begin
 ning\, a celebration\, and also my birthday\, double sweet 16\, y’all! Come
  show some love\, give a warm welcome to Rausch into the Berlin dance commu
 nity\, and let’s celebrate life\, dance\, and new beginnings together.\nVib
 es are weaving Blues\, Slowbal\, and all that jazz!\nExpect variety\, flow\
 , and room for feeling.\n\nEntry: donation (beginner tester class included)
 \n\n20:00 Party starts – DJ Izem Yilmaz\n\nMinimum until midnight… and if t
 he night feels right\, we let it flow ✨
