DESCRIPTION:<b>💥FREE PRACTICE 💥</b><br>Come to our studio from 18:00 to 2
 0:00 and practice your dance for free! Open to everyone (not only students 
 of the school).<br><br>The space is open every Friday and a DJ set list is 
 on: you can come alone or with fellow friends &amp\; students to practice w
 hat you learned in classes or wish to learn from clips &amp\; other forms o
 f inspiration.<br><br><i>Note: people being responsible to run the free pra
 ctice are not there to offer dance guidance\, the free practice is meant to
  be a &quot\;you&#39\;re responsible for yourself&quot\; space.<br><br></i>
 <br><b>🏠 HOUSE RULES 🏠</b><br><u>No outside shoes </u>- bring indoor shoe
 s or tape your outside shoes with american tape provided by us.<br><br><u>N
 o drinks are sold in our studio.</u> If you wish to bring drinks\, please d
 ispose of them appropiately: bring back the bottles with you or leave the b
 ottles in the crates in the garden.<br>See you Fridays! 💗
LAST-MODIFIED:20251229T130642Z
