 ial is an event open for all levels\, no matter if you are shagging very ac
 tively or if your shag is a bit rusty.<br><br>We can play music with open w
 indows and we have big ventilators to keep you shagging without breaking a 
 sweat 💨 <br><br>In case you feel uncomfortable or overwhelmed with a perso
 n or any incident\, please come to us at any time!<br><br>We are also happy
  to receive your feedback after the event 👍 <br><br>This is a donation bas
 ed event\, which will support the cafe Fincan. Pay as much as you want or w
 hat feels appropriate 😊<br><br>We are looking forward to seeing you there 
 and to shagging with you 👯‍♂️ <br><br>For more info about the class or the
  social 👉 <a href="www.facebook.com/shagjam">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a>
