DESCRIPTION:/deutsch siehe unten)<br><br>ON BEAT ON BOAT <br>is back.<br><b
 r>Be quick as it got sold out quickly.<br>A social event in collaboration w
 ith Berlin’s oldest steam boat (today electric) „Kaiser Friedrich“<br>You c
 an book tickets now (link in bio).<br>Boarding 18:45\, Start 19:00\, Return
  22:00<br><br>We are in favour that we share the same values as in the Resp
 ect\, Vibe &amp\; Boat Guide.<br>-----------------------------------<br>Lon
 g:<br>On Beat\, On Boat –<br>your sundown Swing Dance cruise<br><br>We are 
 throwing a party….on a boat... on a moving boat! 🛥<br>Join us for a celebr
 ation of sunny and warm summer and dancing in the open air while cruising o
 n Berlin’s oldest passenger ship Kaiser-Friedrich\, nowadays being fully el
 ectric! ⚓️<br><br>We’ll have a bar on board\, some food\, excellent music b
 y some of our favorite tune selectors and the chance to celebrate the berli
 n swingdancing friends in a more special setup than usual. 🎶<br><br>There 
 will be plenty of seats to enjoy the view as well as enough space to groove
  on a lovely wooden dance floor. 👯<br><br><br>Details:<br><b>🗓 Sunday\, 1
 2.07.2026<br>🕖 From 7:00-10:00 pm / Boarding 6:45 pm<br>📍 Anlegestelle „A
 lte Börse“ (S-Hackescher Markt)<br>👆🏻 Kaiser Friedrich x Lindy Hop Dancer
 s &amp\; Friends<br>🎟 All proceeds go to the boat crew. <br>🎵 by AJ &amp\
 ; Johanna &amp\; Olga</b><br><br>Please read all important info in the <a h
 ref="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UW2cGE42rjmu23XaxZ26ef2wqJd0TPYT/view
 ?usp=sharing" target="_blank">Respect\, Vibe &amp\; Boat Guide</a>.<br><br>
 Book your ticket: <a href="https://kaiserfriedrich.berlin/fahrplan-und-tick
 ets/#!/e/62e6d5b79a1535b850c1846db067d816" target="_blank">https://kaiserfr
 iedrich.berlin/fahrplan-und-tickets/#!/e/62e6d5b79a1535b850c1846db067d816</
 a><br><br><br>Hosted by Lotte\, Flo\, Jean &amp\; the Kaiser Friedrich team
 <br><br>---------------------------------<br><br>Auf in eine neue Runde! Wi
 r freuen uns riesig\, auch dieses Jahr wieder die Berliner Swing Tanz Commu
 nity bei uns an Bord zu haben!<br><br>"Wir schmeißen ne Party…auf nem Boot\
 , und dieses Boot legt sogar ab!<br><br>Seid dabei\, wenn wir gemeinsam unt
 er dem freien Himmel an Deck der “Kaiser-Friedrich” auf den Sommer und die 
