 hat you learned in classes or wish to learn from clips &amp\; other forms o
 f inspiration.<br><br><i>Note: people being responsible to run the free pra
 ctice are not there to offer dance guidance\, the free practice is meant to
  be a "you're responsible for yourself" space.<br><br></i><br><b>🏠 HOUSE R
 ULES 🏠</b><br><u>No outside shoes </u>- bring indoor shoes or tape your ou
 tside shoes with american tape provided by us.<br><br><u>No drinks are sold
  in our studio.</u> If you wish to bring drinks\, please dispose of them ap
 propiately: bring back the bottles with you or leave the bottles in the cra
 tes in the garden.<br>See you Fridays! 💗
