 owing everyone to dance\, <br>or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br
 ><br>Generous donations for the band and dj <br>are highly appreciated and 
 expected.<br><br>TIME TABLE<br>20:00 - Doors<br>20:30 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Se
