 ple being responsible to run the free practice are not there to offer dance
  guidance\, the free practice is meant to be a "you're responsible for your
 self" space.<br><br></i><br><b>🏠 HOUSE RULES 🏠</b><br><u>No outside shoes
  </u>- bring indoor shoes or tape your outside shoes with american tape pro
 vided by us.<br><br><u>No drinks are sold in our studio.</u> If you wish to
  bring drinks\, please dispose of them appropiately: bring back the bottles
  with you or leave the bottles in the crates in the garden.<br>See you Frid
 ays! 💗
