 q&c[0]=AT2OlMA1lMM9adHAJy4vbH3H9dSsqfOZn2RuXVAha_b00i-lR17c0uON4h1NL98kSVMy
 c41oTmJt1P_XJLt_7aNnaVQAePB8KtXx8twk4KK-yLit1H4K33sfkp52ULL9yslUehNRvA4MsFR
 pKeO048pv2MBhu3XefWo" target="_blank">www.swingbase.de/winterhop</a><br><br
 >//<br>Our dance floor will be open to beginners\, experienced dancers\, an
 d everyone who wants to try something new and exciting!<br>The Swing Base d
 ance school will make the audience dance to the rhythm of the 1920s to 1940
 s at Maison de France!<br>📢 PROGRAM 📢<br>📌 6:45 PM Doors open<br>📌 9-9:
 30 PM DJ<br>📌 from 9:30 PM Live Band<br>Party until 1:00 AM<br>🎺 Live Ban
 d: The Big Five<br>📍 Kurfürstendamm 211\, 10719 Berlin<br><br>We'll have s
 ome tickets available at the door. Check the Facebook event to see if it’s 
 sold out.<br>-------------<br>Join the Berlin Winter Hop (06.-07.12.) event
  for Dance Workshop &amp\; great Swing Parties! Friday night kicks off at I
 nstitut Français with Christmas lights on Kurfürstendamm\, followed by a Sa
 turday night party at the elegant Peter Edel Ballroom\, with showcases and 
