DESCRIPTION:<p>Experience a swing eve under the Sky! 🌌</p><p>This Tuesday\
 , 12th of September\, swap the indoors for the mesmerizing sunset views of 
 Tempelhofer Feld as you sway to the rhythmic tunes of 'The Big Five'. 🎷🎸
 🎺🎹</p><p>Although Wilde Renate is off the table\, the music's still on! B
 ask in the aura of LIVE melodies that promise to keep your swing wild and f
 ree.</p><p><span>🎵 </span><strong>The Big Five </strong><span>:</span><br>
 </p><ul><li>🎷 Daniel Duspiwa - Tenor sax</li><li>🎺 Christian Ahrens - Tru
 mpet</li><li>🎷 Florent Mannant - Bari Sax</li><li>🎸🎤 Jack Latimer - Guit
 ar &amp\; Vocals</li><li>🎹 Andrej Hermlin - Piano</li><li>🎻 Malte Tönißen
  - Double Bass</li><li>🥁🎤 David Hermlin - Drums &amp\; Vocals</li></ul><p
 >A kind donation of 7 - 10 € is recommended. Show some love for their incre
 dible talent! 💙</p><p>See you there for an unforgettable musical evening! 
 🌅🎶</p><p>In association with Swing Base.</p><p>www.swingbase.de</p>
