DESCRIPTION:Listen up\, you lovely people! <br /><br />It’s about time for 
 Miss Viper Lil to enter a new decade - and that's a great occasion to celeb
 rate the amazing community that makes life so beautiful and fills it with s
 o many moments of gratitude. <br />  <br />Yes — that includes you. Wonderf
 ul people\, young and old\, fresh and dusty. <br />Musicians\, dancers\, an
 d everyone in between.<br />All of you who want to spark greatness and joy\
 , making this brief moment of consciousness called life so valuable. <br />
   <br />So let’s celebrate — knowing that we’re all navigating difficult ti
 mes\, differences\, and quite a few challenges. <br />Let’s come together\,
  be a light in the darkness\, and sparkle the heck out of it (and dress lik
 e you mean it).<br />Let’s be silly\, creative\, and shiny.<br />  <br />To
  life and kindness. <br />Cheers !<br /><b><br /></b>What to expect:  <br /
 ><br />Crack Bellmer — 25.01.26<br />Doors open at 6 pm (you know the drill
 : come early and stay late. <br />Don’t forget to take Monday off if you ca
 n.)<br />  <br />Live music:<br />Careless Cats<br />Stef Rosen &amp\; Marc
 o Jovanović…and possibly some surprises...<br />  <br />DJs:<br />Chris Wil
 d<br />Duke Enric<br />Miss Viper Lil <b><br />  <br /></b>Bring your spark
 ly self — and whoever you’d like to join.   <br />*Instead of presents\, ex
 tra generous donations for artists and the bar are highly appreciated.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T161133Z
LOCATION:Crack Bellmer\, Revaler Str. 99\, 10245 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Isle of You  w/ Careless Cats & Stef Rosen  LIVE
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
