DESCRIPTION:Although the best parties are the ones you don't know about her
 e finally comes some information about "The Cabaret" - Cirque du Solo's off
 icial party.\n\n12th November - from 10 pm to open end\nJeder ist Tanzbar\,
  Berlin\n\nThe party starts pretty late - and it runs pretty late! You will
  have enough time after the workshop to relaxe\, recover\, rehearse (some o
 f us ar crazy!)\, have a nice dinner and espresso\, dress up fancy in circu
 s style and then arrive sharp at 10 pm!\n\nNext to a lot of dancing to fine
 st music (by excellent DJs) we have planned some very nice entertainment fo
 r you.\n\n\nCabaret Show\n\nBe surprised and fascinated by several amazing 
 acts we could gather from all over the world to come here just for this eve
 nt!\n\n\nDress Up Contest\n\nEver thought that people don't appreciate your
  sense of fashion? Show them better and participate in the Dress Up Contest
 ! You might win something stupid if the judges like your style (more inform
 ation about the dresscode see below)!\n\n\nGoodnight Circus (Live)\n\nYeah\
 , you read right. We could get world's most famous circus swing band for th
 is evening. And they will be putting up a special show for you.\nhttp://www
 .myspace.com/goodnightcircus\n\n\nDresscode: 30's Cabaret & Circus\n\nYeah\
 , it's dress up time! But not that boring evening dress. Get your fancy Cab
 aret or Circus outfit out of the wardrobe. You don't have one? So get out y
 our best evening dress and burn a hole! And if you're swell you might win s
 omething stupid (see above)...\n\n\nEntrance Fee\n\nEvery party has it's pr
 ice! But we know that some of you are poor students and broke bums\, we rea
 lly... we really don't care! Anyways - you can play your luck to get in che
 aper as you deserve it:\n\nLet the dice decide if you pay 7 € or 12 €!\n\nU
 PDATE: There will be a "coward fix price offer" of 9\,50 € for those of you
  who are feared of playing the dice!\n\n\nmore information on the official 
 website:\nhttp://www.cirque-du-solo.com/thecabaret/\n\nAlso visit the event
  on Facebook:\nhttp://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=316323421717426\n-OF-
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T010957Z
LOCATION:Jeder ist Tanzbar\, Rudolfstraße 1-8 berlin
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cirque du Solo - The Cabaret
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
