DESCRIPTION:<u></u><span><br><b><br>JAM CATS meet IRIS ROMEN<br></b><br>One
  of the idea behind JAM CATS <br>is to make a situation happen where people
  just meet on stage. <br><br>This time we are so pleased to welcome Iris Ro
 men <br>to open the Jam with some of the finest hot jazz cats of the scene.
  <br>Iris has collaborated with some of the biggest names <br>around the vi
 ntage/jazz scene such as <br>Ray Collins\, Andrej Hermlin or Astrid North <
 br>and we are very much looking forward to have her <br>and her band mates 
 on board! <br><br>Be ready for a swinging night!<br><br>LINE UP: <br>Iris R
 omen: vox and bass<br>Laurin H. Bert: reeds<br>Carlos St Ana: p and tb<br>G
 eorge Aschmann: violin and vox<br>Laurent Humeau: trumpet <br>Micha: Drums<
 br>Alexey Wagner: guitar<br><br><br></span><a href="https://www.facebook.co
 m/events/947871299540328">https://www.facebook.com/events/947871299540328</
 a><br><span><br><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION ♫<br><br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <b
 r><br>The Jam Cats live session finally returns to carry on <br>the legacy 
 of old jazz mingling live sessions and DJ-sets.<br>We want everyone to have
  fun\, dancers and musicians alike <br>with a stage open for early Jazz\, S
 wing\, RnB\, and other fun styles to dance to <br>with a focus on Balboa si
 nce we are operating with Bellmer Balboa. <br>The jam will be run by member
 s of the Syncopation Society <br>to ensure that the party flows\, allowing 
 everyone to dance\, <br>or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br>Gener
 ous donations for the band and dj <br>are highly appreciated and expected.<
 br><br>TIME TABLE<br>20:00 - Doors<br>20:30 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Set 2 + gues
 ts<br>23:00 - JAM CATS<br><br><span>⚠</span> Corona <span>⚠</span><br>The o
 fficial restrictions are lifted for now\, <br>but we still kindly ask\, wel
 l implore you <br>to do a test before you come anyway.<br>Let's stay safe a
 nd protect each other<br>as much as we can ! <br>Come early and stay late !
 <br><br>  <br><span>⚜</span> DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS <span>⚜</span><br>We 
 are happy to see new faces in the scene\, <br>come to the JAM CATS grants y
 ou free entrance <br>and 1 or 2 drinks if you play. <br>Just keep in mind t
 hat this is a DANCE EVENT <br>and it implies to be reactive and to keep you
 r solos short and sweet. <br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be react
 ive on stage. <br>If you want to play\, make it clear and talk to one of th
 e musicians on stage <br>to see when is a good time to step in.<br><br>Ther
 e's a piano on the stage with atmospheric amplification.</span><br><br><br>
 <br><br>- - - - - <br><br><span>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on eve
 ry Tuesday ! <br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz.
  <br><br><br>If you like to party <br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz musi
 c\, <br>you will have a good time at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous d
 onations for bands and djs <br>are highly appreciated and expected !<br><br
 >- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revaler Straße &a
 mp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it's the firs
 t bar to your right. <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalbo
 a">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></u>
