 Ring in the New Year with style at the Swingin' New Year's Party in Berlin!
  Join us at the Peter Edel Ballroom for an unforgettable night of music and
  dance\, featuring The Big Five - Berlin's beloved swing band - joined by n
 ot one but two sensational vocalists: Nicolle Rochelle and Sam Ghezzi! <br>
 <br>Experience the magic of swing music infused with passion and energy for
  an incredible New Year's Eve.<br><br>Full program: <a href="https://www.fa
 cebook.com/events/456362643635590" target="_blank">https://www.facebook.com
 /events/456362643635590</a><br><br><span>⏰ 21:00: DJ Aaron sets the mood</s
 pan><br>⏰ 21:30 - 01:00: Live Music with The Big Five ft. Nicolle Rochelle 
 &amp\; Sam Ghezzi (3 sets)<br><br>🎟️ Tickets at the door: 30€ <br><br>📆 D
 ate: 26/01/2025 <br>📍 Location: Peter Edel Ballroom\, Berliner Allee 125\,
  13088 Berlin<br><br><br>(Main festival parties for Swing It Berlin! are so
 ld out\, so don't miss this chance.)
