DESCRIPTION:<span><span>Join us for a sensational evening of dancing <br>to
  the music of the heavenly </span></span><span><span><span>high-spirited</s
 pan></span></span><span><span><b> <br>Siberian Hotheads  LIVE ! ! !  </b></
 span></span><span><span><span><b>*</b></span></span></span><br><span><span>
 <b><br>Come early and stay late !</b><br>-<br>The <b>band</b> will start <b
 >at 21:00.</b> <br>-<br>They are: <br></span></span>Niklas Carlsson - Trump
 et / vocals<br>Leon Falk - Trombone<br>Björn Bäckström - Saxophone/clarinet
 <br>Jens Waltin - Piano<br>Jonas Hellgren - Bass<br>Nils Nygårdh - Drums<br
 ><span><span><br>- <br>19:30 - 21:00  DJ <br><b>21:00 - 21:45  </b></span><
 /span><span><span><span><b>Siberian Hotheads  LIVE</b></span></span></span>
 <span><span><br>21:45 - 22:15  DJ<b><br>22:15 - 23:00  </b></span></span><s
 pan><span><span><b>Siberian Hotheads  LIVE</b></span></span></span><span><s
 pan><br>23:00 - 2:30  DJ<br><br>-<br>Generous donations for bands and djs<b
 r>are highly appreciated and expected.<br>_<br><br></span></span><b>*<br></
 b>The Siberian Hotheads is a Stockholm-based sextet <br>playing a unique mi
 x of jazz styles best captured by the late 1940’s. <br>Originating from an 
 area of Stockholm colloquially known as ‘Siberia’\, <br>the band has since 
 2021 developed their own characteristic sound and style <br>and established
  themselves as one of the hottest bands on the Swedish swing dance scene. <
 br>Inspired by jazz giants such as Roy Eldridge\, Illinois Jacquet\, Duke E
 llington\, and Machito\, a dash of traditional jazz is seamlessly mixed wit
 h swing arrangements\, early bop\, and latin american influences into a tru
 ly original concoction which is delivered with a vibrancy and authenticity 
 that has become a trademark of the Siberian Hotheads. <br><span><span><span
 ><span>  <br>  <br>   <br>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
 ::::::::::<br><br><br><br>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on every Tue
 sday.<br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz. <br><br
 ><br>If you like to party <br><br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, 
 <br><br>you will have a good time at Bellmer Balboa. </span><br><br><br>Gen
 erous donations for bands and djs <br>are highly appreciated and expected !
 <br><br>- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revaler St
 raße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it's t
 he first bar to your right. <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bellm
 erbalboa" target="_blank">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span>
 </span></span>
