DESCRIPTION:<u></u><span dir="auto"><br>We've got a great last Jam Cats com
 ing up this month <br>to keep our spirits high and kick off the last bit of
  2022. <br><br>Here we go:<br><br>Jack B. Latimer – Guitar<br>David Hermlin
  – Drums<br>Ben Lehmann – Bass<br>Andrea Schwemer – Clarinet <br>Daniel Dus
 piwa – Tenor Sax<br>Johannes Böhmer – Trumpet<br><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION
  ♫<br><br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats live session finally return
 s <br>to carry on the legacy of old jazz mingling live sessions and DJ-sets
 .<br>We want everyone to have fun\, dancers and musicians alike <br>with a 
 stage open for early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, and other fun styles <br>to dance
  to with a focus on Balboa <br>since we are operating with Bellmer Balboa. 
 <br><br>The jam will be run by members of the Syncopation Society <br>to en
 sure that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, <br>or to simply s
 it back and enjoy the music.<br><br>Generous donations for the band and dj 
 <br>are highly appreciated and expected.<br><br>TIME TABLE<br>20:00 - Doors
 <br>20:30 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Set 2 + guests<br>23:00 - JAM CATS<br><br><spa
 n>⚠</span> Corona <span>⚠</span><br>The official restrictions are lifted fo
 r now\, <br>but we still kindly ask\, well implore you <br>to do a test bef
 ore you come anyway.<br><br>Let's stay safe and protect each other<br>as mu
 ch as we can ! Come early and stay late !<br><br>  <br><span>⚜</span> DISCL
 AIMER FOR MUSICIANS <span>⚜</span><br>We are happy to see new faces in the 
 scene\, <br>come to the JAM CATS grants you free entrance <br>and 1 or 2 dr
 inks if you play. <br>Just keep in mind that this is a DANCE EVENT <br>and 
 it implies to be reactive and to keep your solos <br>short and sweet. <br><
 br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on stage. <br>If you w
 ant to play\, make it clear and <br>talk to one of the musicians on stage <
 br>to see when is a good time to step in. <br><br>There's a piano on the st
 age with atmospheric amplification.</span><br><br>Come to dance and jam wit
 h us ! <br><br><br>- - - - - <br><br><span>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes
  <br>on every Tuesday ! <br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styl
 es of Jazz. <br><br><br>If you like to party <br>and enjoy Swing dancing an
 d Jazz music\, <br>you will have a good time at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br
 >Generous donations for bands and djs <br>are highly appreciated and expect
 ed !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revale
 r Straße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it
 's the first bar to your right. <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/b
 ellmerbalboa">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250118T123635Z
