 now behind us <br>and we want to celebrate this very first edition of the f
 estival. <br>We invite you warmly to join the orga-team <br>who will open t
 he session for the occasion <span>😃</span><br><br>Nina Thaler: Vocals<br>K
 at Wegner: Trumpet<br>Florent Mannant: Reeds<br>Oliver Fuhrmann: Piano<br>A
 ndrea Ramírez Ruiz: Guitar<br>Ben Lehmann: Bass<br>François Perdriau: Drums
 <br><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION ♫<br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats l
 ive session finally returns to carry on the legacy of old jazz mingling liv
 e sessions and DJ-sets.<br>We want everyone to have fun\, dancers and music
 ians alike with a stage open for early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, and other fun s
 tyles to dance to with a focus on Balboa since we are operating with Bellme
 r Balboa. <br>The jam will be run by members of the Syncopation Society to 
 ensure that the party flows\, allowing everyone to dance\, or to simply sit
  back and enjoy the music.<br>Generous donations for the band and dj are hi
 ghly appreciated and expected.<br><br>TIME TABLE<br>20:00 - Doors<br>20:30 
 - Set 1<br>22:00 - Set 2 + guests<br>23:00 - JAM CATS<br><br><span>⚠</span>
  Corona <span>⚠</span><br>The official restrictions are lifted for now\, <b
 r>but we still kindly ask\, well implore you <br>to do a test before you co
 me anyway.<br><br>Let's stay safe and protect each other<br>as much as we c
 an ! <br><br>Come early and stay late !<br><br>  <br><span>⚜</span> DISCLAI
 MER FOR MUSICIANS <span>⚜</span><br>We are happy to see new faces in the sc
 ene\, come to the JAM CATS grants you free entrance and 1 or 2 drinks if yo
 u play. Just keep in mind that this is a DANCE EVENT and it implies to be r
 eactive and to keep your solos short and sweet. <br>If you are up for it\, 
 be prepared to be reactive on stage. If you want to play\, make it clear an
 d talk to one of the musicians on stage to see when is a good time to step 
 in. <br>There's a piano on the stage with atmospheric amplification.</span>
 <br><br>- - - - - <br><br><span>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on eve
 ry Tuesday ! <br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz.
  <br><br><br>If you like to party <br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz musi
 c\, <br>you will have a good time at Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous d
 onations for bands and djs <br>are highly appreciated and expected !<br><br
 >- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of Revaler Straße &a
 mp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&gt\; it's the firs
 t bar to your right. <br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalbo
 a">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></u></html-blob>
