 br>If you want to take a break or want to hang out you can go for a coffee/
 drink or some snacks in the entrance room of the cafe ☕🍰🍪 <br><br>The soc
 ial is an event open for all levels\, no matter if you are shagging very ac
 tively or if your shag is a bit rusty.<br><br>We can play music with open w
 indows and we have big ventilators to keep you shagging without breaking a 
