DESCRIPTION:<b>EVERY LAST FRIDAY OF THE MONTH! <br><br>Free practice 18:00 
 - 20:00 <br>Tea dance 20:00 - 22:00 (3-7 euro donation) </b><br><b><br></b>
 <br><b>💥FREE PRACTICE 💥</b><br>Come to our studio from 18:00 to 20:00 and
  practice your dance for free! Open to everyone (not only students of the s
 chool).<br><br>The space is open every Friday and a DJ set list is on: you 
 can come alone or with fellow friends &amp\; students to practice what you 
 learned in classes or wish to learn from clips &amp\; other forms of inspir
 ation.<br><br><i>Note: people being responsible to run the free practice ar
 e not there to offer dance guidance\, the free practice is meant to be a "y
 ou're responsible for yourself" space.<br><br></i><b>💥TEA DANCE 💥</b><br>
 Social dance from 20:00 to 22:00 in the studio! <br><br>Donation required t
 o enter (sliding scale 3 to 7 euros)<br><br><i><br></i><b>🏠 HOUSE RULES 🏠
 </b><br><u>No outside shoes </u>- bring indoor shoes or tape your outside s
 hoes with american tape provided by us.<br><br><u>No drinks are sold in our
  studio.</u> If you wish to bring drinks\, please dispose of them appropiat
 ely: bring back the bottles with you or leave the bottles in the crates in 
 the garden.<br><br>See you Fridays! 💗
LAST-MODIFIED:20260123T141740Z
LOCATION:Rayuela Swing\, Großgörschenstraße 28\, 10829 Berlin\, Germany
