DESCRIPTION:<span><br>Welcome to Shag Jam Berlin\, our shag social in Café
  Fincan Neukölln <span>👯‍♂️</span><span>🤗</span><br><span> </span><br>Sp
 ecial edition for the 3rd anniversary of Shag Jam <span>🎉</span><span>🎂</
 span><br> <br><span>⚡</span> 15:00-18:00 Dj Music/Live band<br>Band: Katz B
 löffmann Project <span>🎵</span><br><span> </span><br>Mats (aka Katz Blöffm
 ann) - Violin<br>Oli (aka Uri Clockstone) - Piano<br>Anna (aka Fiffi Turin)
  - Banjo<br>Paloma - Clarinet<br> <br>This time\, we're doing a potluck! So
  feel free to bring something sweet or salty to share with everyone <span>
 🍰</span><span>🍪</span><br><span> </span><br>Cafe Fincan has a beautiful b
 ack room of 55m2 with a great dance floor. We'll be playing a variety of sh
 ag music with different tempos to keep you dancing <span>🎵</span><br><span
 > </span><br>If you want to take a break or just want to hang out you can g
 o for a coffee/drink or some snacks in the entrance area of the café <span>
 ☕</span><span>🍰</span><span>🍪</span><br><span> </span><br>The social is o
 pen to all levels\, whether you're dancing actively or you're just a little
  rusty with your shag steps.<br> <br>We’ll keep things cool with open windo
 ws and large fans\, so you can keep shagging without breaking a sweat <span
 >💨</span><br><span> </span><br>If at any point you feel uncomfortable or o
 verwhelmed\, whether by a person or a situation\, please don’t hesitate to 
 come to us at any time!<br> <br>We also welcome any feedback you might have
  after the event <span>👍</span><br><span> </span><br>This is a donation-ba
 sed event\, and all contributions will support Café Fincan. Pay as much as 
 you feel is appropriate <span>😊</span><br><span> </span><br><span>⚡</span>
  Date and time : May 9th 2026. 15:00-18:00<br> <br>We look forward to seein
 g you there and shagging with you <span>👯‍♂️</span></span><br>For more inf
 ormation about the class or social\, visit: <a href="http://www.facebook.co
 m/shagjam" target="_blank">www.facebook.com/shagjam</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260428T081416Z
LOCATION:Fincan\, Altenbraker Str. 26\, 12051 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Shag Jam 3rd Anniversary LIVE Katz Blöffmann Project
