 sch und anderes zur Gemütlichkeit und Glühen dazu...\n\nORT: James Simon Pa
 rk\, Kleiner Monbijoupark\n\nStadtbahnbogen 151\, 10178 Berlin\n\nM1\, 4\, 
 5\, 6\nS Hackescher Markt\n\n--------\n\nYes\, we gonna celebrate Xmas\, Ha
 nukka etcetera with a good old hop outside.\nThis time at Museumsinsel\,  o
 pposite the Colonnades.\n\nBring your favourite hot drinks and persons with
  you. Whatever makes you happy.
