DESCRIPTION:Join us in Hank Chinaski for some dancing or hanging out with l
 ive music by\n\nKatz Blöffmann Trio feat. Emma Schwemmer\n\nHank Chinaski i
 s a cozy bar with drinks and food in the heart of Wedding. The band plays a
