DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><span dir="auto"><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION ♫
 <br>HEY\, YOU COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats live session finally returns to c
 arry on the legacy of old jazz mingling live sessions and DJ-sets.<br>We wa
 nt everyone to have fun\, dancers and musicians alike with a stage open for
  early Jazz\, Swing\, RnB\, and other fun styles to dance to with a focus o
 n Balboa since we are operating with Bellmer Balboa. <br>The jam will be ru
 n by members of the Syncopation Society to ensure that the party flows\, al
 lowing everyone to dance\, or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br>Ge
 nerous donations for the band and dj are highly appreciated and expected.<b
 r><br>TIME TABLE<br>19:30 - Doors<br>20:00 - 21:00 Opening Set<br>21:30 - J
 am<br>0:00 - Dj<br><br>Corona <br>The official restrictions are lifted for 
 now\, but we still kindly ask\, well implore you to do a test before you co
 me anyway.<br>Let's stay safe and protect each other<br>as much as we can !
  Come early and stay late !<br><br>  <br>DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS <br>We ar
 e happy to see new faces in the scene\, come to the JAM CATS grants you fre
 e entrance and 1 or 2 drinks if you play. Just keep in mind that this is a 
 DANCE EVENT and it implies to be reactive and to keep your solos short and 
 sweet. <br>If you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on stage. If y
 ou want to play\, make it clear and talk to one of the musicians on stage t
 o see when is a good time to step in. <br>There's a piano on the stage with
  atmospheric amplification.</span><br><br><br>- - - - - <br><br><span>Beaut
 iful Balboa beats and tunes <br>on every Tuesday ! <br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo
  and slow. <br><br>All styles of Jazz. <br><br><br>If you like to party <br
 >and enjoy Swing dancing and Jazz music\, <br>you will have a good time at 
 Bellmer Balboa. <br><br><br>Generous donations for bands and djs <br>are hi
 ghly appreciated and expected !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area 
 at the corner <br>of Revaler Straße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the s
 tairs and then <br>&gt\; it's the first bar to your right. <br><br><a href=
 "https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerba
 lboa</a></span><u></u></html-blob>
