  This time\, we’re bringing you not just one but two amazing bands to eleva
 te your dance experience: The Big Five and Eldar Tsalikov &amp\; The Smacks
  Of Love.</p><p>⏰ 21:00: DJ </p><p>⏰ 21:30 - 02:00:The Big Five and Eldar T
 salikov &amp\; The Smacks Of Love\, Showcases\, Dance Competition</p><p>📍S
 aturday Party: Peter Edel Ballroom (Berliner Allee 125\, 13088 Berlin)</p><
 p>Join the Berlin Winter Hop (28.-30.11.) event! Friday night kicks off at 
 Institut Français with Christmas lights on Kurfürstendamm\, followed by a S
 aturday night party at the elegant Peter Edel Ballroom\, with showcases and
  a “30s showcase competition”! 🎉</p><p><a href="http://www.swingbase.de/wi
 nterhop" target="_blank">www.swingbase.de/winterhop</a></p>
