DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><span><span><span><span dir="auto"><br
 >It is with heavy hearts <br>that we greet our dear friends <br>from the Go
 odnight Circus goodbye. <br>This band has been a founding stone <br>for the
  Berlin swing scene and inspired many of us. <br>Now the circus is packing 
 camp to travel to the far west. <br>But before they do so they will present
  <br>yet another album and leave Berlin with a BANG! <br>&nbsp\; <br>Long l
 ive the circus!!! </span><br><br>♫ THE JAM CATS SESSION ♫<br><br>HEY\, YOU 
 COOL CATS! <br>The Jam Cats live session finally returns to carry on the le
 gacy of old jazz mingling live sessions and DJ-sets.<br>We want everyone to
  have fun\, dancers and musicians alike with a stage open for early Jazz\, 
 Swing\, RnB\, and other fun styles to dance to with a focus on Balboa since
  we are operating with Bellmer Balboa. <br>The jam will be run by members o
 f the Syncopation Society to ensure that the party flows\, allowing everyon
 e to dance\, or to simply sit back and enjoy the music.<br>Generous donatio
 ns for the band and dj are highly appreciated and expected.<br><br>TIME TAB
 LE<br>19:30 - Doors<br>20:00 - 21:00 Opening Set<br>21:30 - Jam<br>0:00 - D
 j<br><br>Corona <br>The official restrictions are lifted for now\, but we s
 till kindly ask\, well implore you to do a test before you come anyway.<br>
 Let's stay safe and protect each other<br>as much as we can ! Come early an
 d stay late !<br><br>  <br>DISCLAIMER FOR MUSICIANS <br>We are happy to see
  new faces in the scene\, come to the JAM CATS grants you free entrance and
  1 or 2 drinks if you play. Just keep in mind that this is a DANCE EVENT an
 d it implies to be reactive and to keep your solos short and sweet. <br>If 
 you are up for it\, be prepared to be reactive on stage. If you want to pla
 y\, make it clear and talk to one of the musicians on stage to see when is 
 a good time to step in. <br>There's a piano on the stage with atmospheric a
 mplification.</span><br>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
 :::::::::::::::::::::::::::::<br><br>Beautiful Balboa beats and tunes <br>o
 n every Tuesday.<br><br>Fast\, mid-tempo and slow. <br><br>All styles of Ja
 zz. <br><br><br>If you like to party <br><br>and enjoy Swing dancing and Ja
 zz music\, <br><br>you will have a good time at Bellmer Balboa. </span><br>
 <br><br>Generous donations for bands and djs <br>are highly appreciated and
  expected !<br><br>- - - - -<br><br>Enter the RAW-area at the corner <br>of
  Revaler Straße &amp\; Simon-Dach-Straße <br>down the stairs and then <br>&
 gt\; it's the first bar to your right. <br><br><a href="https://www.faceboo
 k.com/bellmerbalboa">https://www.facebook.com/bellmerbalboa</a></span><u></
 u><u></u></html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250128T132553Z
LOCATION:Crack Bellmer\, Revaler Str. 99\, 10245 Berlin\, Deutschland
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bellmer Balboa - Jam Cats *Special* - Goodnight Circus release & go
 ing away party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
